('67', '28', 'Double Girder Overhead Crane', 'double-girder-overhead-crane', NULL, 'portal/20260521/83c90fd6b31d0c6934028e68cd474458.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260521\\/83c90fd6b31d0c6934028e68cd474458.webp\",\"name\":\"Double Girder Overhead Crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260424\\/18005616fecbb8d2e6bd81cb208b976e.webp\",\"name\":\"Double Girder Overhead Crane1.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260424\\/4fc4edf231aca27ad1fcf44888d20df3.webp\",\"name\":\"Double Girder Overhead Crane2.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260424\\/4351f4f2922ca13218213b8c1a364bf8.webp\",\"name\":\"Double Girder Overhead Crane3.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260424\\/62da76bac1ac17848a8ed7d2ad110c63.webp\",\"name\":\"Double Girder Overhead Crane5.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '5~100ton', '12-22meter', '10.5~31.5meter', '3 Phrase  A.C. 50Hz 380V or others', 'A5-A6', 'Double Girder Overhead Crane is used in steel plants, warehouses, and heavy industries for high-capacity and efficient material handling.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8; overflow-x: auto;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;The Double Girder Overhead Crane is a heavy-duty lifting solution designed for handling large and complex loads in demanding industrial environments.
With its robust double beam structure and advanced control system, it provides exceptional lifting performance, high efficiency, and long-term operational reliability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;The crane adopts a &lt;strong&gt;double girder bridge structure&lt;/strong&gt; made from high-strength steel, ensuring superior rigidity and load-bearing capacity.
Compared with single girder cranes, it allows for &lt;strong&gt;higher lifting heights and larger capacities&lt;/strong&gt;, making it ideal for heavy-duty applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Its &lt;strong&gt;electric hoisting trolley runs on rails mounted on top of the girders&lt;/strong&gt;, maximizing hook height and improving working efficiency.
The bridge traveling mechanism enables smooth longitudinal movement along runway rails, ensuring flexible coverage across wide working areas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Equipped with &lt;strong&gt;high-performance motors, precision transmission systems, and reliable braking devices&lt;/strong&gt;, the crane ensures stable, accurate, and safe lifting operations.
The integrated electrical control system supports multiple control modes, including pendant control, remote control, and cabin operation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Key Specifications --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Lifting Capacity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;5 ton – 800 ton&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Span Range&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;10.5 m – 31.5 m&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Lifting Height&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;12 m – 22 m (customizable)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Control Method&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Pendant / Remote / Cabin Control&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Application --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f9fafb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 24px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Application Areas&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Steel plants and heavy manufacturing industries&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Machinery production workshops and assembly lines&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Warehouses and logistics distribution centers&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Railway yards, ports, and container handling areas&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Chemical plants and large-scale industrial facilities&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Safety / Notes --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #fff7f7; border: 1px solid #f3d6d6; border-left: 5px solid #e53935; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #b91c1c;&quot;&gt;Important Notes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 15px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Regular inspection and maintenance are required to ensure safe operation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Not suitable for hazardous environments without explosion-proof or special configurations&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Custom design is recommended for extreme temperatures or corrosive conditions&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
