&lt;!-- Title --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 28px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Customized Double Girder Overhead Crane Solutions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane provides fully customized Double Girder Overhead Crane solutions for heavy-duty industrial applications, ensuring high performance, stability, and reliability in complex working conditions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Key parameters such as &lt;strong&gt;lifting capacity, span, lifting height, and working duty&lt;/strong&gt; can be flexibly customized to meet different workshop layouts and production requirements, making it ideal for handling heavy loads efficiently.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Configurations --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Optional Configurations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Cabin control, remote control, or pendant control options&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Frequency conversion drive for smooth operation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anti-sway system for precise load positioning&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Overload protection and multiple safety limit devices&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Explosion-proof and high-temperature resistant configurations&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
