('68', '23', 'Rubber Tyred Container Gantry Cranes', 'Rubber-Tyred-Container-Gantry-Cranes', NULL, 'portal/20260512/45885755a0d637517578872a67b2a79b.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260514\\/c5ec2bbd18be4bde23164ef022edc06a.webp\",\"name\":\"RTG_副本.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/45885755a0d637517578872a67b2a79b.webp\",\"name\":\"RTG Crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/b391b084fd887f0a0f9cc7b583bd0de9.webp\",\"name\":\"RTG.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/a04d3cd53aff89153499e0e4cdb0a46b.webp\",\"name\":\"Rubber Tyred Container Gantry Crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/56692866501e462b34846eed3bae7e09.webp\",\"name\":\"Rubber Tyred Container Gantry Cranes.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '5-40t', '12.2-17.8m', '23-47m', 'Electric, Diesel Engine, Electric-disel Engine', 'A6、A7、A8', 'Rubber Tyred Container Gantry Cranes are used in ports, container yards, and logistics terminals for efficient container handling and stacking operations.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;The Rubber Tyred Container Gantry Crane (RTG) is a highly efficient container handling solution widely used in ports, container yards, and logistics terminals.
With flexible rubber tire movement and advanced control systems, it ensures high stacking efficiency, precise positioning, and reliable operation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;This crane is designed for &lt;strong&gt;container stacking, loading, and unloading operations&lt;/strong&gt; in busy terminal environments.
Equipped with &lt;strong&gt;multi-lifting point spreaders&lt;/strong&gt;, it can handle various container sizes such as 20ft, 40ft, and 45ft containers with high efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;The RTG adopts a &lt;strong&gt;full hydraulic drive system&lt;/strong&gt; for both traveling and hoisting mechanisms, enabling stepless speed control and smooth operation.
Its closed hydraulic circuit provides &lt;strong&gt;high transmission efficiency, low failure rate, and stable performance&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;With &lt;strong&gt;360° steering capability&lt;/strong&gt; and flexible tire movement, the crane can move freely within container yards.
The integrated CAN-BUS control system ensures precise control, improved safety, and efficient operation management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Key Specifications --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Lifting Capacity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;5 ton – 40 ton&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Container Type&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;20ft / 40ft / 45ft Containers&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Steering Angle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;90° / 20° / 45° Multi-directional movement&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Drive System&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Full Hydraulic with Stepless Speed Control&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Key Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Flexible rubber tire movement with 360° steering capability&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Full hydraulic drive system with smooth and stepless speed control&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specialized spreaders for standard container handling&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Three-in-one reducer for stable performance and easy maintenance&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Advanced CAN-BUS control system for precise and intelligent operation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Equipped with safety indicators and overload protection devices&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Application --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f9fafb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 24px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Application Areas&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Container yards and port terminals&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Railway freight stations and intermodal logistics hubs&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Large-scale storage and transshipment areas&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;International logistics and shipping facilities&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Safety / Notes --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #fff7f7; border: 1px solid #f3d6d6; border-left: 5px solid #e53935; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #b91c1c;&quot;&gt;Important Notes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 15px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Regular hydraulic system inspection is required to maintain performance&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ensure stable ground conditions for safe crane operation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Custom configurations are available for special container handling needs&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
