&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anti-sway and precise positioning technology&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;GPS positioning and yard management system integration&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
