&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;The Ship-to-Shore Gantry Crane is a high-performance port lifting equipment designed for efficient container handling between vessels and terminals.
It supports lifting capacities of 38–60 tons under the spreader and is widely applied in modern container ports for high-efficiency loading and unloading operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;The crane features a &lt;strong&gt;rigid gantry structure with long outreach&lt;/strong&gt;, enabling it to serve large container ships with high precision.
With working levels up to &lt;strong&gt;A7–A8 duty class&lt;/strong&gt;, it is designed for continuous heavy-duty port operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Equipped with advanced hoisting and trolley systems, the crane delivers &lt;strong&gt;high-speed lifting up to 150 m/min and trolley travel up to 220 m/min&lt;/strong&gt;,
ensuring fast turnaround time and improved port efficiency.
Its robust structure and optimized dimensions provide excellent stability and long service life under demanding conditions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Key Specifications --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Lifting Capacity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;38 t – 60 t (above spreader)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Span Range&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;10.5 m – 22 m&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Lifting Height&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Above: 22–38 m / Below: 10–16 m&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Power Supply&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;380V, 50Hz, 3 Phase AC&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Application --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f9fafb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 24px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Application Areas&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Container terminals and seaports&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Large-scale logistics and shipping hubs&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Port cargo handling and vessel loading operations&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Automated and semi-automated port systems&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Limitation / Safety --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #fff7f7; border: 1px solid #f3d6d6; border-left: 5px solid #e53935; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #b91c1c;&quot;&gt;Important Notes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 15px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ensure proper rail selection (P50 / QU80 / QU100) based on load requirements&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Regular inspection is required for high-speed hoisting and trolley systems&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Suitable for port environments; anti-corrosion protection is recommended for coastal use&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
