('70', '23', 'RMG Rail Mounted Container Gantry Cranes', 'RMG-Rail-Mounted-Container-Gantry-Cranes', NULL, 'portal/20260512/ef43eb2cea273e15c2e88070f7fa6468.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/b7a24bf17edf56d0b52e0d17ac237726.webp\",\"name\":\"RMG Crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/ef43eb2cea273e15c2e88070f7fa6468.webp\",\"name\":\"RMG Cranes.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/d8fca1c2570ab3d9336342fa02eafab4.webp\",\"name\":\"RMG Rail Mounted Container Gantry Crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/033d3fbf2d3f09554412b0e6e7e31870.webp\",\"name\":\"RMG.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/90b586fbb933910c2dbe7b3fac47f57e.webp\",\"name\":\"weihua-container-gantry-crane.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '23.5~40.5t', '12.3~16m', '22~30m', '3 Phase,AC, 380V, 50Hz', 'A6、A7', 'RMG Rail Mounted Container Gantry Crane is used in container yards and railway terminals for stacking and handling containers along fixed tracks, providing efficient, stable, and high-capacity cargo management.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(55, 65, 81); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview Card --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The Rail Mounted Container Gantry Crane (RMG) is a high-efficiency lifting system specifically designed for container handling in ports, railway terminals, and logistics yards. It runs on rails and is equipped with a specialized container spreader for lifting 20’, 40’, and 45’ standard containers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;With a robust double girder gantry structure and advanced trolley system, the crane ensures stable operation, high lifting capacity, and precise positioning. It is ideal for container stacking, loading, and unloading operations in large-scale freight yards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;This RMG crane features variable frequency control for smooth speed regulation, improving operational efficiency and reducing mechanical wear. Equipped with high-performance motors and intelligent control systems, it provides reliable performance under continuous heavy-duty working conditions. Its modular design allows easy maintenance and long service life.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/58da1a3619a66cc5afd4a8828cb1ddb4.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Water Conservancy And Hydropower&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;The dam-top gantry crane is installed on the top of a hydropower station dam. It is mainly used for gate lifting and material handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/53f8e47cb680e45180638afe05fd7034.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Wind Power Industry&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Weihua cranes are widely used in offshore wind power projects, especially for wind turbine installation and large component handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/7c19456728d86c85236af98f565ce874.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Shipyard Cranes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Shipyard gantry cranes are designed for shipbuilding operations, including section lifting, turning, assembly, and launching.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/4a0f53f988ee6f3023455792bf0a34c6.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
