('71', '19', 'Single Beam Gantry Crane MH Type', 'single-beam-gantry-crane-mh-type', NULL, 'portal/20260513/4d840c9a324cc44d3fa11552682e51f9.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/4b61d8a06b2421b8d3fbfcfb29f0d1ab.webp\",\"name\":\"Single Beam Gantry Crane MH Type (5).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/4d840c9a324cc44d3fa11552682e51f9.webp\",\"name\":\"Single Beam Gantry Crane MH Type (4).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/4b61d8a06b2421b8d3fbfcfb29f0d1ab.webp\",\"name\":\"Single Beam Gantry Crane MH Type (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/4d840c9a324cc44d3fa11552682e51f9.webp\",\"name\":\"Single Beam Gantry Crane MH Type (3).webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '1-32t', '6-12m', '12-35m', 'AC 380V/220V, 50-60Hz', 'A5', 'The Single Beam Gantry Crane MH Type is widely used in logistics warehouses, manufacturing workshops, port terminals, and construction sites for efficient loading, unloading, and material handling, especially in environments with limited space.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8; overflow-x: auto;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;Single-beam hoist gantry crane is a common light and small lifting equipment. It is especially suitable for cargo loading and unloading operations in warehouses, factories and docks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;It mainly has the bridge frame (including main beam and end beam), electric hoist, trolley running mechanism and electrical control system. This type of gantry crane is popular for its compact structure, easy operation and small footprint.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;This gantry crane adopts a single-beam design, which means there is only one main beam spanning over two end beams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Its main beam is the main structural component that carries heavy objects, and its material selection and manufacturing process directly affect the safety and service life of the entire equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;As the core component of the lifting mechanism, the electric hoist is under the main beam and moves along the main beam to achieve vertical and horizontal material handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Electric hoists are divided into two types: wire rope electric hoists and chain electric hoists. Users could choose the appropriate model according to actual needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Main Application --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f9fafb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 24px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Main Application&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Logistics warehousing: used for loading, unloading and stacking of goods in warehouses, especially suitable for occasions with limited space.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Manufacturing workshop: supports material handling on the production line, helping to improve production efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Port terminal: performs loading and unloading tasks of containers or other heavy goods.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Construction site: participates in the handling of construction materials, such as steel bars, cement, etc.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Product Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 24px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Product Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;High efficiency and energy saving: Compared with traditional lifting equipment, single-beam hoist-type gantry crane has higher working efficiency and lower energy consumption.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;High safety: Equipped with multiple protection measures, such as overload protection, travel limit, etc., which effectively ensure the safety of operators and equipment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Easy maintenance: The structure is relatively simple, and daily maintenance and troubleshooting are relatively easy, which reduces maintenance costs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
