&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Key parameters such as &lt;strong&gt;lifting capacity, span, lifting height, and clearance under the gantry&lt;/strong&gt; can be flexibly customized to accommodate oversized loads such as containers, steel structures, and large equipment, making it ideal for yards, ports, and industrial sites.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Configurations --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Optional Configurations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Electric hoist trolley or winch trolley options&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Cabin control, remote control, or automated operation system&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Frequency conversion drive for smooth and stable operation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wind-resistant design with rail clamping and anchoring devices&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Customized design for different outdoor working environments&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Summary --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-left: 5px solid #22c55e; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #374151;&quot;&gt;Our engineering team ensures &lt;strong&gt;high load capacity, stable performance, and reliable outdoor operation&lt;/strong&gt;, providing efficient lifting solutions for ports, freight yards, construction sites, and heavy industrial applications.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
