('73', '22', 'Crane for Meltshop | Ladle Cranes', 'meltshop-ladle-crane', NULL, 'portal/20260509/668800193e502da0a9ef8b9ac0da8587.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260427\\/36bae7cb0a6889e8833e0b2c66da5da9.jpg\",\"name\":\"Crane for Meltshop  Ladle Cranes (1).jpg\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260427\\/bd913475fc2e20cd082f991cacea8f10.jpg\",\"name\":\"Crane for Meltshop  Ladle Cranes (2).jpg\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260427\\/1b3e3e97f06fb6d3ada58119ba915f8d.jpg\",\"name\":\"Crane for Meltshop  Ladle Cranes (3).jpg\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260427\\/57be94c9b55ba291f70ff6dabd2a6b0b.jpg\",\"name\":\"Crane for Meltshop  Ladle Cranes (4).jpg\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260427\\/88c401f20d65ca36c9657d47363975f0.jpg\",\"name\":\"Crane for Meltshop  Ladle Cranes (5).jpg\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20250107\\/17869a11265bf6d338c93f62d4c11143.png\",\"name\":\"CCS\"}]', '[]', '5t,10t,16t,20t,100/32t, 320/80t', '19.5-28.5m', '20/22m, 28/32m', 'AC 380V/220V, 50-60Hz', 'A7, A8', 'Overhead crane for metallurgy is a hot-selling product manufactured by Weihua. Main lifting mechanism lifts goods with fast speed to meet the requirement of efficient production.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;The Ladle Crane is a specialized heavy-duty lifting solution designed for handling molten metal in steel mills and metallurgical plants.
As a critical piece of equipment in smelting operations, it ensures safe, precise, and continuous transportation of molten steel and iron under extreme working conditions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Commonly referred to as a &lt;strong&gt;molten metal crane or metallurgical crane&lt;/strong&gt;, the ladle crane is engineered to perform &lt;strong&gt;lifting, tilting, and transferring of ladles&lt;/strong&gt; filled with high-temperature molten materials.
It plays a vital role in maintaining the stability and efficiency of the steel production process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Designed for &lt;strong&gt;extreme heat, heavy loads, and continuous operation&lt;/strong&gt;, the crane typically operates under &lt;strong&gt;A7 or A8 duty classifications&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring reliable performance in high-intensity industrial environments.
Its robust double girder structure, reinforced components, and heat-resistant design guarantee maximum safety and durability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Equipped with &lt;strong&gt;advanced safety systems&lt;/strong&gt; such as overload protection, limit switches, emergency braking, and redundant lifting mechanisms, the ladle crane ensures safe handling of molten metal.
Precision control systems provide smooth and accurate positioning, reducing operational risks and improving productivity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Key Specifications --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Lifting Capacity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;50 ton – 500 ton&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Working Duty&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;A7 / A8 Heavy Duty&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Working Environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;High-temperature metallurgical workshops&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Control Method&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Cabin / Remote Control&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Application --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f9fafb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 24px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Application Areas&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Steel plants and iron smelting workshops&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Non-ferrous metal processing plants&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Continuous casting production lines&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;High-temperature industrial environments&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Safety / Notes --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #fff7f7; border: 1px solid #f3d6d6; border-left: 5px solid #e53935; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #b91c1c;&quot;&gt;Important Notes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 15px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Designed specifically for molten metal handling; requires strict safety compliance&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Regular inspection of lifting mechanisms and heat-resistant components is essential&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Customized configurations are recommended based on plant layout and process requirements&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '', '[]', '', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Title --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 28px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Customized Crane for Meltshop | Ladle Crane Solutions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane provides fully customized ladle crane solutions designed for meltshop operations, ensuring safe, stable, and high-efficiency handling of molten metal in extreme high-temperature environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Key parameters such as &lt;strong&gt;lifting capacity, span, lifting height, working duty, and safety configuration&lt;/strong&gt; can be tailored to meet the stringent requirements of steelmaking processes, ensuring reliable transportation of molten steel and precise positioning during pouring operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Configurations --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
