&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dual hoisting mechanism for enhanced safety redundancy&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Heat-resistant insulation and protective shielding systems&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Frequency conversion control for smooth and precise operation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Intelligent monitoring and fault diagnosis system&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Emergency braking and backup safety systems&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Summary --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-left: 5px solid #22c55e; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #374151;&quot;&gt;Our engineering team ensures &lt;strong&gt;maximum safety, high reliability, and continuous heavy-duty operation&lt;/strong&gt;, providing critical lifting solutions for steel plants, foundries, and metallurgical industries.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
