('75', '28', 'Grab Bucket Overhead Crane QZ Type', 'grab-bucket-overhead-crane-qz-type', NULL, 'portal/20260427/6eee0011496ff64536e2e9ca739a679c.jpg', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260427\\/8add267e9cdc2ac0f6049e7975d5b573.jpg\",\"name\":\"Grab Bucket Overhead Crane QZ Type (1).jpg\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260427\\/f1b60cad327842ac68d442539eb4ebdc.jpg\",\"name\":\"Grab Bucket Overhead Crane QZ Type (2).jpg\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260427\\/3498fc54662efb135530166c053d82a1.jpg\",\"name\":\"Grab Bucket Overhead Crane QZ Type (3).jpg\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260427\\/73c74d7e8f5831f8585f6d4895ac1470.jpg\",\"name\":\"Grab Bucket Overhead Crane QZ Type (4).jpg\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260427\\/e5e2f801fec6e5220590dd06e7348378.jpg\",\"name\":\"Grab Bucket Overhead Crane QZ Type (5).jpg\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '5~25ton', '20-28meter', '10.5~34.5meter', 'AC 380V/220V, 50-60Hz', 'A6', 'Grab overhead cranes are widely used in power plants, yards, workshops, docks and other places for bulk material loading, unloading and transportation.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;The QZ Grab Bucket Overhead Crane is a high-efficiency lifting solution specially designed for handling bulk materials such as coal, ore, grain, and sand.
Equipped with an automatic grab system, it enables fast, continuous, and precise loading and unloading operations in heavy-duty industrial environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;This crane features a &lt;strong&gt;robust double girder bridge structure&lt;/strong&gt; combined with an electric trolley and intelligent control system, ensuring excellent stability and load-bearing capacity.
The bridge travels along runway rails, while the trolley moves horizontally on the girders, allowing &lt;strong&gt;full coverage and accurate positioning&lt;/strong&gt; within the working area.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;grab bucket is the core working device&lt;/strong&gt;, designed to efficiently grab, lift, and release bulk materials.
It supports various grab types depending on material characteristics, ensuring optimal performance in different handling scenarios.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Equipped with &lt;strong&gt;advanced electrical control systems&lt;/strong&gt;, the crane provides precise motion control, smooth operation, and enhanced safety.
Automation features such as automatic positioning and grab opening/closing significantly improve operational efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Key Specifications --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Lifting Capacity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;5 ton – 50 ton&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Grab Type&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Mechanical / Hydraulic Grab Bucket&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Working Duty&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;A6 / A7 Heavy Duty&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Control Method&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Cabin / Remote Control&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Key Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;High-capacity grab bucket for efficient bulk material handling&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Automated grab operation for improved efficiency and reduced labor&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stable double girder structure for heavy-duty working conditions&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Flexible configuration for different material types and densities&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Reliable electrical control system with precise positioning&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Suitable for continuous and high-frequency operation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Application --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f9fafb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 24px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Application Areas&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Port terminals and bulk cargo handling yards&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mining and mineral processing plants&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Power plants and coal handling systems&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Cement factories and raw material storage areas&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Grain storage facilities and agricultural warehouses&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Safety / Notes --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #fff7f7; border: 1px solid #f3d6d6; border-left: 5px solid #e53935; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #b91c1c;&quot;&gt;Important Notes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 15px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Select appropriate grab type based on material characteristics and working conditions&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Regular inspection of grab mechanism and lifting system is required&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Automation systems can be customized for higher efficiency and reduced manual operation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
