('76', '28', 'Electromagnetic Bridge Crane QC Type', 'electromagnetic-bridge-crane-qc-type', NULL, 'portal/20260427/0ea65a5f735d9e0d4a951917b3cb6331.jpg', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260427\\/53b026438a5938497be9b0cf9482cecf.jpg\",\"name\":\"Electromagnetic Bridge Crane QC Type (1).jpg\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260427\\/51ae2d73ed8f2380a98c78a90ef2122f.jpg\",\"name\":\"Electromagnetic Bridge Crane QC Type (2).jpg\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260427\\/3ff4d51c5f5697bc394c473e6b8873e0.jpg\",\"name\":\"Electromagnetic Bridge Crane QC Type (3).jpg\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260427\\/2a4eb8c0533f2701d63a69a0b6672923.jpg\",\"name\":\"Electromagnetic Bridge Crane QC Type (4).jpg\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260427\\/75223d4830a5e033d8f4991bb6f2dc66.jpg\",\"name\":\"Electromagnetic Bridge Crane QC Type (5).jpg\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '5-50t', '10.5-31.5m', '6-30m', 'AC 380V/220V, 50-60Hz', 'A6', 'QC Electromagnetic Bridge Crane is specially designed for magnetic materials like steel plates, scraps and iron products. With advanced electromagnetic technology, it ensures efficient and safe handling in heavy industry.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;The QC Electromagnetic Bridge Crane is a specialized lifting solution designed for handling magnetic materials such as steel plates, billets, scrap, and iron products.
Utilizing advanced electromagnetic technology, it enables fast, efficient, and safe material handling in heavy industrial environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;This crane features a &lt;strong&gt;robust bridge structure&lt;/strong&gt; combined with an electric trolley and electromagnetic lifting system, ensuring stable performance and high load capacity.
The bridge travels along runway rails, while the trolley moves horizontally across the girder, providing &lt;strong&gt;precise positioning and flexible operation&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;electromagnetic lifting device is the core component&lt;/strong&gt;, designed to quickly attract and release magnetic materials without the need for hooks or slings.
This significantly improves handling efficiency and reduces manual intervention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Equipped with &lt;strong&gt;advanced electrical control systems&lt;/strong&gt;, the crane allows adjustable magnetic force, smooth operation, and accurate control.
Safety systems such as backup power supply and anti-drop protection ensure secure lifting even in case of power failure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Key Specifications --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Lifting Capacity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;5 ton – 50 ton&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Lifting Type&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Electromagnetic Suction&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Working Duty&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;A6&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Control Method&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Cabin / Remote Control&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Key Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;High-efficiency lifting with electromagnetic suction technology&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adjustable magnetic force for different material sizes and weights&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;No need for hooks or slings, reducing labor intensity&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Backup power system to prevent load dropping during power failure&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Simple structure with easy maintenance and long service life&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fast material handling to improve overall operational efficiency&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Application --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f9fafb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 24px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Application Areas&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Steel mills and metal processing plants&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Machinery manufacturing workshops&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Metallurgical industries and raw material handling&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Harbor terminals and bulk magnetic cargo handling&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Safety / Notes --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #fff7f7; border: 1px solid #f3d6d6; border-left: 5px solid #e53935; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #b91c1c;&quot;&gt;Important Notes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 15px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Suitable only for lifting magnetic materials such as steel and iron products&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Regular inspection of electromagnetic system and power supply is required&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Backup power system must be maintained to ensure safety during operation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
