&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane provides fully customized Electromagnetic Bridge Crane (QC Type) solutions designed for efficient handling of ferromagnetic materials such as steel plates, billets, and scrap, ensuring high safety and productivity in heavy-duty operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
