&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Electromagnetic lifting system with multiple magnet options&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Backup power supply to prevent load dropping during power failure&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Frequency conversion control for smooth operation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Remote control, cabin control, or automated operation system&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
