('77', '25', 'Electric Suspension Crane', 'electric-suspension-crane', NULL, 'portal/20260427/42dbb8febebb6e1d668a770252903d6f.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260427\\/42dbb8febebb6e1d668a770252903d6f.webp\",\"name\":\"electric-suspension-crane (6).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/8291b825f8891ac770b8980750671bb6.webp\",\"name\":\"Electric Suspension Crane (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260427\\/0aa5c73e7e42d5f09870a9e36e2c7cac.webp\",\"name\":\"electric-suspension-crane (5).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/3f359da3f3d415eced504aae6ebc401f.webp\",\"name\":\"Electric Suspension Crane (3).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/3677d0c5f7346d90e135ce96ecb0e6f3.webp\",\"name\":\"Electric Suspension Crane.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '0.5 ~ 5t', '6 ~30 m', '2 ~ 19m', '3 Phase, 380V, 50Hz', 'A3～A4', 'Electric Suspension Crane adopts a suspended rail design and compact modular structure, with lightweight construction and integrated electric drive as core features.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8; overflow-x: auto;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;The Electric Suspension Crane is a lightweight and flexible lifting solution designed for workshops, warehouses, and assembly lines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;Suspended under an overhead I-beam, it is ideal for facilities where floor space is limited or support structures are required for overhead operation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;This crane is typically equipped with CD1/MD1 electric wire rope hoists or electric chain hoists, providing efficient and reliable lifting performance for light-duty applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Its under-running design allows smooth travel along the lower flange of I-beams, maximizing space utilization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;With a compact structure and simple installation, the suspension crane can be easily integrated into existing workshop layouts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;It offers stable operation, convenient maintenance, and low investment cost, making it a practical choice for small to medium lifting tasks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0;&quot;&gt;The crane supports customized configurations to meet different working conditions, ensuring flexibility in span, lifting height, and operation mode.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Key Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f9fafb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 24px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Key Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Under-running design for efficient use of workshop space&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lightweight structure with easy installation and relocation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compatible with wire rope hoists and chain hoists&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stable and smooth operation with low maintenance cost&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Customizable configurations for different applications&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Application Areas --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 24px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Application Areas&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Machinery manufacturing workshops&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Assembly lines and production facilities&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Warehouses and storage areas&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Light industrial material handling environments&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Important Notes --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #fff7f7; border: 1px solid #f3d6d6; border-left: 5px solid #e53935; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #b91c1c;&quot;&gt;Important Notes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 15px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Not suitable for flammable, explosive, or corrosive environments&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ensure no personnel are under the load before operation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Regular inspection of hooks, wire ropes, and safety devices is required&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Brake performance should be tested before lifting heavy loads&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
