('78', '28', 'European Single Girder Bridge Crane', 'european-single-girder-bridge-crane', NULL, 'portal/20260427/35e0cb9c29294589399b93f4308f0909.jpg', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260427\\/35e0cb9c29294589399b93f4308f0909.jpg\",\"name\":\"European Single Girder Bridge Crane (5).jpg\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260427\\/51676f2611eb2f068870c17daf3f9202.jpg\",\"name\":\"European Single Girder Bridge Crane (4).jpg\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260427\\/c80420e8b38e12e8b4e2d80e18d88df5.jpg\",\"name\":\"European Single Girder Bridge Crane (3).jpg\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260427\\/47ad7f1bf55718e14ac90e6809c46699.jpg\",\"name\":\"European Single Girder Bridge Crane (2).jpg\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260427\\/8beac21842fa09505f8da16eac2e1b7d.jpg\",\"name\":\"European Single Girder Bridge Crane (1).jpg\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '1-20ton', '6,9,12meter', '7.5-30meter', 'AC 380V/220V, 50-60Hz', 'A6', 'European-style single-girder bridge cranes adopt European FEM design standards and modular concepts, with off-center box girder and &quot;three-in-one&quot; drive as core features.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;The European Single Girder Overhead Crane is an advanced lifting solution developed based on European design standards,
featuring compact structure, lightweight construction, and high energy efficiency. It is widely used in modern industrial facilities
requiring precise positioning, low noise, and optimized space utilization.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;This crane adopts a &lt;strong&gt;high-strength single girder structure&lt;/strong&gt; combined with a European-style electric hoist,
delivering &lt;strong&gt;lighter dead weight and smaller structural dimensions&lt;/strong&gt; compared to traditional overhead cranes at the same capacity.
Its optimized design reduces wheel pressure and lowers requirements for plant construction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;European electric hoist&lt;/strong&gt; is the core lifting unit, featuring compact size, low headroom design, and high efficiency.
It ensures smooth lifting, precise positioning, and significantly &lt;strong&gt;reduced energy consumption&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;With &lt;strong&gt;advanced control systems and precision drive technology&lt;/strong&gt;, the crane operates with low noise, stable performance,
and high positioning accuracy. It is ideal for environments requiring clean operation, continuous workflow, and reliable lifting performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Key Specifications --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Lifting Capacity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;1 ton – 20 ton&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Span Range&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;7.5 m – 30 m&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Design Feature&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Low Headroom / Lightweight Structure&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Control Method&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Pendant / Remote / Cabin Control&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Key Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compact and lightweight design for efficient space utilization&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;European electric hoist with low headroom and high efficiency&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Low noise operation suitable for modern production environments&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;High positioning accuracy for precision handling tasks&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Reduced energy consumption and operating costs&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lower wheel pressure, reducing building structure requirements&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Application --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f9fafb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 24px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Application Areas&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Construction and infrastructure projects&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Paper mills and material handling facilities&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Machinery manufacturing and assembly lines&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Steel processing and metal fabrication plants&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Petrochemical industries and storage facilities&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Aviation and high-precision manufacturing sectors&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Safety / Notes --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #fff7f7; border: 1px solid #f3d6d6; border-left: 5px solid #e53935; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #b91c1c;&quot;&gt;Important Notes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 15px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Suitable for light to medium-duty lifting applications&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Regular maintenance of hoist and drive system is recommended&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Customization available for specific plant layouts and working conditions&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
