('79', '28', 'Euro-type double girder overhead crane with electric hoist', 'euro-type-double-girder-overhead-crane-with-electric-hoist', NULL, 'portal/20260428/e3019ad3f6d287c854f855ded8a5572d.jpg', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260427\\/83ccdd8e20fc4dfa32741e46ac376fe5.jpg\",\"name\":\"Euro-type double girder overhead crane with electric hoist (1).jpg\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260427\\/38e1b7005289085e92831c3e042939d3.jpg\",\"name\":\"Euro-type double girder overhead crane with electric hoist (4).jpg\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260427\\/ce948d8e2bdd30a361b56d37cacfbbc3.jpg\",\"name\":\"Euro-type double girder overhead crane with electric hoist (5).jpg\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260428\\/e3019ad3f6d287c854f855ded8a5572d.jpg\",\"name\":\"Euro-type double girder overhead crane with electric hoist (5).jpg\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260428\\/3a69272d32c6e074b14e574629d48f6e.png\",\"name\":\"Euro-type double girder overhead crane with electric hoist .png\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', ' 5t-50t', ' 6m-24m', '10.5m-31.5m or other', 'AC 380V/220V, 50-60Hz', 'A6', 'European double girder overhead crane is widely applied in factories, warehouses and heavy industrial workshops for heavy-load handling.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;The Euro-type Double Girder Overhead Crane with Electric Hoist is an advanced lifting system designed according to European standards,
featuring compact structure, low headroom configuration, and high operational efficiency.
It is widely used in modern industrial facilities requiring precise handling, high stability, and optimized space utilization.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;This crane adopts a &lt;strong&gt;double girder bridge structure with off-center rail design&lt;/strong&gt;, allowing maximum use of lifting height and working space.
The main beam is manufactured from &lt;strong&gt;high-strength steel&lt;/strong&gt; with excellent weldability, ensuring superior rigidity, durability, and load-bearing performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;end carriages are precision-welded&lt;/strong&gt; and equipped with a stable traveling mechanism driven by a &lt;strong&gt;three-in-one geared motor&lt;/strong&gt;,
providing smooth operation, low noise, and high transmission efficiency.
The integrated walkway, handrails, and maintenance platforms enhance operational safety and convenience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;The lifting system is equipped with a &lt;strong&gt;European ND electric hoist trolley&lt;/strong&gt;, featuring a compact design, optimized structure,
and excellent stability. Its advanced configuration allows efficient use of span space while ensuring &lt;strong&gt;precise lifting, smooth movement, and energy efficiency&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Key Specifications --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Lifting Capacity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;5 ton – 50 ton&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Span Range&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;10.5m-31.5m or other&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Design Feature&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Low Headroom / Compact Structure&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Drive System&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Three-in-One Geared Motor&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Key Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;European design with compact and low headroom configuration&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;High-strength steel structure with excellent rigidity and durability&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;ND electric hoist trolley for efficient and precise lifting&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Three-in-one drive system for smooth and energy-efficient operation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Optimized structure for maximum use of lifting height and span&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Low noise operation suitable for modern industrial environments&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Application --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f9fafb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 24px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Application Areas&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Machinery manufacturing and assembly workshops&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Steel processing and metal fabrication plants&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Warehouses and logistics distribution centers&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Automotive and precision manufacturing industries&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;General industrial lifting and material handling operations&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
