&lt;img src=&quot;default/20260424/afcfb65440a841b405fc0f9ce44b8ae1.png&quot; alt=&quot;Excellent Product Quality&quot; style=&quot;width: 64px; height: 64px; object-fit: contain; margin-bottom: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 14px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Excellent Product Quality&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane employs automated production lines and precision machining equipment. Key components are sourced from well-known domestic and international brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 450px; min-width: 300px; background: #f3f3f3; padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;default/20260424/6f13f30218a6f6354b3e729b620a1090.png&quot; alt=&quot;High Safety&quot; style=&quot;width: 64px; height: 64px; object-fit: contain; margin-bottom: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 14px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;High Safety&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;&quot;&gt;Weihua Lifting strictly adheres to international standards such as GB and FEM. Key structures adopt high safety factors to ensure precise operation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Title --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 28px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Customized Floor-Mounted Jib Crane Solutions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane provides fully customized Floor-Mounted Jib Crane solutions designed for localized material handling, offering flexible rotation, high efficiency, and independent operation in various workstations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Key parameters such as &lt;strong&gt;lifting capacity, arm length, lifting height, and rotation angle&lt;/strong&gt; can be flexibly customized to match different workspace layouts, improving efficiency and reducing manual handling efforts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Configurations --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Optional Configurations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Electric chain hoist or wire rope hoist options&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Manual or motorized rotation system&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Remote control or pendant control system&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;360° rotation or customized rotation angle&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Customized column height and base mounting design&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
