('81', '25', 'Wall Fixed Jib Crane', 'wall-fixed-jib-crane', NULL, 'portal/20260513/040ee3f12323f143793b1ceb4764d5b7.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/040ee3f12323f143793b1ceb4764d5b7.webp\",\"name\":\"Wall Fixed Jib Crane (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/16fbb7e5456b0c25af1380c1411de064.webp\",\"name\":\"Wall Fixed Jib Crane (3).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/62662245e616cf116cdd01fca955d31d.webp\",\"name\":\"Wall Fixed Jib Crane (4).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/6ff0fc4378b0c48aa5eacfe641b85fba.webp\",\"name\":\"Wall Fixed Jib Crane (5).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/27a13422441b2c1ecb498c402c2ba6dd.webp\",\"name\":\"Wall Fixed Jib Crane.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '1～10 ton', '1~12m', '3 ~ 7m', 'Three phrase; 380V, 50Hz', 'A6', 'Wall Fixed Jib Crane adopts a wall-mounted bracket structure and cantilever design, with space-saving installation and flexible rotation as core features.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Basic Info --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Name:&lt;/strong&gt; Wall Fixed Jib Crane&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Model:&lt;/strong&gt; BX&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief Introduction:&lt;/strong&gt; Wall fixed jib crane is a small and medium-speed lifting equipment with characteristics of unique structure, safe and reliable operation, high efficiency, energy-saving, time-saving, effort-saving, and flexibility. It can be operated under three-dimensional environment. This wall fixed jib crane is a good choice in the cases of short distance, concentrated lifting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt; Flexible, saving room, simple operation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application:&lt;/strong&gt; Workshop, warehouse, production line, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Image Name --&gt;&lt;!-- Introduction --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Introduction&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;&quot;&gt;The wall-mounted jib crane is composed of a bracket, jib arm and electric hoist. The jib cantilever is fixed on the wall, concrete column or steel supporting structure, and it can be rotated according to user needs. The rotation/slewing can be manual and electric driven. The electric hoist (wire rope hoist or chain hoist) is installed on the jib crane track for lifting task.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Features &amp; Application --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Features &amp;amp; Application&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;&quot;&gt;The wall-mounted jib crane is an energy-saving and efficient material lifting equipment with the advantages of modern, reasonable and simple structure, convenient operation, flexible rotation, light weight, flexible load movement, etc. This jib crane can be widely used in factories, mines, workshops, production lines, assembly lines and machine tools for loading and unloading, warehouses, docks, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Working Environment --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Working Environment&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Power source is 3-phase alternating current, rated frequency is 50Hz, and rated voltage is 380V.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The altitude height of site is ought to be less than 2,000m.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Forbidden used in flammable, explosive and corrosive gas environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Forbidden to lift fuse and blend deleterious stuff and flammable explosive stuff.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Working Operation --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Working Operation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hoist for traveling under jib arm and lifting materials on floor.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The jib arm can be driven by the reducer on the slewing device.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The electrical control box is installed on the hoist.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;This jib crane is controlled by the button pendant. There are eight buttons on the pendant, which control the fast rise, fast fall, slow rise, slow fall, left and right rotation and the horizontal movement of the hoist trolley.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Note --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#fff7f7; border:1px solid #f3d6d6; border-left:5px solid #e53935; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#b91c1c;&quot;&gt;Note&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Do not press the fast and slow button, positive and negative rotation button of the same motor at the same time during operation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;When working, it is forbidden for personal to stand under the jib arm.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;It is forbidden to lift overload heavy objects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Ordering Notice --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Ordering Notice&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;&quot;&gt;Ordering or signing the contract on the wall fixed jib cranes, customers shall offer the basic parameters (such as rated lifting weight, lifting height, valid radius and so on).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
