&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Title --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 28px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Customized Wall Fixed Jib Crane Solutions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane provides fully customized Wall Fixed Jib Crane solutions designed for efficient local material handling, offering space-saving installation and flexible operation in workshops and production areas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Key parameters such as &lt;strong&gt;lifting capacity, arm length, lifting height, and rotation angle&lt;/strong&gt; can be flexibly customized to match different wall structures and workstation layouts, improving handling efficiency without occupying floor space.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Configurations --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Optional Configurations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Electric chain hoist or wire rope hoist options&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Manual or motorized rotation system&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Remote control or pendant control system&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Customized rotation angle for different work areas&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wall-mounted structure design for limited floor space&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Summary --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-left: 5px solid #22c55e; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #374151;&quot;&gt;Our engineering team ensures &lt;strong&gt;space-saving installation, flexible operation, and reliable performance&lt;/strong&gt;, providing practical lifting solutions for workshops, warehouses, assembly lines, and maintenance areas.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
