:1px solid #666; padding:10px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;Kg&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:10px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;730&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tbody&gt;&lt;\\/table&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n\"}]', '10000', '0', '1777366898', '1778726602', NULL, '', '', ''),
('82', '27', 'Gantry Crane Wheels', 'gantry-crane-wheels', NULL, 'portal/20260429/e2cba3b8ef5d2bccc39dd524990b38b0.png', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260429\\/6364b003f7127bd09458158373198d04.png\",\"name\":\"Gantry Crane Wheels (5).png\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260429\\/b56663f581f25370b2113824bb489951.png\",\"name\":\"Gantry Crane Wheels (6).png\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260429\\/7917c664f42afff771ecc90c18de4c45.png\",\"name\":\"Gantry Crane Wheels (7).png\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260429\\/b3859117996b20e89ec3e026a1f3f649.png\",\"name\":\"Gantry Crane Wheels (8).png\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260429\\/e2cba3b8ef5d2bccc39dd524990b38b0.png\",\"name\":\"Gantry Crane Wheels (4).png\"}]', '[]', '[{\"parameter_name\":\"Wheel Diameter\",\"parameter_val\":\"250 mm ~ 2000 mm. The wheel diameter is typically selected based on the gantry crane\'s load capacity and operating environment.\"},{\"parameter_name\":\"Application scope\",\"parameter_val\":\"Sustaining the gantry crane, such as single-girder gantry cranes, double-girder gantry cranes, container gantry cranes, and shipyard gantry cranes.\"},{\"parameter_name\":\" Crane wheel forging materials\",\"parameter_val\":\"60#, 65Mn, 42CrMo, and thermal treatment on surface or ZG430-640 cast steel.\"},{\"parameter_name\":\"Surface hardness and depth of quenching\",\"parameter_val\":\"HB 300-350, more than 20mm\"}]', '', '', '', '', '', 'Gantry Crane Wheels are made of high-strength alloy steel with precision machining and heat treatment, featuring high load capacity, excellent wear resistance, and stable operation as core characteristics.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;&quot;&gt;Gantry crane wheels are commonly used in large crane systems, such as single-girder gantry cranes, double-girder gantry cranes, container gantry cranes, and shipyard gantry cranes. The primary function of the crane wheels is to support the entire weight of the gantry crane and enable it to move smoothly on the rails. Weihua gantry crane wheels are generally made of high-quality alloy steel or high-strength steel, capable of withstanding extremely high loads while maintaining excellent wear resistance. Heat treatment or surface hardening processes further enhance the wear resistance and service life of the wheels.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Structure --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;&quot;&gt;The gantry crane wheels block assembly is usually single or double flanged. Single-flange track wheels are more common and are mainly used for gantry cranes under 5 tons. This kind of wheel is also often used on double girder gantry cranes. Double flanged wheels are mainly used for heavy duty gantry cranes, double girder gantry cranes, and crane operating mechanisms. They are also very suitable for casting crane operating mechanisms, electric flat cars, and many other mechanisms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Application --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Application&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px;&quot;&gt;Gantry crane wheels are widely used in various industrial fields requiring efficient lifting and handling. They are mainly used in ports, steel mills, shipyards, logistics centers, and machinery manufacturing plants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 8px;&quot;&gt;Port Logistics: In ports, gantry crane wheels assist container cranes in loading and unloading containers, improving efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;&quot;&gt;Steel Industry: Crane wheel used for steel plant crane, especially suitable for steel plant gantry cranes for lifting and moving heavy steel and equipment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Price --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Gantry Crane Wheels Price&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px;&quot;&gt;The price of gantry crane wheels is influenced by several factors, primarily including the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 8px;&quot;&gt;Material and Manufacturing Process: Different materials (such as alloy steel, carbon steel, stainless steel, etc.) and manufacturing processes (such as heat treatment, surface treatment, etc.) directly affect the cost of the wheels. High-quality, high-performance wheels are generally more expensive.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;&quot;&gt;Specifications and Dimensions: The diameter, width, and load-bearing capacity of the wheels affect the price. Larger, higher-load-bearing wheels require more raw materials and more complex processing techniques, thus increasing their price.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Price Note --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#fff7f7; border:1px solid #f3d6d6; border-left:5px solid #e53935; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;&quot;&gt;Generally, the price of gantry crane wheels ranges from several thousand to tens of thousands of RMB. A specific price needs to be customized based on the factors mentioned above. For high-load-bearing or special-purpose wheels, the price may be even higher. To obtain an accurate price for gantry crane wheels, please contact Weihua Group – a gantry crane wheel supplier – directly, providing your specific requirements (such as load-bearing capacity, dimensions, materials, etc.). We will provide a quote based on your actual needs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
