('84', '19', 'European Gantry Crane Double Beam', 'european-gantry-crane-double-beam', NULL, 'portal/20260514/d77e59b596c40793b78ba600c9fc29b5.jpg', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/c9484b850f6b2b9c61233b71d0af1a1a.jpg\",\"name\":\"European Gantry Crane Double Beam.jpg\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/a6a57f9ce1feeb791347b49c75a6bc27.webp\",\"name\":\"European Gantry Crane Double Beam (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/7a7fba465eda025ac7ab2e554df3458c.webp\",\"name\":\"European Gantry Crane Double Beam (3).webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '≥5 ton', '5-30m', '6-24m', 'Three-Phase A.C. 380V 50HZ', 'M5', 'European Gantry Crane Double Beam adopts advanced European FEM design standards with a modular structure, featuring high stability, efficient load handling, and integrated drive systems as core characteristics.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;&quot;&gt;The European double beam gantry crane adopts the advanced European FEM standard design and manufacturing. It consists of two main beams, a end beam system, a lifting trolley, a control system, and a cabin. Compared with ordinary MG type, its main features are the use of European standard, hardened surface of the reducer, three in one drive, and PLC+frequency conversion control technology. This design comprehensively improves the product performance. At the same time, the weight of the crane is reduced by more than 15%, and the wheel pressure is reduced by 10-20%.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Main Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px;&quot;&gt;It has the characteristics of light weight, small wheel pressure, and is the preferred machine for various material handling places. Small wheel pressure and boundary size can reduce the early engineering investment cost of the factory, and also save some expenses for lighting, heating, and other facilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px;&quot;&gt;The product has reliable performance and durability, which can reduce additional costs during later use. On the one hand, the use of high standard components reduces maintenance and repair workload. On the other hand, it reduces the energy consumption of the entire machine and also saves its operating costs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Application --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;General Application&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;&quot;&gt;European double beam gantry cranes are widely applicable in material handling occasions. Usually, it is in steel metallurgy, hydro-power, aerospace, ships, automobiles, coal, petrochemicals, etc. And European gantry crane can not only achieve bi-directional movement, but also easily raise or lower heavy objects. It requires special technical methods to ensure operational safety in explosive, flammable, or corrosive environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/58da1a3619a66cc5afd4a8828cb1ddb4.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Water Conservancy And Hydropower&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;The dam-top gantry crane is installed on the top of a hydropower station dam. It is mainly used for gate lifting and material handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/53f8e47cb680e45180638afe05fd7034.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Wind Power Industry&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Weihua cranes are widely used in offshore wind power projects, especially for wind turbine installation and large component handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/7c19456728d86c85236af98f565ce874.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Shipyard Cranes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Shipyard gantry cranes are designed for shipbuilding operations, including section lifting, turning, assembly, and launching.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/4a0f53f988ee6f3023455792bf0a34c6.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Steel Mill Cranes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Weihua metallurgical cranes are used in steel mills covering lifting needs from smelting to finished product handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 20px 10px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
