&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;The CD/MD Series Electric Wire Rope Hoist is an upgraded lifting solution designed to overcome common issues found in traditional electric hoists,
such as hook over-travel, rope disorder, rope guide damage, gearbox oil leakage, and frequent electrical faults.
With enhanced structural design and improved reliability, it ensures safer and more stable lifting performance in industrial applications.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Key Improvements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Equipped with a &lt;strong&gt;counterweight limit device&lt;/strong&gt; featuring a simple structure and reliable operation,
effectively preventing hook over-travel caused by limit failure or mechanical faults.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;anti-rope-disorder rope guide&lt;/strong&gt; ensures smooth and orderly winding of the wire rope during lifting and lowering operations.
It allows the rope to be discharged smoothly from the guide even without hook tension, preventing entanglement and improving safety.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The rope guide nut adopts an &lt;strong&gt;integral split structure with automatic tension adjustment&lt;/strong&gt;,
offering high durability, wear resistance, and long service life.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Optimized design reduces common failures such as &lt;strong&gt;rope guide cracking, gearbox oil leakage, and electrical malfunctions&lt;/strong&gt;,
significantly lowering maintenance requirements and improving operational efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Advantages --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Advantages&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Improved safety with reliable limit protection system&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Smooth rope operation without entanglement&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Enhanced durability and reduced maintenance cost&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stable performance suitable for various industrial lifting tasks&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
