('86', '19', 'Double Beam Gantry Crane A Type', 'double-beam-gantry-crane-a-type', NULL, 'portal/20260522/d300d20824a96bb8f48a3e5f402d366f.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260522\\/77670bd5a5fce928b228ed47ada2d33b.webp\",\"name\":\"Double Beam Gantry Crane A Type (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260522\\/d300d20824a96bb8f48a3e5f402d366f.webp\",\"name\":\"Double Beam Gantry Crane A Type.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260522\\/8d059f937ab9b1bc636b0a1f3f2f5959.webp\",\"name\":\"double-girder-gantry-crane-4.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260430\\/5b85149ad05a2a814109833cdc21382f.png\",\"name\":\"Double Beam Gantry Crane A Type (1).png\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '5-200/50t', '10-14m', '18-35m', '3-phase A.C. 50Hz 380V', 'A5', 'Double Beam Gantry Crane A Type features a robust A-frame structure with dual parallel girders, offering high stability, heavy-duty lifting capacity, and efficient material handling as core characteristics.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;The A-Type Double Beam Gantry Crane is a heavy-duty lifting solution featuring two parallel main beams and an electric trolley capable of moving along the beams for precise horizontal material handling. 
It offers versatile operation modes including ground control and cabin control, with the cabin available in open or closed configurations, and can be installed on either the left or right side as required.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Product Description&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;Classified as an MG (A) type, this double beam gantry crane has a rated lifting capacity of &lt;strong&gt;5 to 200 tons&lt;/strong&gt;. 
It is suitable for both indoor and outdoor installation. For outdoor deployment, factors such as wind, rain, and typhoon resistance are considered. 
The crane features an &lt;strong&gt;A-shaped bracket design&lt;/strong&gt; on both sides, providing excellent stability and support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;The crane can be equipped with wheels or a track system, allowing the entire machine to move along the ground or rail as needed. 
Our factory offers &lt;strong&gt;semi-customized solutions&lt;/strong&gt;, designing lifting height, span, and track overhang according to your site requirements to ensure optimal performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Main Applications --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Main Applications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cargo Loading &amp;amp; Unloading at Ports:&lt;/strong&gt; Efficient handling of containers and large cargoes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raw Material Handling in Steel Industry:&lt;/strong&gt; Transporting iron ore, coal, and other raw materials from yards to production lines.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Material Lifting at Construction Sites:&lt;/strong&gt; Precise lifting of heavy building materials such as steel bars and prefabricated components.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Railway Vehicle Maintenance:&lt;/strong&gt; Disassembly and installation of locomotive parts to ensure smooth maintenance operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal Logistics in Large Manufacturing Plants:&lt;/strong&gt; Assembly and transportation of large machinery, equipment, and components to improve production efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Features &amp; Advantages --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Features &amp;amp; Advantages&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Heavy-Duty Capacity:&lt;/strong&gt; Designed for lifting up to 200 tons with stable A-shaped support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Operation:&lt;/strong&gt; Operates with ground control or cabin control (open/closed), adaptable to site conditions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customizable Installation:&lt;/strong&gt; Track system, lifting height, and span tailored to user requirements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Durable Construction:&lt;/strong&gt; High-strength steel beams and reinforced brackets for long-term reliability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wide Application:&lt;/strong&gt; Suitable for ports, steel mills, construction sites, workshops, and manufacturing plants.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
