('87', '30', 'European Hoist Trolley Double Girder', 'european-hoist-trolley-double-girder', NULL, 'portal/20260515/42514113305e62fb4eace73359912d39.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260515\\/42514113305e62fb4eace73359912d39.webp\",\"name\":\"European Hoist Trolley Double Girder.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260515\\/387b3a29511ce139f90af65f5d663859.webp\",\"name\":\"European Hoist Trolley Double Girder 2.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260515\\/67b410768a6e9828484bb21ded76e116.webp\",\"name\":\"European Hoist Trolley Double Girder 5.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260515\\/0ac47e652d51400d94b6c8bfb25c505a.webp\",\"name\":\"European Hoist Trolley Double Girder 3.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260515\\/d5ff38f1163b2f0b67fc07f10a05d252.webp\",\"name\":\"European Hoist Trolley Double Girder 4.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '5-80T', '6-18m', '', 'AC 380V/220V, 50-60Hz', 'M3-M5', 'Premium European Hoist Trolley for Double Girder Crane, featuring compact design, stable operation and high efficiency for heavy industrial lifting.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;The European Hoist Trolley for Double Girder Cranes is a high-performance lifting solution designed based on advanced European technology.
With its compact structure, modular design, and precise control system, it significantly improves lifting efficiency, operational stability, and overall safety in modern industrial environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Product Description&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;As the &lt;strong&gt;core lifting unit&lt;/strong&gt; of double girder cranes, the European hoist trolley integrates multiple advanced technologies.
It adopts a &lt;strong&gt;modular design&lt;/strong&gt; for easy maintenance, upgrading, and component replacement, reducing downtime and maintenance costs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;The trolley is equipped with a &lt;strong&gt;high-performance motor and variable frequency drive (VFD)&lt;/strong&gt;,
enabling stepless speed regulation, smooth start and stop, reduced mechanical impact, and improved positioning accuracy.
An &lt;strong&gt;advanced braking system&lt;/strong&gt; ensures quick and safe stopping under all operating conditions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;&quot;&gt;The lifting mechanism consists of &lt;strong&gt;drum, wire rope, pulley block, and hook&lt;/strong&gt;.
These components are manufactured from high-strength materials and undergo special treatments to enhance durability and fatigue resistance.
The optimized drum design ensures even wire rope winding, preventing entanglement and excessive wear,
while the hook is equipped with an &lt;strong&gt;anti-slip safety device&lt;/strong&gt; for secure lifting operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Application --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Main Application&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manufacturing Plants:&lt;/strong&gt; Used in automobile production and mechanical workshops for handling and installing heavy equipment and components.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics &amp;amp; Warehousing:&lt;/strong&gt; Suitable for loading, unloading, stacking, and sorting operations to improve space utilization and efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Port Terminals:&lt;/strong&gt; Ideal for handling containers and heavy cargo, ensuring efficient material transfer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Construction Sites:&lt;/strong&gt; Applied for lifting construction materials and installing heavy machinery with high precision and safety.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Features &amp;amp; Advantages&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compact Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Small size and optimized structure, ideal for limited-space environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Efficient Operation:&lt;/strong&gt; VFD control enables smooth movement, reduced shock, and higher working efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Safe and Reliable:&lt;/strong&gt; Equipped with overload protection, limit switches, and emergency stop systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High Durability:&lt;/strong&gt; Key components use high-strength materials with special treatment for long service life and corrosion resistance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
