&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;PLC control with frequency conversion for smooth operation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anti-sway system for precise container positioning&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
