('89', '19', 'Single Beam Gantry Crane MH Type', 'single-beam-gantry-crane-mh-type', NULL, 'portal/20260513/4b61d8a06b2421b8d3fbfcfb29f0d1ab.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260521\\/5ccce6da562115cffe5e7d6f76e5dd5c.webp\",\"name\":\"Single Beam Gantry Crane MH Type3.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260521\\/d31a300dcd2aa324f558998c36d887e6.webp\",\"name\":\"Single Beam Gantry Crane MH Type1.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260521\\/5739c8657c934bc79f191adf30993973.webp\",\"name\":\"Single Beam Gantry Crane MH Type2.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260521\\/45b808a76cf50eb57c05691e66a7036f.webp\",\"name\":\"Single Beam Gantry Crane MH Type.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '1-32t', '6-12meter', ' 12-35meter', 'Three-Phase A.C. 380V 50HZ', 'A4', 'Single Beam Gantry Crane MH Type features a compact single-girder design with a sturdy frame, offering flexible operation, efficient lifting, and reliable performance as core characteristics.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;The Single-Beam Hoist Gantry Crane is a light-duty lifting equipment widely used in warehouses, factories, and docks for cargo loading and unloading operations. 
It features a compact structure, easy operation, and small footprint, making it a popular choice for light material handling.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Product Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Product Description&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;This gantry crane adopts a &lt;strong&gt;single-beam design&lt;/strong&gt;, featuring one main beam spanning across two end beams. 
The main beam is the primary structural component responsible for carrying heavy loads. Its material and manufacturing quality directly affect the safety and service life of the crane.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;The core lifting mechanism is an &lt;strong&gt;electric hoist&lt;/strong&gt; mounted under the main beam, moving along the beam to achieve both vertical and horizontal material handling. 
Electric hoists are available in two types: &lt;strong&gt;wire rope hoists&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;chain hoists&lt;/strong&gt;, allowing users to select the most suitable option based on their operational requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Main Applications --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Main Applications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics Warehousing:&lt;/strong&gt; Ideal for loading, unloading, and stacking goods, especially in limited space.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manufacturing Workshop:&lt;/strong&gt; Supports material handling on production lines to improve efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Port Terminal:&lt;/strong&gt; Performs loading and unloading of containers and other heavy goods.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Construction Sites:&lt;/strong&gt; Handles construction materials such as steel bars, cement, and other heavy loads.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Features &amp; Advantages --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Product Features &amp;amp; Advantages&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High Efficiency &amp;amp; Energy Saving:&lt;/strong&gt; Higher working efficiency and lower energy consumption compared to traditional lifting equipment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High Safety:&lt;/strong&gt; Equipped with overload protection, travel limit, and other safety measures to ensure operator and equipment safety.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Easy Maintenance:&lt;/strong&gt; Simple structure enables convenient daily maintenance and troubleshooting, reducing overall maintenance costs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
