('90', '30', 'HB Explosion-Proof Electric Hoist', 'hb-explosion-proof-electric-hoist', NULL, 'portal/20260515/d8df5554fef72c56893cb49a8c965b33.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260515\\/d8df5554fef72c56893cb49a8c965b33.webp\",\"name\":\"HB Explosion-Proof Electric Hoist.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260515\\/b9563ce368aa82b8ae6285ac5157c4ce.webp\",\"name\":\"HB Explosion-Proof Electric Hoist 1.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260515\\/313e82362ab54a697fce1cb501fac276.webp\",\"name\":\"HB Explosion-Proof Electric Hoist 4.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260515\\/061ed8c9d812c6e5c20c596b564b13ba.webp\",\"name\":\"HB Explosion-Proof Electric Hoist 5.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260515\\/369ef3773582cbee741bd173623c8297.webp\",\"name\":\"HB Explosion-Proof Electric Hoist 3.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '1-32t', ' 3-30m', '6-30m', 'AC 380V/220V, 50-60Hz', 'M5-M8', 'HB Explosion-Proof Electric Hoist: Safe, ExdII BT4/CT4 certified, 1–32t capacity, ideal for hazardous lifting in explosive gas environments.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;According to GB3836.1-2000 and GB3836.2-2000 standards, the motor and all electrical components of this explosion-proof electric hoist are designed with certified explosion-proof protection.
When the explosion-proof grade is ExdII CT4, the travelling mechanism is specially treated for spark-proof performance to ensure safe operation in hazardous environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Product Description&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;This explosion-proof electric hoist is designed with explosion-proof ratings of &lt;strong&gt;ExdII BT4 and ExdII CT4&lt;/strong&gt;,
ensuring safe and reliable operation in hazardous industrial environments such as chemical plants, oil fields, and gas facilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;It can be used on &lt;strong&gt;fixed suspension rail systems&lt;/strong&gt; in workshops and is also compatible with various explosion-proof crane systems,
including &lt;strong&gt;LXB explosion-proof suspension single girder cranes&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;LB explosion-proof single beam cranes&lt;/strong&gt;,
and &lt;strong&gt;explosion-proof double girder hoist cranes&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;&quot;&gt;In addition, Weihua provides the &lt;strong&gt;NR series explosion-proof electric hoist&lt;/strong&gt;, which is a newly designed upgraded model with improved performance and safety.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Application &amp;amp; Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Complies with GB3836.1-2000 and GB3836.2-2000 explosion-proof standards&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Explosion-proof ratings: ExdII BT4 / ExdII CT4&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Special spark-proof treatment for travelling mechanism (CT4 condition)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compatible with multiple explosion-proof crane systems&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Suitable for hazardous environments such as chemical, oil, and gas industries&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Optional NR series new design explosion-proof electric hoist available&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
