('91', '19', 'Rubber Tyred Container Gantry Crane', 'rubber-tyred-container-gantry-crane', NULL, 'portal/20260513/ea5d61da2556a50deca33693c2980daa.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/ea5d61da2556a50deca33693c2980daa.webp\",\"name\":\"Rubber Tyred Container Gantry Crane (3).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/e4636b3d8fc002b5941cec67cfa41d87.webp\",\"name\":\"Rubber Tyred Container Gantry Crane (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/8d24027fa3dec28136130ec8366ad8dc.webp\",\"name\":\"Rubber Tyred Container Gantry Crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/2d50b42e4df2acfe68fc5753e54f2fa4.jpg\",\"name\":\"Rubber Tyred Container Gantry Crane (4).jpg\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '35t, 40t', '12.2~17.8m', '23m, 27m', 'Electric, Diesel Engine, Electric-disel Engine', 'A6、A7、A8', 'Rubber Tyred Container Gantry Crane features a mobile rubber-tyred chassis and dual lifting gantry structure, providing flexible movement, high-capacity container handling, and efficient port operations as core characteristics.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;The Rubber Tyred Container Gantry Crane (RTG) is designed for handling containers and large components at loading/unloading areas and container yards. Equipped with multiple hooking-point spreaders, it adapts to various lifting scenarios. The crane can perform 360° steering for highly flexible movement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Drive &amp; Control --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Drive &amp;amp; Control&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;The crane uses a full hydraulic drive for both traveling and lifting mechanisms with stepless speed regulation. Long-travel movement utilizes a hydraulic closed circuit for high transmission efficiency and low fault rates. Safety indicators and overload limiters ensure the safety of operators and lifted goods. All operations are managed via CAN-BUS control for precise and reliable handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Also known as RTG, it is widely used for stacking containers in container storage yards.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Equipped with specialized spreaders to lift standard 20GP, 40GP, 45HQ containers, and hydraulic storage tanks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Trolley and crane traveling mechanisms feature a three-in-one reducer for convenient maintenance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The tires can rotate 90° and move obliquely at 20° and 45°, offering high maneuverability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
