('92', '30', 'Electric Winch', 'electric-winch', NULL, 'portal/20260515/05eac3fc9f5ff4ec128d00ed8ed2d3a6.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260515\\/5285c34f01524c502c3c6b4eb2136a30.webp\",\"name\":\"Electric Winch.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260515\\/05eac3fc9f5ff4ec128d00ed8ed2d3a6.webp\",\"name\":\"Electric Winch.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260515\\/ee68464c72fcc63ff8a1b6fe75f665ae.webp\",\"name\":\"electric-winch.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260515\\/03a924f5aa72a90206cd300691d548b6.webp\",\"name\":\"electric-winch.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260515\\/c8d3cb46771c19e92c901b1d13dd2942.webp\",\"name\":\"electric-winch.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', ' 1-80t', 'customized', '', ' 220v/380v/400v/415v', '', 'Electric winch can be fitted on overhead crane, gantry crane, also can be used alone for all kinds of projects. ', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;This electric winch is versatile lifting equipment suitable for a wide range of applications including buildings, hydropower plants, bridges, metallurgy, and mining projects. It can be installed on overhead cranes, gantry cranes, or used independently for various construction and industrial tasks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Product Description&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;The electric winch features a &lt;strong&gt;mechatronics inner cone brake device&lt;/strong&gt;. When the motor is running, the brake automatically disengages. Once the motor stops, the brake closes immediately to provide reliable and sensitive braking performance. The brake is installed inside the winch to prevent dirt, mud, sand, oil, or other contaminants from causing slippage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;The winch is equipped with an &lt;strong&gt;electric control device&lt;/strong&gt;, eliminating the need for operators to sit in a machine booth. The control device can be installed in a safe location with clear visibility, making it especially convenient for narrow sites or close-range operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Features &amp; Advantages --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Features &amp;amp; Advantages&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wide application in buildings, bridges, hydropower plants, metallurgy, mining, and other projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Can be used independently or installed on overhead cranes and gantry cranes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Inner cone brake ensures sensitive, reliable, and contamination-resistant braking.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Electric control device allows safe operation from a distance, improving efficiency and safety.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compact and reliable structure suitable for narrow or restricted sites.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/58da1a3619a66cc5afd4a8828cb1ddb4.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
