&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane provides fully customized European-style Double Beam Gantry Crane solutions designed for heavy-duty lifting and high-efficiency operations, following advanced European FEM standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Key parameters such as &lt;strong&gt;lifting capacity, span, lifting height, work duty, and hoist type&lt;/strong&gt; can be flexibly customized to meet different operational requirements in ports, yards, and industrial sites, ensuring high stability and reliable performance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
