('93', '19', 'Double Girder Semi-Gantry Crane', 'double-girder-semi-gantry-crane', NULL, 'portal/20260522/d48f6b95544e3bb04464bfa9306fb031.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260522\\/05da2197e60ef0351482f7b12c6f8dae.webp\",\"name\":\"double-girder-semi-gantry-crane_(2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/723528f294cc2b4f4760cb2777963e45.webp\",\"name\":\"double-girder-semi-gantry-crane_(3).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/81b9f06ed925ae27906c80e5c9981fb8.webp\",\"name\":\"double-girder-semi-gantry-crane_(1).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/fae2caeb09bd6d207a57a41bdbae8e1d.webp\",\"name\":\"double-girder-semi-gantry-crane_(4).webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '5～200t', '10～33m', '18～36m', '3 phase 50Hz 380V', 'A3-A5', 'Double Girder Semi-Gantry Crane features a partial gantry structure with dual girders, offering high lifting capacity, stable operation, and efficient material handling for industrial and outdoor applications.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Gantry cranes are a special type of overhead crane. The double girder semi-gantry crane features one side supported by A-type legs running on ground tracks, while the other side is usually supported by the walls of a workshop or warehouse. This design is ideal for lifting and conveying materials outdoors, offering high flexibility in confined spaces.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Girder Structure --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Girder Structure&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Truss Girder:&lt;/strong&gt; Welded from angle steel or I-type steel. Advantages: low cost, light weight, good wind resistance. Limitations: more welding points, larger deflection, lower stiffness, and lower reliability. Suitable for lower safety requirements and lighter loads.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Box Girder:&lt;/strong&gt; Welded from steel plates, offering high stiffness and safety. Commonly applied for lifting large tonnage loads. Limitations: higher cost, larger self-weight, and lower wind resistance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Double Box Girder:&lt;/strong&gt; Offers large lifting capacity, wide span, and excellent overall stability. Suitable for heavy-duty operations, though the self-weight is higher than single girder cranes with the same lifting capacity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Safety Protection --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Safety Protection&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Overload limiter&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Polyurethane rubber buffers with long service life and impact resistance&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Crane traveling limit switch&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Loss pressure protection and fault phase protection&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Emergency stop system&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lifting height limiter&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/58da1a3619a66cc5afd4a8828cb1ddb4.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Water Conservancy And Hydropower&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;The dam-top gantry crane is installed on the top of a hydropower station dam. It is mainly used for gate lifting and material handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/53f8e47cb680e45180638afe05fd7034.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Wind Power Industry&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Weihua cranes are widely used in offshore wind power projects, especially for wind turbine installation and large component handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
