style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:10px 8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;∅270mm&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:10px 8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;Orbital width&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td colspan=&quot;4&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:10px 8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;37-70mm&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tbody&gt;&lt;\\/table&gt;\"}]', '9908', '0', '1777541336', '1779418279', NULL, '', '', ''),
('94', '19', 'Container Rail Mounted Gantry Crane', 'container-rail-mounted-gantry-crane', NULL, 'portal/20260513/fb957b3edbb242219dd8f002c0ff2090.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/fb957b3edbb242219dd8f002c0ff2090.webp\",\"name\":\"Container Rail Mounted Gantry Crane (3).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/c1ed73d24919a039070ea7e3e72979bb.webp\",\"name\":\"rmg-crane_(1).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/3a62ddc79f42ea8f988152c0963fd613.webp\",\"name\":\"Container Rail Mounted Gantry Crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/64de86ab705a974427efc6def29e07ff.webp\",\"name\":\"Container Rail Mounted Gantry Crane (2).webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '1～500 ton', '12.2~17.8m', '18~36m', ' 3 phase 50Hz 380V', 'A6、A7、A8', 'Container Rail Mounted Gantry Crane features a rail-guided gantry structure designed for container yards, providing precise positioning, high-capacity lifting, and efficient container handling as core characteristics.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;The Weihua Rail Mounted Gantry Crane (RMG) is designed for container handling in inland terminals, container yards, rail freight stations, coastal freight yards, and frontier wharfs. It integrates advanced technologies such as full digital AC frequency conversion, PLC control, and intelligent monitoring (CMS), ensuring high efficiency, precision, and safety in material handling operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Key Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Key Features of Weihua Rail Mounted Gantry Crane&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;U-type frame with double cantilever and rod: strong and lightweight.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Large gantry span and width for container loading and unloading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;360° rotating spreader providing excellent adaptability and efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Long traveling mechanism assembly for stable movement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Comprehensive frame/gantry assembly and trolley assembly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Full digital frequency conversion and PLC control technology.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;High precision sensor data acquisition and industrial computer analysis system.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Electrical control system integrated with CMS for intelligent monitoring.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Structure &amp; Components --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Structure and Components&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;The RMG crane mainly consists of steel structure, lifting mechanism, micro-transfer mechanism, spreader anti-sway system, crane travelling mechanism, container spreaders, electrical equipment, and other auxiliary equipment. It adopts frequency conversion, PLC control system, and CMMS fault detection system, complying with standards including GB/T19683-2005, JT/T566-2004, ISO, FEM, and JIS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Applications --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Applications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Container stacking and transport in inland terminals and container yards.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Rail freight stations and coastal freight yards handling standard containers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Flexible lifting of 20ft, 40ft, and 45ft containers using dedicated spreaders.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Efficient operations in petrochemical, logistics, and industrial material handling.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Types &amp; Mechanisms --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Types &amp;amp; Mechanisms&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Double Cantilever Gantry Crane:&lt;/strong&gt; Large space between outriggers for containers to pass through, forming a U-shape combined with girder forming N-shape.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Non-Cantilever Crane:&lt;/strong&gt; Simple structure where containers do not pass between outriggers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stabilization:&lt;/strong&gt; Rope-type mechanisms can use dampers; rigid type uses inherent rigidity. Optional anti-sway device improves operational stress and efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive &amp;amp; Safety:&lt;/strong&gt; Three-in-one gear motors for long travel and cross travel, 270° trolley rotation, anti-breaking shaft, wind warning, anti-tipping, and other safety systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/58da1a3619a66cc5afd4a8828cb1ddb4.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Water Conservancy And Hydropower&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;The dam-top gantry crane is installed on the top of a hydropower station dam. It is mainly used for gate lifting and material handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
