\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;±5°&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;±5°&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;Lifting (m\\/min)&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;13\\/26,23\\/52&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;12\\/18,18\\/28&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#f9f9f9;&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;Trolley travelling (m\\/min)&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;50,70&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;24&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;Crane travelling (m\\/min)&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;Full load-90,&lt;br&gt;no load-130&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;Full load-20,&lt;br&gt;no load-40&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#f9f9f9;&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;Max. wheel load(kN)&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;310&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;310&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tbody&gt;&lt;\\/table&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n\"}]', '10000', '0', '1777545052', '1778725583', NULL, '', '', ''),
('95', '23', 'Ship-to-Shore Container Cranes', 'Ship-to-Shore-Container-Cranes', NULL, 'portal/20260513/b975fcb790295aa5b2272e160d1f0bb3.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/b975fcb790295aa5b2272e160d1f0bb3.webp\",\"name\":\"STS Cranes.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260514\\/8fa772f4cc9697c2702dada28be3a1dc.webp\",\"name\":\"STS Quay Crane for Containers.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260514\\/b8a1df7a14e86a1bb27967d927a86570.webp\",\"name\":\"STS Quay Crane (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260514\\/4f8500f53411a5b3e8ea7de6dd747c6f.webp\",\"name\":\"STS Quay Crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260514\\/4745c823c4eed5ef417e51cc1092d257.webp\",\"name\":\"STS.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[{\"parameter_name\":\"Front Outreach\",\"parameter_val\":\"30-65meter\"},{\"parameter_name\":\"Rear Outreach\",\"parameter_val\":\"10-25meter \"},{\"parameter_name\":\"Rail Gauge\",\"parameter_val\":\"16-30.48meter\"}]', '35-65ton', '', '', '', '', 'Ship-to-Shore Container Cranes are mainly deployed at coastal seaports to load and unload containers between large cargo vessels and shore yards efficiently.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;The Ship-to-Shore (STS) Container Crane is the core lifting equipment at the front of container terminals and plays a key role in the efficient operation of modern ports. It is designed for loading and unloading container ships, enabling seamless logistics transfer between vessels and terminals. The STS crane ensures containers can be safely and efficiently transferred from ship to shore or from shore to ship with high precision.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Structure --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Structure &amp;amp; Working System&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;The metal structure of the STS crane features high strength and excellent stability, providing a solid foundation for safe operation even under heavy loads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;The crane is designed in strict compliance with international standards such as &lt;strong&gt;FEM, DIN, IEC, AWS, and GB&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring global quality and advanced performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;The electrical control system adopts full digital AC frequency conversion and PLC control technology, enabling precise and flexible control of all mechanisms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;&quot;&gt;The lifting mechanism is capable of handling container loads from &lt;strong&gt;35 tons to 65 tons&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring stable lifting of both loaded and empty containers. The trolley system enables accurate horizontal movement across the bridge for precise container positioning. The gantry traveling mechanism ensures stable movement along quay rails, meeting loading and unloading requirements at different ship positions. The tilting mechanism adjusts operating angles according to different vessel conditions for improved efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Components --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Key Components&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;The trolley assembly works as the core unit for container handling and operates in coordination with other systems for smooth performance. The tilting and cabin anti-collision protection system acts as a safety safeguard, quickly responding to abnormal situations such as container swing or cabin impact, preventing equipment damage and ensuring operational safety.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;&quot;&gt;Additional auxiliary devices further enhance system reliability, operational convenience, and overall safety performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Advantages --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Advantages&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;The STS quay crane is equipped with various single and double container spreaders to meet different operational requirements. An optional electronic anti-sway system effectively reduces container swinging, improving safety and efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;&quot;&gt;It adopts frequency conversion multi-drive feedback technology, enhancing overall machine performance. With large lifting capacity and long outreach, it covers a wider working range. Real-time position data collection enables intelligent control of spreader movement, ensuring precise and efficient container handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/58da1a3619a66cc5afd4a8828cb1ddb4.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Water Conservancy And Hydropower&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;The dam-top gantry crane is installed on the top of a hydropower station dam. It is mainly used for gate lifting and material handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/53f8e47cb680e45180638afe05fd7034.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Wind Power Industry&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Weihua cranes are widely used in offshore wind power projects, especially for wind turbine installation and large component handling.&lt;/p&gt;
