&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Key parameters such as &lt;strong&gt;lifting capacity, outreach, back reach, lifting height, and rail gauge&lt;/strong&gt; can be flexibly customized to match different vessel sizes and terminal layouts, enabling efficient ship-to-quay container transfer operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
