&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Advanced anti-sway control system for precise positioning&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;PLC-based intelligent control and remote operation system&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
