d style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;120&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;150&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;180&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;m\\/min&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;td colspan=&quot;2&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;Trolley Traveling Speed&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;180&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;210&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;240&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;240&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;m\\/min&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#f9f9f9;&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;td colspan=&quot;2&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;Gantry Traveling Speed&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;45&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;45&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;45&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;45&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;m\\/min&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;td colspan=&quot;2&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;Boom Hoisting Time (One Way)&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;5&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;5&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;5&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;5&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:8px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;min&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tbody&gt;&lt;\\/table&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n\"}]', '9902', '0', '1778034283', '1778743252', NULL, '', '', ''),
('96', '23', 'MQ Portal Crane', 'MQ-Portal-Crane', NULL, 'portal/20260513/4a1f0126b0c7f3e5f089ef34cad50730.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/4a5c18c55b0764c441e29b7c544e4824.webp\",\"name\":\"MQ Portal Crane (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/d4b4f739a5d2f4aae1a35042dd8c69ab.webp\",\"name\":\"MQ Portal Crane (4).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/4026d1bd0b8cb6c1206db928ae9b457f.webp\",\"name\":\"MQ Portal Crane (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/4a1f0126b0c7f3e5f089ef34cad50730.webp\",\"name\":\"MQ Portal Crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/4416bc7ee3a0cd48d184d50b31bc3723.webp\",\"name\":\"Portal Crane.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[{\"parameter_name\":\"Above Rail\",\"parameter_val\":\"12-40m\"},{\"parameter_name\":\"Below Rail\",\"parameter_val\":\" 9-16m\"}]', '5-80t', '', '', '', 'A7～A8', 'MQ Portal Crane features a portal-type structure with flexible lifting and slewing functions, offering high efficiency, strong load capacity, and reliable material handling for ports and outdoor operations.', '[]', '
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;MQ portal crane is widely used in ports, stations, and storage yards, which can efficiently carry out operation of load, unload and transship to speed up the turnaround of ships and vehicles. Advantages of port portal crane: good performance, beautiful exterior, efficient work, compact structure, running balanced, comfortable operation, safe&amp;amp;reliable, convenient for maintenance. Port portal crane can be used at limited space in ports to load and unload cargo on ships, and leave considerable room for vehicles to pass through, especially applies to universal ports.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;35t-portal-crane&quot; src=&quot;https://www.weihuacraneglobal.com/upload/images/35t-portal-crane.jpg&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;max-height: 100%;transition: 0.5s;height: auto !important&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;Features of Weihua Portal Crane:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;1. Sling spreader can be grab and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.weihuacraneglobal.com/product/Hook--Crane-Hooks.html&quot; title=&quot;Weihua Crane&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;transition: 0.5s&quot;&gt;hook&lt;/a&gt;, good adaptability, wide application;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;2. Optimized four-bar linkage mechanism, precise luffing;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;3. 360° slewing, wide working scope;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;4. PLC control, AC frequency speed control, stable and reliable running;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;5. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.weihuacraneglobal.com/product/Joystick-Radio-Control.html&quot; title=&quot;Weihua Crane&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;transition: 0.5s&quot;&gt;Remote control&lt;/a&gt; are available according to the requirement;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;6. Adequate protection devices, communication and lighting system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;portal-crane-erection&quot; src=&quot;https://www.weihuacraneglobal.com/upload/images/portal-crane-erection.jpg&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;max-height: 100%;transition: 0.5s;height: auto !important&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;Single-Arm portal Crane:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;Single arm portal crane is mainly used in small and medium-sized port to load and unload bulk material. Light weight and small wheel pressure benefit to reduce investment and create considerable gains. It adopts rack amplitude or wire-rope amplitude (block and tackle) to accomplish variable amplitudes with load, horizontal displacement, and rotating or lifting in any degree. Cooperation of amplitudes makes the crane work smoothly and efficiently. Hooks and grabs can be equipped with it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;60t-portal-crane&quot; src=&quot;https://www.weihuacraneglobal.com/upload/images/60t-portal-crane.jpg&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;max-height: 100%;transition: 0.5s;height: auto !important&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;Four-Bar Combination Portal Crane:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;This kind portal crane is a mobile, full-revolving, and four-bar combined crane. Its arms and counter-weight are balanced. There are 2 types of portal frame: cylinder and four outriggers. This portal carne is for lifting containers with hooks or grabs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;portal-crane-erection&quot; src=&quot;https://www.weihuacraneglobal.com/upload/images/portal-crane-erection(1).jpg&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;max-height: 100%;transition: 0.5s;height: auto !important&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;Advantages: long arms, suitable for bigger ship, beautiful exterior, safe and reliable, durable advanced performance, convenient for maintenance. It\'s the best choice for comprehensive multi-typed cargo ports. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;floating-portal-crane&quot; src=&quot;https://www.weihuacraneglobal.com/upload/images/900t-ship-loader-crane-floating-portal-crane.jpg&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;max-height: 100%;transition: 0.5s;height: auto !important&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;1. Adopt the structure of a four-link combined boom and a cylindrical gantry;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;2. The slewing device is a large slewing bearing, which can work with hook and grab, and can be used in different working ranges;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;3. The corresponding load can be hoisted for horizontal luffing and 360° rotation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;4. The hoisting, luffing and slewing mechanisms can act independently or in combination;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;5. The whole portal crane can run in a straight line along the horizontally laid track;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;6. All operating mechanisms adopt AC variable frequency speed regulation, the whole crane adopts PLC control system, full variable frequency stepless speed regulation and fault monitoring system;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;7. The driver\'s cab is equipped with an intelligent status monitoring and control screen, which performs fault monitoring, provides troubleshooting assistance, can realize dynamic monitoring of running status, provides dynamic change graphic display, and has safety information alarm, lubrication maintenance management help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;Port-portal-crane&quot; src=&quot;https://www.weihuacraneglobal.com/upload/images/Port-portal-crane.jpg&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;max-height: 100%;transition: 0.5s;height: auto !important&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;weihua-portal-cranes&quot; src=&quot;https://www.weihuacraneglobal.com/upload/images/weihua-portal-cranes.jpg&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;max-height: 100%;transition: 0.5s;height: auto !important&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;portal-crane-ready-for-shipping&quot; src=&quot;https://www.weihuacraneglobal.com/upload/images/portal-crane-ready-for-shipping.jpg&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;max-height: 100%;transition: 0.5s;height: auto !important&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;Portal Crane Shipping to Indonesia&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;MG40-Portal-crane&quot; src=&quot;https://www.weihuacraneglobal.com/upload/images/MG40-Portal-crane.jpg&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;max-height: 100%;transition: 0.5s;height: auto !important&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;MG40 Portal Crane at Huanghua Port for Coal Handling&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
