&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 28px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Customized STS Quay Crane for Containers Solutions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane provides fully customized Ship-to-Shore (STS) Quay Crane solutions designed for high-efficiency container loading and unloading operations at modern ports, ensuring fast turnaround and reliable performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Key parameters such as &lt;strong&gt;lifting capacity, outreach, back reach, lifting height, and rail gauge&lt;/strong&gt; can be flexibly customized to match different vessel sizes and terminal layouts, enabling efficient ship-to-quay container transfer operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Configurations --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Optional Configurations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Automatic spreader for different container sizes&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Advanced anti-sway control system for precise positioning&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;PLC-based intelligent control and remote operation system&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Energy-saving frequency conversion drive system&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Real-time monitoring and smart port integration system&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Summary --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-left: 5px solid #22c55e; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #374151;&quot;&gt;Our engineering team ensures &lt;strong&gt;high-speed operation, maximum safety, and long-term reliability&lt;/strong&gt;, providing advanced STS crane solutions for efficient port container handling and global logistics operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
