('97', '19', 'L Type Single Girder Gantry Crane', 'l-type-single-girder-gantry-crane', NULL, 'portal/20260513/c20df83df1bb3cb7e588d062000bff5e.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/c20df83df1bb3cb7e588d062000bff5e.webp\",\"name\":\"L-Single-girder-gantry-crane_(1).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/459d5b53f1fb77989f1e89f065748b08.webp\",\"name\":\"L-Single-girder-gantry-crane_(4).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/46ff8ade444af30073dd8d0c6e632ac3.webp\",\"name\":\"L-single-leg-gantry-crane.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', ' 5t-50/10t', '10, 11, 12m', ' 18-22m, 30-35m', '3 phase 50Hz 380V', 'A5', 'L Type Single Girder Gantry Crane features an L-shaped leg structure with a single girder design, offering efficient space utilization, flexible operation, and reliable lifting performance for outdoor material handling.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;The L-Type Single Girder Gantry Crane with hook is designed for outdoor material handling and conveying operations in warehouses, stockyards, railway stations, and port cargo areas. It can also be equipped with various special spreaders to perform customized lifting tasks in different industrial applications.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Product Description&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;This crane adopts an &lt;strong&gt;L-type leg structure&lt;/strong&gt;, providing large clearance space and flexible operation. It is equipped with a &lt;strong&gt;closed operator cabin&lt;/strong&gt;, with optional heat-insulated cab configurations for harsh environments. The ergonomic console design ensures comfortable and efficient operation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;The power supply system can be configured as either a &lt;strong&gt;cable reel&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;cable trolley system&lt;/strong&gt;, depending on site conditions. Installation location and specifications can be customized to meet project requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;&quot;&gt;With its reasonable structural layout, excellent visibility, and easy installation, this gantry crane delivers reliable performance in both standard and customized working conditions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Features &amp;amp; Advantages&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Robust Structure:&lt;/strong&gt; Box-type girder with welded L-type legs, providing increased working space and convenient installation and maintenance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Power Supply:&lt;/strong&gt; Supports cable reel or conductor rail systems, configurable on left or right side.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reliable Conducting System:&lt;/strong&gt; Trolley power supply adopts profiled rails and safety sliding conductor systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Standardized Components:&lt;/strong&gt; High degree of standardization, serialization, and generalization for easy maintenance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable Operation:&lt;/strong&gt; Cabin offers wide visibility and is equipped with integrated control console; optional fan, heater, cooler, air-conditioner, and intercom.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customizable Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Tailored to user requirements including working environment, power supply type, and span design.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/58da1a3619a66cc5afd4a8828cb1ddb4.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
