('98', '25', 'Explosion-Proof Jib Crane', 'explosion-proof-jib-crane', NULL, 'portal/20260513/9b3c52d35263a7205dba3db7cb775d51.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/28020f41169da37fb4b55060709f4163.webp\",\"name\":\"Explosion-Proof Jib Crane (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/0d4cd8ad1d2d6b69e480d2c0b74d30f8.webp\",\"name\":\"Explosion-Proof Jib Crane (3).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/28895d485544af3894a92687b6436549.webp\",\"name\":\"Explosion-Proof Jib Crane (4).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/9b3c52d35263a7205dba3db7cb775d51.webp\",\"name\":\"Explosion-Proof Jib Crane (5).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/2d2cca993c9c79410d5f5b20ff1e03c9.webp\",\"name\":\"Explosion-Proof Jib Crane.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[{\"parameter_name\":\"Product\",\"parameter_val\":\"Explosion-Proof Jib Crane 5 Ton\"},{\"parameter_name\":\"\",\"parameter_val\":\"\"}]', '', '', '', '', '', 'Explosion-Proof Jib Crane features a safety-certified explosion-proof design with a rotating jib arm, offering secure operation, flexible lifting, and reliable performance in hazardous environments.', '[]', '
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;The explosion-proof &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.weihuacraneglobal.com/product/Free-Standing-Jib-Crane.html&quot; title=&quot;Weihua Crane&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;transition: 0.5s&quot;&gt;jib crane&lt;/a&gt; is composed of fixed pillar, reversal equipment, jib arm and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.weihuacraneglobal.com/product/HB-Explosion-Proof-Electric-Hoist.html&quot; title=&quot;Weihua Crane&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;transition: 0.5s&quot;&gt;explosion-proof electric hoist&lt;/a&gt;, etc. The lower end of the pillar is fixed on the concrete foundation, and the swing arm is reversed, which can be reversed according to user requirements. Reversal can be manual reversal and electric reversal. The electric hoist is installed on the jib arm track and used for lifting tasks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Barlow-Medium; white-space: normal; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;default/20260519/457eb09db055bc7624103dd1a43f9d16.webp&quot; title=&quot;5t-explosion-proof-jib-crane.webp&quot; alt=&quot;5t-explosion-proof-jib-crane.webp&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;Model BZB 5T/8M Explosion-Proof Jib Crane&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;Explosion Proof:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.weihuacraneglobal.com/product/Motors.html&quot; title=&quot;Weihua Crane&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;transition: 0.5s&quot;&gt;Motor&lt;/a&gt; and electrical equipment of this jib crane are explosion proof. Traveling mechanism is spark proof for ExdII CT4 explosion-proof grade. So, this jib crane can be used at the environment with explosion gas formed by inflammable gas, steam and air.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;Hoisting and Traveling:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;The electric hoist carries out lifting and traveling on the jib arm. And the jib beam can be reversed by the rotating roller of the reducer on the reversing equipment, and the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.weihuacraneglobal.com/product/Hoist-Crane-Distribution-Box.html&quot; title=&quot;Weihua Crane&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;transition: 0.5s&quot;&gt;electric control box&lt;/a&gt; is installed on the hoist.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;It is especially suitable for short-distance, frequent use and tense lifting operations. It has the characteristics of high efficiency, energy saving, small footprint, easy operation and repair.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Barlow-Medium; white-space: normal; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;default/20260519/9cecd9a0e7d4d7a193a1a31a0236cb47.webp&quot; title=&quot;explosion-proof-jib-crane-5-ton.webp&quot; alt=&quot;explosion-proof-jib-crane-5-ton.webp&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;Capacity 5 Ton Explosion-Proof Jib Crane for Petroleum Industry&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;Control:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;This crane is controlled by pendant. There are 2-6 buttons on the pendant. Generally, the 6-button pendant can carry out fast rise, fast fall, slow rise, slow fall, reversal movement, and the horizontal movement of the hoist trolley.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;For Safety:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;1. Do not press the fast and slow buttons at the same time; do not press horizontal and vertical rotation buttons at the same time during operation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;2. Make sure there is no one under the jib arm during working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;3. Stop the oblique pulling of heavy objects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);font-family: Barlow-Medium;white-space: normal&quot;&gt;4. Prevent overload lifting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Barlow-Medium; white-space: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
