&lt;!-- Title --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 28px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Customized Free-Standing Jib Crane Solutions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane provides fully customized Free-Standing Jib Crane solutions designed for independent workstation lifting, offering flexible rotation, high efficiency, and stable performance for a wide range of industrial applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Key parameters such as &lt;strong&gt;lifting capacity, arm length, lifting height, and rotation angle&lt;/strong&gt; can be flexibly customized to suit different working environments, making it ideal for production lines, warehouses, and maintenance workshops.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Configurations --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Optional Configurations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Electric chain hoist or wire rope hoist options&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Manual or motorized rotation system&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Remote control or pendant control system&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;360° full rotation or customized rotation angle&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Heavy-duty base foundation design for stable operation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Summary --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-left: 5px solid #22c55e; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #374151;&quot;&gt;Our engineering team ensures &lt;strong&gt;stable operation, flexible handling, and long service life&lt;/strong&gt;, providing efficient lifting solutions for workshops, assembly lines, warehouses, and maintenance stations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
