('101', '28', 'Explosion-proof Bridge Crane QB Type', 'explosion-proof-bridge-crane-qb-type', NULL, 'portal/20260515/3bbd7a4ee99b8b2d66fda4cc04a3283f.jpg', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260506\\/c16974aa8b13ee2de4e8bb6e97c5f8d2.png\",\"name\":\"Explosion-proof Bridge Crane QB Type (1).png\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260506\\/c0b9fa3bd1a6077660a3e947a922021a.png\",\"name\":\"Explosion-proof Bridge Crane QB Type (3).png\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260506\\/653fc796c2c26e4371bf71207058b760.png\",\"name\":\"Explosion-proof Bridge Crane QB Type (4).png\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260506\\/b9b76ffdf5efefc055e31c598ca321a5.png\",\"name\":\"Explosion-proof Bridge Crane QB Type (5).png\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260506\\/d34699218575e2f7bd1f15b9f48e7e32.png\",\"name\":\"Explosion-proof Bridge Crane QB Type (2).png\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '5~75ton', '', '0.5~31.5meter', 'According to your demands', 'A4', 'Explosion-proof Bridge Crane QB Type features a flameproof bridge structure with dual-girder design, offering safe operation, high load capacity, and reliable performance in hazardous environments.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:12px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:16px;color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;The Double Beam Explosion-Proof Bridge Crane is a special lifting equipment designed for hazardous environments containing flammable, explosive gas or dust. It is widely used in industries requiring strict safety protection and reliable explosion-proof performance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Standards --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:12px;padding:22px;margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Standards &amp;amp; Explosion-Proof Rating&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px;color:#374151;&quot;&gt;All motors and electrical components comply with &lt;strong&gt;GB3836.2-2000&lt;/strong&gt; (Flameproof Enclosure “d”) standard for explosive gas atmospheres.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px;color:#374151;&quot;&gt;The overall crane design complies with &lt;strong&gt;JB/T5897-2006&lt;/strong&gt; “Explosion-proof Bridge Cranes”.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;color:#374151;&quot;&gt;Explosion-proof ratings: &lt;strong&gt;Exd IIB T4&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Exd IIC T4&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Structure --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:12px;padding:22px;margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Main Structure&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px;color:#374151;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Main Beam:&lt;/strong&gt; Made of high-strength corrosion-resistant alloy steel or explosion-proof compliant materials. It effectively reduces risks caused by static electricity and sparks. Automatic submerged arc welding ensures high-quality welds and strong structural stability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px;color:#374151;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Electric Trolley:&lt;/strong&gt; Uses I-beam track cable conduction system, ensuring safe and reliable power transmission while reducing operational hazards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;color:#374151;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Electrical System:&lt;/strong&gt; Equipped with explosion-proof motors, flameproof electrical components, and explosion-proof limit switches. The sealed structure effectively isolates internal sparks or arcs from external explosive environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Application --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:12px;padding:22px;margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Applications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0;padding-left:20px;color:#374151;line-height:1.9;font-size:16px;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Chemical Industry:&lt;/strong&gt; Safe handling of flammable and explosive chemical materials.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oil &amp;amp; Gas Industry:&lt;/strong&gt; Suitable for environments with flammable gases and liquids.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pharmaceutical Industry:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensures contamination-free and safe production processes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coal Mining:&lt;/strong&gt; Designed for dusty underground working environments requiring explosion protection.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Note --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#fff7f7;border:1px solid #f3d6d6;border-left:5px solid #e53935;border-radius:12px;padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 10px;font-size:20px;color:#b91c1c;&quot;&gt;Specification&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;color:#374151;&quot;&gt;Specifications can be customized according to user requirements such as lifting capacity, span, lifting height, and working environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/58da1a3619a66cc5afd4a8828cb1ddb4.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
