&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane provides fully customized Explosion-Proof Bridge Crane (QB Type) solutions designed for hazardous environments, ensuring safe, reliable, and efficient lifting operations in explosive gas or dust zones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Key parameters such as &lt;strong&gt;lifting capacity, span, lifting height, duty class, and explosion-proof rating&lt;/strong&gt; can be flexibly customized to meet strict industrial safety requirements, making it suitable for chemical plants, oil &amp;amp; gas facilities, and hazardous production workshops.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
