', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Double Girder Gantry Crane with Hook Capacity 32/5 - 50/10t. describes a versatile, dual-hoist gantry crane that comes in a range of main capacities, with the specific model chosen based on the user\'s maximum lifting needs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Product Description&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;Interpretation of the Notation Double Girder Gantry Crane with Hook&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;32/5 ton model: Main hoist = 32 metric tons, Auxiliary hoist = 5 metric tons.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;50/10 ton model: Main hoist = 50 metric tons, Auxiliary hoist = 10 metric tons.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;This configuration covers a huge portion of heavy industrial lifting needs. The presence of both a Main Hoist and an Auxiliary (Aux) Hoist on the same trolley is a critical feature:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;Main Hoist: Used for the maximum rated loads (32t or 50t). It is strong but slower.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;&quot;&gt;Auxiliary Hoist: Used for frequent, lighter lifts (5t or 10t). It is faster and more precise, improving overall work efficiency. It\'s also essential for tasks like tilting loads, maintenance, or positioning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
