&lt;!-- Title --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 28px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Customized 32/5-50/10t Double Girder Gantry Crane with Hook Solutions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane provides fully customized 32/5-50/10t Double Girder Gantry Crane with Hook solutions, designed based on FEM standards with a robust structure, heavy-duty design, and high efficiency for modern heavy industrial applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Key parameters such as &lt;strong&gt;lifting capacity (32/5 - 50/10t), span, lifting height, and duty class&lt;/strong&gt; can be flexibly customized to meet different outdoor and heavy-load operation requirements, while the optimized structural design maximizes working space utilization and improves heavy-load handling efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
