('103', '19', '32t Gantry Crane', '32t-Gantry-Crane', NULL, 'portal/20260507/09c1a6d47ab499cbbb9b6217889bb9b4.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260507\\/09c1a6d47ab499cbbb9b6217889bb9b4.webp\",\"name\":\"32t Gantry Crane (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260507\\/09c1a6d47ab499cbbb9b6217889bb9b4.webp\",\"name\":\"32t Gantry Crane (3).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260507\\/09c1a6d47ab499cbbb9b6217889bb9b4.webp\",\"name\":\"32t Gantry Crane (4).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260507\\/09c1a6d47ab499cbbb9b6217889bb9b4.webp\",\"name\":\"32t Gantry Crane.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '32t', '30m', '', '3 phase 50Hz 380V', 'A5', 'The 32 t gantry crane is a large lifting gantry crane used for underground construction and lifting work of equipment and personnel.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;The ME32+3t-30m A5 gantry crane is a indoor lifting gantry crane designed and manufactured for a machinery workshop. It is mainly used for underground construction and lifting work of equipment and personnel.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Key Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Key Features &amp;amp; Advantages&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The trolley hoisting mechanism adopts double mechanism arrangement to increase the capacity of the rope and safety;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The hoisting mechanism adopts redundant design with height display and it has protection functions in case of broken shaft, broken rope, over speed, overload;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The gantry structure adopts lightweight design and finite element analysis to make the structure more optimized and reasonable, and its own weight is light, which reduces the wheel pressure;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Variable span, suitable for different site conditions;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Overall processing of crane and trolley with high assembly precision;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The components are durable and maintenance-free, equipped with hardened surface reducer, welding reel, rolling pulley and forged wheel;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Quick on-site installation and disassembly;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The whole machine adopts frequency conversion and PLC control technology, which has stable lifting operation, small impact and low noise;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The overall design of the crane is a perfect combination of CTS system and mechanical design, with stable operation;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The whole machine is equipped with electrical intelligent anti-sway function, which greatly improves the production efficiency of the whole machine and prolongs the service life;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;With intelligent monitoring system, monitor and record the operating parameters of the crane;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Equipped with manual and button control, use the upper and lower software limit to decelerate and stop, and use the touch screen to adjust the lift height.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/58da1a3619a66cc5afd4a8828cb1ddb4.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Water Conservancy And Hydropower&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;The dam-top gantry crane is installed on the top of a hydropower station dam. It is mainly used for gate lifting and material handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/53f8e47cb680e45180638afe05fd7034.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Wind Power Industry&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Weihua cranes are widely used in offshore wind power projects, especially for wind turbine installation and large component handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/7c19456728d86c85236af98f565ce874.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Shipyard Cranes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Shipyard gantry cranes are designed for shipbuilding operations, including section lifting, turning, assembly, and launching.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/4a0f53f988ee6f3023455792bf0a34c6.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Steel Mill Cranes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Weihua metallurgical cranes are used in steel mills covering lifting needs from smelting to finished product handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 20px 10px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
