&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane provides fully customized 32t Gantry Crane solutions designed for industrial workshops, stockyards, and heavy-load handling scenarios, offering high lifting capacity (32t), precise operation, and reliable performance for heavy material management.&lt;/p&gt;
