('104', '23', 'Boat and Yacht Handling Crane', 'Boat-and-Yacht-Handling-Crane', NULL, 'portal/20260513/15ae69b0546b243cc323061c3f12f53b.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/15ae69b0546b243cc323061c3f12f53b.webp\",\"name\":\"Boat and Yacht Handling Crane (4).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260507\\/852cfd6733a7491f3eda0e73fad0d77c.webp\",\"name\":\"Boat and Yacht Handling Crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260507\\/8cfc348ad7581550ca235aa023eda987.webp\",\"name\":\"Boat and Yacht Handling Crane (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/1e765c32c260491f2388bf73b64141b7.webp\",\"name\":\"Boat and Yacht Handling Crane (3).webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '10-800t', '5-15m', '6-18m', '3 phase 50Hz 380V', '', 'This boat and yacht handling crane can handling different tons boat or yacht (10T-800T) from the shore side, it can be used for the maintenance on the shore side or can put the new boat into the water. ', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;A yacht handling crane, also known as mobile boat handler, is a rubber tire gantry crane designed to handle yachts and boats, widely used in water sports games, yacht clubs, navigation, shipping and learning, etc. It can transport different tonnage (32 tons - 1000 tons) of boats or yachts from the shore dock for on-shore maintenance, repair or launching of new vessels.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Key Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Features of Yacht Handling Crane&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;For the crane traveling, this crane can move in diagonal direction, this boat and yacht handling crane also can steer in 90 degree and put the boat in any designated position according to requirements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;This crane can be adjusted the width of the main girder according to the boat in case to handling different side boat.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;This yacht handling crane is of low expense, high performance, easy to operate and maintenance and so on.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Low cost on the daily operation, it adopts the soft and firm belt to ensure there is no harm to the boat when hoisting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;This boat crane can make the boat in order quickly; it also can adjust the gap between each boat according to different condition.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Structure &amp; Components --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Structure and Components&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;The boat and yacht handling crane includes the following items: main structure, traveling wheel block, hoisting mechanism, steering mechanism, hydraulic transmission system and electric control system. The main structure is N type, which can transfer the boat/yacht with height surpass crane\'s height.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Applications --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Applications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;According to different requirements of our customers, the boat handling crane can handle different tonnage boats or yachts (10T-800T) from the shore side, it can be used for the maintenance on the shore side or can put the new boat into the water. This yacht handling crane has soft and firm belt to lift the boat and yacht so that it will never hurt the surface. This crane also can put the boat in sequence quickly with small gap between each two boat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
