&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;&quot;&gt;Weihua Cranes ranks among the top sellers in China\'s crane industry, boasting high brand awareness and market share. Its products are widely used in numerous national key projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 450px; min-width: 300px; background: #f3f3f3; padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;default/20260424/467d4a2a355a54ca0f34d80317b858ba.png&quot; alt=&quot;Full Service&quot; style=&quot;width: 64px; height: 64px; object-fit: contain; margin-bottom: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 14px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Full Service&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;&quot;&gt;Weihua provides a one-stop service, encompassing consultation and planning, solution design, installation, and localized technical support worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 450px; min-width: 300px; background: #f3f3f3; padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;default/20260424/afcfb65440a841b405fc0f9ce44b8ae1.png&quot; alt=&quot;Excellent Product Quality&quot; style=&quot;width: 64px; height: 64px; object-fit: contain; margin-bottom: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 14px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Excellent Product Quality&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane employs automated production lines and precision machining equipment. Key components are sourced from well-known domestic and international brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 450px; min-width: 300px; background: #f3f3f3; padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;default/20260424/6f13f30218a6f6354b3e729b620a1090.png&quot; alt=&quot;High Safety&quot; style=&quot;width: 64px; height: 64px; object-fit: contain; margin-bottom: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 14px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;High Safety&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;&quot;&gt;Weihua Lifting strictly adheres to international standards such as GB and FEM. Key structures adopt high safety factors to ensure precise operation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Title --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 28px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Customized Gantry Crane for Shield Tunneling Machines Solutions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane provides fully customized Gantry Crane for Shield Tunneling Machines solutions designed for tunnel construction sites and shield machine storage yards, offering high lifting capacity, precise handling, and reliable performance for shield tunneling machine transportation and management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Key parameters such as &lt;strong&gt;lifting capacity, span, lifting height, and rail gauge&lt;/strong&gt; can be flexibly adjusted to suit different tunnel construction site layouts and shield tunneling machine handling requirements, ensuring efficient and safe operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Configurations --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Optional Configurations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Electric or hybrid drive trolley options&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Automated control and remote operation system&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anti-sway and positioning system for precise shield tunneling machine handling&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Energy-saving drive systems and regenerative braking&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Customized design to match specific tunnel construction site and storage yard rail layouts&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Summary --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-left: 5px solid #22c55e; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #374151;&quot;&gt;Our engineering team ensures &lt;strong&gt;high efficiency, safety, and long-term reliability&lt;/strong&gt;, providing advanced solutions for modern shield tunneling machine handling, tunnel construction sites and storage yards.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '{\"input\":{\"lifting_capacity\":\"Capacity\",\"lifting_height\":\"Lifting Height\",\"span\":\"Span\",\"operating_voltage\":\"Voltage\\/Hertz\",\"job_level\":\"Working Class\"},\"content\":{\"overview\":\"Product Overview\",\"scenario\":\"Application Scenario\",\"certificate\":\"Certificate\",\"features\":\"Features\",\"customized\":\"Customized\"}}', '[{\"param_content_name\":\"Parameter\",\"param_content_val\":\"&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;default\\/20260507\\/0d5b27cbf4e0a79dc8d2078ad381e17f.png&quot; title=&quot;结构图.png&quot; alt=&quot;结构图.png&quot;&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;\"}]', '10000', '0', '1778141093', '1778725447', NULL, '', '', ''),
('106', '19', 'Gantry Crane for Shipbuilding', 'Gantry-Crane-for-Shipbuilding', NULL, 'portal/20260513/5a99af414047c9bed4e4011afd6f5967.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/5a99af414047c9bed4e4011afd6f5967.webp\",\"name\":\"Gantry Crane for Shipbuilding.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/c1eb69ac15d26ab13f7850b44f513850.webp\",\"name\":\"dd36bfabdb4f9fc53db2a9b2d4b62004_副本.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/6c58a0bc10b5df989c12e95ab76b109f.webp\",\"name\":\"Gantry Crane for Shipbuilding (3).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/7150ba7767db12e0e496328a6e647cbe.webp\",\"name\":\"Gantry Crane for Shipbuilding (4).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/d86d9729f103d67121b6ded2960edfd2.webp\",\"name\":\"Gantry Crane for Shipbuilding (2).webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', ' 2×50+100t, 2×75+100t, 2×100+160t, 2×150+200t, 2×400+400t', '28～76/10～50m', '50～185m', '3 phase 50Hz 380V', 'A5', 'The shipbuilding gantry crane can be single girder gantry crane and double girder gantry crane. When it comes to large span and lifting weight, we suggest the single girder gantry crane which is more economy.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;The ship building gantry crane can be single girder gantry crane and double girder gantry crane. When it comes to large span and lifting weight, we suggest the single girder gantry crane for ship building which is more economy. Weihua has rich experience on the manufacturing of gantry cranes for ship building with big lifting weight, lifting height and span.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Structure &amp; Components --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Structure and Components&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;The single girder gantry crane for ship building is mainly composed of steel gantry frame, upper trolley, lower trolley, trolley travelling mechanism, maintenance, lubrication, elevator and electric equipment. And there are rail clamp device (or wheel actuator), anchor device, lifting weight limiter system, wind speed and direction system, limit switch of each mechanism, and the other safety protection device for this crane. The deviation rectifying system can be equipped in case of very large span.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Main Data --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Main Data of Gantry Crane for Ship Building&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lifting weight: 10-200t;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lifting height: 8-12m;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Standard span: 5-35m&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
