 text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;330&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:6px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;700&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:6px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;750&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:6px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:6px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;Total power&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:6px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;KW&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:6px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;400&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:6px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;530&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:6px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;650&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:6px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;1550&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:6px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;1500&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:6px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#f9f9f9;&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:6px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot; colspan=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Power&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:6px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot; colspan=&quot;5&quot;&gt;3-phase AC 50Hz 10KV&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #666; padding:6px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot; colspan=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tbody&gt;&lt;\\/table&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n\"}]', '10000', '0', '1778142153', '1778725415', NULL, '', '', ''),
('107', '19', 'Gantry Crane with Electric Hoist', 'Gantry-Crane-with-Electric-Hoist', NULL, 'portal/20260513/992a8bb571e91528dda85e91f8a6e841.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/992a8bb571e91528dda85e91f8a6e841.webp\",\"name\":\"Gantry Crane with Electric Hoist.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/f213e6f806520b42203880bd7284715b.webp\",\"name\":\"Gantry Crane with Electric Hoist (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/194de2e442430864a003eedc894fe5b4.webp\",\"name\":\"Gantry Crane with Electric Hoist (4).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/fb6dbe29de3b0a118eb6760aa5574a0a.webp\",\"name\":\"Gantry Crane with Electric Hoist (3).webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '1-32 ton', '6-12m', '12-35m', '3 phase 50Hz 380V', '', 'Single-beam hoist gantry crane is a common light and small lifting equipment. Gantry crane with electric hoist suitable for cargo loading and unloading operations in warehouses, factories, and docks. ', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;A single-girder gantry crane (with electric hoist) is a steel frame (gantry) that can move on ground tracks like a &quot;gate&quot;. It is equipped with a main beam on which an electric hoist that can move back and forth along the main beam is installed as a lifting mechanism.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Electric Hoist Types --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Electric Hoist Types&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;As the core component of the lifting mechanism, the electric hoist is located below the main beam and moves along the main beam. Weihua Group can provide various types of electric hoists, including CD1 type wire rope electric hoist, MD type wire rope electric hoist, Low headroom electric hoist, Explosion-proof electric hoist, Electric chain hoist, and European type electric hoist.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Advantages of the gantry crane structure: It eliminates the need for a fixed factory building, allowing operation via ground tracks under open-air or simple sheds, significantly expanding the working area and making it ideal for handling large quantities of stacked materials.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Economy of the single-girder + electric hoist combination: Compared to double-girder gantry cranes, it offers lower procurement, installation, and operation/maintenance costs. It is the most cost-effective choice for low to medium working frequency and lifting capacities (commonly 3 to 20 tons).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;High flexibility: Single-girder gantry crane with electric hoist equipped with a wireless remote control, the operator can follow the goods on the ground, providing excellent visibility and precise positioning, allowing a single person to complete complex lifting operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Comprehensive functionality: It possesses three-dimensional spatial movement capabilities (trolley forward/backward, trolley left/right, hoist up/down), meeting most handling and positioning needs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Applications --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Applications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Open-air Stockyards/Storage Yards: Single-girder gantry cranes can quickly load, unload, and transport steel, timber, building materials, and cargo containers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;External Workshop Areas: Small hoist gantry cranes can be used in conjunction with bridge cranes inside workshops for inter-process transfers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Logistics and Warehousing: Gantry cranes with electric hoists can be used for loading and unloading goods at warehouse entrances or for stacking goods inside large warehouses.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Equipment Installation and Maintenance: Used for equipment hoisting and maintenance in fixed locations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Precast Concrete Component Plants: Hoisting and transporting concrete components.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/58da1a3619a66cc5afd4a8828cb1ddb4.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Water Conservancy And Hydropower&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;The dam-top gantry crane is installed on the top of a hydropower station dam. It is mainly used for gate lifting and material handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/53f8e47cb680e45180638afe05fd7034.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Wind Power Industry&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Weihua cranes are widely used in offshore wind power projects, especially for wind turbine installation and large component handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/7c19456728d86c85236af98f565ce874.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Shipyard Cranes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Shipyard gantry cranes are designed for shipbuilding operations, including section lifting, turning, assembly, and launching.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/4a0f53f988ee6f3023455792bf0a34c6.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Steel Mill Cranes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Weihua metallurgical cranes are used in steel mills covering lifting needs from smelting to finished product handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 20px 10px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 450px; min-width: 300px; background: #f3f3f3; padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;default/20260424/cd61e7f2b73f4a62799b48c3bc88092f.png&quot; alt=&quot;Brand Reputation&quot; style=&quot;width: 64px; height: 64px; object-fit: contain; margin-bottom: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 14px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Brand Reputation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;&quot;&gt;Weihua Cranes ranks among the top sellers in China\'s crane industry, boasting high brand awareness and market share. Its products are widely used in numerous national key projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 450px; min-width: 300px; background: #f3f3f3; padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;default/20260424/467d4a2a355a54ca0f34d80317b858ba.png&quot; alt=&quot;Full Service&quot; style=&quot;width: 64px; height: 64px; object-fit: contain; margin-bottom: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 14px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Full Service&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;&quot;&gt;Weihua provides a one-stop service, encompassing consultation and planning, solution design, installation, and localized technical support worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 450px; min-width: 300px; background: #f3f3f3; padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;default/20260424/afcfb65440a841b405fc0f9ce44b8ae1.png&quot; alt=&quot;Excellent Product Quality&quot; style=&quot;width: 64px; height: 64px; object-fit: contain; margin-bottom: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 14px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Excellent Product Quality&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane employs automated production lines and precision machining equipment. Key components are sourced from well-known domestic and international brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 450px; min-width: 300px; background: #f3f3f3; padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;default/20260424/6f13f30218a6f6354b3e729b620a1090.png&quot; alt=&quot;High Safety&quot; style=&quot;width: 64px; height: 64px; object-fit: contain; margin-bottom: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 14px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;High Safety&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;&quot;&gt;Weihua Lifting strictly adheres to international standards such as GB and FEM. Key structures adopt high safety factors to ensure precise operation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Title --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 28px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Customized Gantry Crane with Electric Hoist Solutions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane provides fully customized Gantry Crane with Electric Hoist solutions designed for factories, warehouses, workshops and outdoor storage yards, offering high lifting capacity, precise handling, and reliable performance for goods, equipment and component management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Key parameters such as &lt;strong&gt;lifting capacity, span, lifting height, and rail gauge&lt;/strong&gt; can be flexibly adjusted to suit different workshop, warehouse or storage yard layouts and material handling requirements, ensuring efficient and safe operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Configurations --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Optional Configurations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Automated control and remote operation system&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anti-sway and positioning system for precise material and equipment handling&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Energy-saving drive systems and regenerative braking&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Customized design to match specific workshop, warehouse or storage yard rail layouts and handling process needs&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Summary --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-left: 5px solid #22c55e; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #374151;&quot;&gt;Our engineering team ensures &lt;strong&gt;high efficiency, safety, and long-term reliability&lt;/strong&gt;, providing advanced solutions for modern factories, warehouses, workshops and outdoor storage and handling operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
