('108', '19', 'MG Double Girder Truss Gantry Crane', 'MG-Double-Girder-Truss-Gantry-Crane', NULL, 'portal/20260513/df02e615d070b7ee5f383973084e74ca.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/df02e615d070b7ee5f383973084e74ca.webp\",\"name\":\"MG Double Girder Truss Gantry Crane (2) - 副本.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/c6899a80718e7a99c261542a2f015157.webp\",\"name\":\"MG Double Girder Truss Gantry Crane (4).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/18cd90fb4bce2560f249346a8ddb0e26.webp\",\"name\":\"MG Double Girder Truss Gantry Crane (3).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/df02e615d070b7ee5f383973084e74ca.webp\",\"name\":\"MG Double Girder Truss Gantry Crane (2).webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '40-100Ton', '', '20-40m', '3 phase 50Hz 380V', 'A5', 'MG Double Girder Truss Gantry Cranes are used in industries such as ports, shipbuilding, steel, water conservancy, and mining.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;MG double girder truss gantry crane is a tried and tested solution for the lifting demands in outdoor construction sites. With the winch trolley on the two parallel truss girder, Weihua double truss gantry crane provides strong and steady lifting capability. Thanks to the high precision welding robots, the truss girder shows great stiffness against the heavy load.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Key Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Key Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;High rigidity of steel structures with a low deadweight&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Advanced modular design and secure connection at each joint&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Easy installation, maintenance and dismantling&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Low wind resistance thanks to the truss structure&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compatibility with various accessories to lift different cargos&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Full support of Weihua AICrane system for higher efficiency&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Crane Advantages --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Crane Advantages&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Thanks to the truss structure, Weihua Construction MG features light deadweight and many other strongpoints. The low wind drag makes the gantry crane stand still on open construction yards. The modular design provides ease of assembly, dismantling, maintenance and transport. Different from traditional box girder cranes, wind blows through the truss with low friction, keeping stability in strong winds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:12px 0 0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua AICrane system enables intelligent identification, automatic braking, and improves both working efficiency and operation safety.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Applications --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Applications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ports: Container and cargo loading &amp;amp; unloading&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shipbuilding industry: Hull assembly and disassembly&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Steel industry: Steel plate and profile handling&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Water conservancy construction: Heavy equipment lifting&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mines: Ore and coal transportation &amp;amp; loading&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
