('109', '19', 'MH Gantry Crane with Electric Hoist', 'MH-Gantry-Crane-with-Electric-Hoist', NULL, 'portal/20260513/924f34d9488fd71736662352d06faa3e.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/924f34d9488fd71736662352d06faa3e.webp\",\"name\":\"Electric-Hoist-Gantry-Crane_(4).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/7217daedc7187132950e724748ac198d.webp\",\"name\":\"Electric-Hoist-Gantry-Crane_(2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/fa8539c3d60cf0d5a5a1811d7c28074c.webp\",\"name\":\"Electric-Hoist-Gantry-Crane_(3).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/ba5d5dc46cfb21cfec4bd678f328a933.webp\",\"name\":\"Electric-Hoist-Gantry-Crane_(1).webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '5～50t', '10～12m', '18～35m', '3 phase 50Hz 380V', 'A5', 'MH model gantry crane is widely used at open ground and warehouses for loading and grabbing materials.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;MH model gantry crane with electric hoist is used together with CD1, MD1 model electric hoists, which is a small and medium-sized gantry crane travelling on tracks. The general lifting weight is 5-20t, span is 14-35m, and working temperature is -20~ +40 degrees.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Applications &amp; Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Applications &amp;amp; Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Widely used at open ground and warehouses for loading and grabbing materials.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Two operation modes: ground operation and air operation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Flexible power supply: cable car and cable drum reel for customers to choose.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Technical Characteristics --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Technical Characteristics&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;This gantry crane with electric hoist is a regular and practical lifting equipment, featuring stable performance, easy operation, convenient maintenance and wide application range, which can meet the daily material handling needs of various working sites.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
