('111', '19', 'Rubber Tire Track Laying Crane', 'Rubber-Tire-Track-Laying-Crane', NULL, 'portal/20260514/01bdfbf720f5b3a0c26133d09a89593f.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/95dc31ff87735eb4ce394d8aa470e3ba.webp\",\"name\":\"Rubber Tire Track Laying Crane (4).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/493c6c2673ee2bcc0354840173b9ddd7.webp\",\"name\":\"Rubber Tire Track Laying Crane (3).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/1b5ec3b5f655d00e7ffccb1aa41d4460.webp\",\"name\":\"Rubber Tire Track Laying Crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/0c891e09472e3704dc5af740445e0661.webp\",\"name\":\"Rubber Tire Track Laying Crane (2).webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '25t', '6-12m', '4-12m', '3 phase 50Hz 380V', '', 'Rubber Tire Track Laying Crane is widely used in high-speed rail, conventional rail, subway, and urban railway projects.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;The rubber tire track laying crane lifts the tracks with two sets equipment and carry the tracks into the tunnel for track laying, also used to lifting concrete tanks with casting function.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:12px 0 0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;The rubber tire track laying crane is more advanced than the traditional track-laying technology. It can be used to lift the tracks with two sets of cranes and carry the tracks into the tunnel for track laying. At the same time, it can be also used to lifting concrete tanks and with casting function.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Key Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Features of Rubber Tire Track Laying Crane&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Modular design, convenient transportation and installation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The gantry lifting, variable pitch, steering, and concrete tank lifting are all controlled by electro-hydraulic control, stepless speed regulation, and each action can be performed separately or in combination.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The concrete tank clamping mechanism is equipped with high-quality synchronous valve and safety valve, and the synchronization accuracy is over 98%.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Walking frequency control, all-wheel drive, high stability, strong ground adaptability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;One-button to control all-wheel steering and rail change, steering mechanical limit, straight travel lock and other functions, practical and efficient.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Handle and remote control, interlocking functions, safe and reliable.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
