&lt;!-- Title --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 28px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Customized Rubber Tire Track Laying Crane Solutions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane provides fully customized Rubber Tire Track Laying Crane solutions designed for railway construction, track laying engineering and road transit infrastructure operations, offering high lifting capacity, precise handling, and reliable performance for track beams, sleepers, rail components and construction equipment management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Key parameters such as &lt;strong&gt;lifting capacity, span, lifting height, and working coverage&lt;/strong&gt; can be flexibly adjusted to suit different railway site layouts and track laying construction requirements, ensuring efficient and safe operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Configurations --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Optional Configurations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Electric or hybrid drive trolley options&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Automated control and remote operation system&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anti-sway and positioning system for precise track structure and equipment handling&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Energy-saving drive systems and regenerative braking&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Customized design to match specific railway construction site layouts and track laying working conditions&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Summary --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-left: 5px solid #22c55e; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #374151;&quot;&gt;Our engineering team ensures &lt;strong&gt;high efficiency, safety, and long-term reliability&lt;/strong&gt;, providing advanced solutions for modern railway construction, track laying projects and transportation infrastructure engineering operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '{\"input\":{\"lifting_capacity\":\"Capacity\",\"lifting_height\":\"Lifting Height\",\"span\":\"Span\",\"operating_voltage\":\"Voltage\\/Hertz\",\"job_level\":\"Working Class\"},\"content\":{\"overview\":\"Product Overview\",\"scenario\":\"Application Scenario\",\"certificate\":\"Certificate\",\"features\":\"Features\",\"customized\":\"Customized\"}}', '[]', '10000', '0', '1778148588', '1778725306', NULL, '', '', ''),
('112', '19', 'Rubber Tire Gantry Crane for Steel Pipe Handling', 'Rubber-Tire-Gantry-Crane-for-Steel-Pipe-Handling', NULL, 'portal/20260514/e9ee90fea30eccb999824420a6452cf8.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260507\\/8f27e7d3a3f8806bcbdabfca52399901.jpg\",\"name\":\"rubber-tire-gantry-crane-steel-pipe-handling2.jpg\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/e650e4dce73aa20fcdb328224d7b41f6.webp\",\"name\":\"rubber-tire-gantry-crane-steel-pipe-handling(1).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/363ff80436fcc9d02a264b251d193c81.webp\",\"name\":\"rubber-tire-gantry-crane-steel-pipe-handling1.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '10+10t; 18+18t', '6m', '', '3 phase 50Hz 380V', 'A6', 'Rubber Tire Gantry Crane for Steel Pipe Handling is a rubber tyred mobile crane with electromagnetic beam spreader for handling of steel pipes.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Rubber Tire Gantry Crane for Steel Pipe Handling is a rubber tyred mobile crane with electromagnetic beam spreader for handling of steel pipes. Rubber tire gantry crane for steel pipe handling works outdoor, can lift several steel pipes at once, carry out 0° traveling, 45° traversing, 90° traversing and in-place steering.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Key Technical Parameters --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Key Technical Parameters&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lifting Capacity: 10+10t (without hook and magnet); 18+18t (without hook)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Classification Level: A6&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Max. Lifting Height: 6m&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Max. Wheel Load: 300KN&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Operating Slop: 3% (full load); 8% (unload)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Operation: Operator\'s cabin&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Cross Traveling Mechanism --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Cross Traveling Mechanism&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Traveling Speed: 30m/min&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Running Mode: Traction straight&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Driving Mode: Hydraulic&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Long Traveling Mechanism --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Long Traveling Mechanism&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Traveling Speed: 100m/min&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Running Mode: Straight, transverse, fixed point, rotation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Driving Mode: Hydraulic&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
