('113', '19', 'Semi Gantry Crane BMG Type', 'Semi-Gantry-Crane-BMG-Type', NULL, 'portal/20260513/40b591821ea22d4629f19cacda9a2e79.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/40b591821ea22d4629f19cacda9a2e79.webp\",\"name\":\"Semi Gantry Crane BMG Type (4).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/eac4842cf2830413fd89a99aead87b0d.webp\",\"name\":\"Semi Gantry Crane BMG Type (3).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/5086d20a10ed720628f46a6e1010d4c4.webp\",\"name\":\"Semi Gantry Crane BMG Type.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/7452de05885e6b3014484b512ac43eb0.webp\",\"name\":\"Semi Gantry Crane BMG Type (2).webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '5-320t', '5-30m', '6-24m', '3 phase 50Hz 380V', 'A5 A6 A7', 'Semi Gantry Crane BMG Type is suitable for material loading, unloading, and handling in mining ports, railway freight stations, open-air warehouses. ', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;BMG semi gantry crane consists of two main beams, electric trolley and supporting leg on one side. This design allows one end of the crane to be fixed to a building wall, column or other structure, while the other end is supported by independent legs. Adopting this structure of gantry crane can fully utilize the site space. The main beam adopts a box welded structure, and the large vehicle operating mechanism is driven separately. Semi gantry crane operation includes ground operation, remote control operation, and cabin operation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:12px 0 0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;There are two conductive forms of semi gantry cranes: cables and sliding contact wires. Such a structure allows the semi-gantry crane to cover a larger working area and provide an efficient material handling solution in limited spaces.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Key Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The gantry adopts a box shaped double beam and π - shape leg welded structure, which is reliable. It is more stable than other shape design.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The conductive forms of are cable drum type and sliding contact wire type (optional). Users could have multiple choice of different options.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Electric trolley adopts irregular steel rail cables for conductivity. Therefore, it could perform lifting mission with higher performance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;All institutions are in the control room, which is convenient and flexible. This exceptional design creats easier control process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Structure &amp; Components --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Structure &amp;amp; Operating Performance&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;The semi-gantry crane is contactless, with module speed control, and can achieve micro speed and dual speed. The operation and lifting are particularly smooth. And the electronic control is simple and close to frequency conversion function. The control panel (handle) adopts 12V voltage and 380V voltage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Applications --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Applications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;It is suitable for material loading, unloading, and handling in mining ports, railway freight stations, open-air warehouses. And it can match with various lifting devices for special operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Users could put it in the industrial plants. This gantry crane could lift heavy equipment and machine parts, especially in the limited and small space.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Also it is suitable for loading, unloading and stacking goods in logistics centers and warehouses.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
