ot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Q3 (middle class)&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#f9f9f9;&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;td rowspan=&quot;2&quot; style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:left; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;Speed&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Main lifting&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;1.57 m\\/min&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;travelling&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;19.4 m\\/min&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#f9f9f9;&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Total power&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:center;&quot;&gt;KW&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;64&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Crane rail recommended&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:center;&quot;&gt;—&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;QU80&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#f9f9f9;&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Max. wheel loading&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:center;&quot;&gt;KN&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;577&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Power&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:center;&quot;&gt;—&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Three-phase AC 50Hz 380V&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tbody&gt;&lt;\\/table&gt;\"}]', '10000', '0', '1778221396', '1778724391', NULL, '', '', ''),
('118', '19', 'FEM/DIN Double Girder Gantry Crane', 'FEM/DIN-Double-Girder-Gantry-Crane', NULL, 'portal/20260514/39f3bd1892fbedcce55bc7527e7ebbae.jpg', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/c10008a1f9eee5803840a1335c96ae75.webp\",\"name\":\"FEM-DIN-gantry-crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/b55b7cb7cddf625149b491be894c9ae6.webp\",\"name\":\"FEM-DIN-Double-girder-gantry-crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/033d512be172907059ce11db8dc8e35f.webp\",\"name\":\"FEM-DIN-Double-girder-gantry-crane1.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '10t, 20/5t, 32/5t, 50/10t, or other', '10m, 12m or other', '18～35m', '3 phase 50Hz 380V', 'A5', 'FEM/DIN double girder gantry cranes are widely applied in machinery manufacturing, steel yards, construction sites, and heavy industrial workshops for high-precision and heavy-duty material lifting and handling.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;FEM/DIN Double Girder Gantry Crane adopts international standard design, featuring lightweight structure, stable performance, energy saving and high efficiency, which is widely used in factories, yards, logistics and industrial material handling scenarios.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Key Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Features of FEM/DIN Double Girder Gantry Crane&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adopt modularization design for lifting mechanism, FEM/DIN standard, light weight&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;High-strength alloy-steel forging wheels&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;No welded legs for profile steel&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Capsule cab with broad vision&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Rectangular steel-pipe handrail&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hard tooth surface reducer imported from Germany&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Power supplied by engineering drag chain&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;World\'s leading anti-sway control technology&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Advanced fabricated technology&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Low-energy and maintenance-free&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Advantages --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Advantages of FEM/DIN Double Girder Gantry Crane&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The overall height of the FEM/DIN double girder gantry crane crane can be 20%~25% lower than that of traditional crane with weight reduced by 20%~30%.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The maximum wheel pressure can deduct by 15% ~ 20%.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The small size of this crane can increase the working area.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;With the lightness structure it can cut the construction costs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each spare parts on the crane are design to series standard modulus, which makes easy for the product combination.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The independent modulus is convenient for the transportation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Standard modulus production can ensure stability quality of the product and shorten the delivery period.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sandblasting pretreatment for the steel plate with surface quality reaching Sa2.5.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Using digital cutting machine to cut the web plate to ensure the smooth and precision of the camber curvilinear.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Main welding seam adopts auto arc merged welding, Ultrasonic, X-ray nondestructive inspection.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The crane and trolley frame adopts floor type boring machine to ensure the flatness of the machine side.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/58da1a3619a66cc5afd4a8828cb1ddb4.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
