&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Weihua cranes are widely used in offshore wind power projects, especially for wind turbine installation and large component handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/7c19456728d86c85236af98f565ce874.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
