('121', '19', 'Gantry Crane for Railway Construction', 'Gantry-Crane-for-Railway-Construction', NULL, 'portal/20260513/4e14524e3eb2f895bb8b1ff672e8c2f2.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/52c6b845ed5553c3646e4b6fa5c80ab5.webp\",\"name\":\"450t-high-speed-railway-gantry-crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/4e14524e3eb2f895bb8b1ff672e8c2f2.webp\",\"name\":\"450t-railway-beam-gantry-crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/d5717e5a329324a2bb183c14ef2fbab8.webp\",\"name\":\"railway-construction-crane_(1).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/1c06982b201dfdda4e286c040d8c8eef.webp\",\"name\":\"railway-construction-crane_(2).webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '50-900 tons', '1.2-22m', '4-18m', '', '', 'Gantry Crane for Railway Construction is specially designed for the span beam/bridge moving and transport for railway construction.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;The gantry crane for railway construction is specially designed for the concrete span beam/bridge moving and transport for railway construction. Users can use 2 cranes 500t (450t) or 1 crane 1000t (900t) with 2 lifting points to handle railway beam.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Structure &amp; Components --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Structure and Components&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;This railway construction gantry crane consists of main girder, rigid and flexible supporting leg, travelling mechanism, lifting mechanism, electric control system, hydraulic system, driver cabin, railing, ladder and walking plat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Key Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Features of Gantry Crane for Railway Construction&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Rubber tire type and rail-mounted type;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hydraulic driven of walking, steering and lifting;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Walk straight, oblique and rampage;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Good adaptability, high working efficiency, small space occupied;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Special spreader mainly used for lifting and transporting large concrete beam/bridge;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;two cranes, 2 trolleys with max lifting height 30m;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The max wheel load is 22t when lifting 900t stuff;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;90° shift for rail type crane to achieve horizontal or vertical walking;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;4 points for lifting and 3 points for balance to ensure even stress of the steel wire rope;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Accurate positioning for stuff lifting down;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hydraulic push for trolley to realize various lifting and save the cost;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;For the 4 hoists, it can be single use or combine use of 2 or 4 hoists while the hardware and software are interlocked for operation safety.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
