&lt;img src=&quot;default/20260424/6f13f30218a6f6354b3e729b620a1090.png&quot; alt=&quot;High Safety&quot; style=&quot;width: 64px; height: 64px; object-fit: contain; margin-bottom: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 14px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;High Safety&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;&quot;&gt;Weihua Lifting strictly adheres to international standards such as GB and FEM. Key structures adopt high safety factors to ensure precise operation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Title --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 28px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Customized Gantry Crane for Railway Construction Solutions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane provides fully customized Gantry Crane for Railway Construction solutions designed for railway construction sites and track engineering yards, offering high lifting capacity, precise handling, and reliable performance for railway components and construction materials management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Key parameters such as &lt;strong&gt;lifting capacity, span, lifting height, and rail gauge&lt;/strong&gt; can be flexibly adjusted to suit different site layouts and railway construction handling requirements, ensuring efficient and safe operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Configurations --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Optional Configurations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Electric or hybrid drive trolley options&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Automated control and remote operation system&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anti-sway and positioning system for precise railway construction handling&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Energy-saving drive systems and regenerative braking&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Customized design to match specific construction yard rail layouts&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Summary --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-left: 5px solid #22c55e; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #374151;&quot;&gt;Our engineering team ensures &lt;strong&gt;high efficiency, safety, and long-term reliability&lt;/strong&gt;, providing advanced solutions for modern railway construction yards and track engineering operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
