('122', '19', 'Gantry Crane for Subway Construction', 'Gantry-Crane-for-Subway-Construction', NULL, 'portal/20260514/17b7fe8180a6f551ef1596051960bf4c.jpg', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260508\\/e9489d16e9b53af887bb39b202593329.webp\",\"name\":\"gantry-crane-subway-construction.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260508\\/e296635d8344db02c1fad93c54d5a5ad.webp\",\"name\":\"subway-construction-crane(1).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260508\\/b5f31a471a176a257cf76c4fbb6dfba2.webp\",\"name\":\"subway-construction-crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260508\\/efa3d88b8aa76ac5c9552bd049cba195.webp\",\"name\":\"subway-construction-gantry-crane.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '16t-45/16t', '', '18, 22, 26, 30m', '', 'A6', 'The specialized gantry crane for subway construction is designed for urban subway foundation engineering, tunnel segment hoisting, track laying, and underground transportation infrastructure construction.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;With the fast development of subways, the construction machines, especially the cranes, are becoming an important role for the subway construction. Weihua has rich experience and many project cases on subway construction gantry crane.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Product Introduction --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Subway Gantry Crane for Slag Handling&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Subway gantry crane for slag handling is used for subway tunnel construction. This crane is mainly responsible for the construction of the subway tunnel, lifting the dregs excavated by shield excavator to the ground.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Key Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Features of Subway Slag Gantry Crane&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Variable span, improve crane utilization;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Cantilever detachable, more practical;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Running fast, high work duty, high efficiency;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;High lifting height;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;With special tilting spreader with automatically tipping.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Advanced Design &amp; Functions --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Advanced Design &amp;amp; Functions&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The gantry crane for subway construction is used for dealing the dregs and site material handling during subway construction.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;With the span-changed function of Min. step-length 100mm, this subway construction gantry crane is suitable for various working conditions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The cantilever is detachable, also can preserve the cantilever interface which will be flexible for different working conditions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;There is lightning protection system, wind speed detection warning system.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The gantry crane for subway construction is equipped special spreader and realize the interchange of dregs bucket and the hook.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;With the overturn hook, it realizes overturning the dregs at any position in the air. Overturning dregs system is controlled by the hydraulic which makes the overturning process more stable.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The trolley is rotatable, and can realize the front, side transporting dregs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/58da1a3619a66cc5afd4a8828cb1ddb4.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Water Conservancy And Hydropower&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;The dam-top gantry crane is installed on the top of a hydropower station dam. It is mainly used for gate lifting and material handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/53f8e47cb680e45180638afe05fd7034.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Wind Power Industry&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Weihua cranes are widely used in offshore wind power projects, especially for wind turbine installation and large component handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/7c19456728d86c85236af98f565ce874.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
