&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;This light gantry crane can be easily installed and used on any flat hardening floor;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;It can be used in many material handling situations;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;It is very economical for a single unit work;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
