&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;It offers a safe operation environment;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;This movable gantry crane can work with manual hoist or electric hoist.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
