('125', '19', 'Truss Gantry Crane', 'Truss-Gantry-Crane', NULL, 'portal/20260513/5803faafb997e4fb11ad355b099256e6.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/2870a8b317e3eb0e4e85997672f8e26a.webp\",\"name\":\"truss-gantry-crane(2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/5803faafb997e4fb11ad355b099256e6.webp\",\"name\":\"truss-gantry-crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/6e44eef92e42113736a57da3de1dfe33.webp\",\"name\":\"truss-gantry-crane1.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260513\\/8c93cef5495736341c9cc300b353435e.webp\",\"name\":\"truss-type-gantry-crane.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '3-16t', '', '12-30m', '', '', 'The truss gantry crane has latticed structure with a small windward area, light weight, good lifting ability and so on. It is an ideal lifting equipment employed in the warehouse, freight yard, terminals and other places.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;The truss gantry crane has latticed structure with a small windward area, light weight, good lifting ability and so on. It is an ideal lifting equipment employed in the warehouse, freight yard, terminals and other places.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Design Standard &amp; Matching Equipment --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Design Standard &amp;amp; Matching Equipment&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;The truss gantry crane is designed and manufactured according to the standard JB / T5663-2008 of the Ministry of Machinery Industry of China. CD1, MD1 electric hoists and trolley can be fitted on this crane. The cantilever parts can be designed according to the factory operating space.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Structure Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Structure Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;The truss gantry crane has latticed structure with a small windward area, light weight, good lifting ability and so on. This truss gantry crane is an ideal lifting equipment employed in the warehouse, freight yard, terminals and other places.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Drive &amp; Control System --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Drive &amp;amp; Control System&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;There are two ways of the crane traveling: separated drive and drive brake. This product can be controlled by handles and operating cabin. The operating cabin can be open or closed, which can be installed on the left side or right side and there are 3 ways to enter the cabin, side, end face and top to meet the needs of users in a variety circumstances.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/58da1a3619a66cc5afd4a8828cb1ddb4.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Water Conservancy And Hydropower&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;The dam-top gantry crane is installed on the top of a hydropower station dam. It is mainly used for gate lifting and material handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/53f8e47cb680e45180638afe05fd7034.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Wind Power Industry&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Weihua cranes are widely used in offshore wind power projects, especially for wind turbine installation and large component handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/7c19456728d86c85236af98f565ce874.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Shipyard Cranes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Shipyard gantry cranes are designed for shipbuilding operations, including section lifting, turning, assembly, and launching.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
