('126', '22', 'Crane for Meltshop丨Ladle Cranes', 'Crane-for-Meltshop-Ladle-Cranes', NULL, 'portal/20260509/a6a5333907b947bcd6236af48216a1a9.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/96c97b22fe5aecc589798bede369818c.webp\",\"name\":\"Crane for Meltshop (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/468c66432b9989034666dc909890a400.webp\",\"name\":\"Crane for Meltshop.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/668800193e502da0a9ef8b9ac0da8587.webp\",\"name\":\"metallurgy-overhead-crane_(3).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/a6a5333907b947bcd6236af48216a1a9.webp\",\"name\":\"metallurgy-overhead-crane_(4).webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '5t,10t,16t,20t,100/32t, 320/80t', '20/22m, 28/32m', '19.5-28.5m', '', 'A7 A8', 'Ladle cranes suitable for both ferrous and non-ferrous metals are available for any application.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Overhead crane for metallurgy is a hot-selling product manufactured by Weihua. Main lifting mechanism lifts goods with fast speed to meet the requirement of efficient production.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Product Introduction --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Product Introduction&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Ladle cranes are critical lifting equipment in smelting workshops, commonly known as &quot;molten steel cranes&quot; or &quot;metallurgical cranes,&quot; and are the &quot;lifeline&quot; cranes in the steel smelting process. They are specifically designed for lifting, tilting, and relocating ladles containing molten metal (steel and iron) in high-temperature and high-risk environments. Their safety, reliability, and operational precision requirements are extremely high, classifying them as A7 or A8 (heavy-duty, high-load) working levels among special equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Design &amp; Performance --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Design &amp;amp; Performance&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua designs and manufactures ladle cranes to ensure efficiency and uptime in production environments with continuous high capacity and harsh conditions. Ladle cranes suitable for both ferrous and non-ferrous metals are available for any application. Weihua ladle cranes can ensure efficient and safe production in customers\' smelting workshops.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Key Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Features of Weihua Metallurgy Overhead Crane&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Main lifting mechanism of Weihua metallurgy overhead crane is with fast speed to meet the requirement of efficient production. Speed regulating can be carried out by stator pressure regulation and motor frequency conversion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anti-sway system for steady and smooth operation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Accurate positioning, fully automatic, CNC control.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;European standard, FEM/DIN.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Safe and reliable, reasonable structure, economical, long service life and convenient to maintain, etc.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Safety Protection --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Safety Protection&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Main lifting mechanism is with 4 independent rope-reeving systems;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Double brake for balance beam to prevent wire-rope accident;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Emergency stop switch on main lifting mechanism;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Overload protection and anti-derailment protection;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Over speed monitoring for main lifting mechanism;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Limit switch.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
