('128', '28', 'Electric Overhead Traveling Crane', 'Electric-Overhead-Traveling-Crane', NULL, 'portal/20260509/ebbaaacf43b6e836afdd2f038a2a483d.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/ebbaaacf43b6e836afdd2f038a2a483d.webp\",\"name\":\"Electric Overhead Traveling Crane (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/88b6b908151494d979d895398ee796fb.webp\",\"name\":\"Electric Overhead Traveling Crane (3).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/e9afd05ce57eed7a4c9c9b2ca8c13cb3.webp\",\"name\":\"Electric Overhead Traveling Crane (4).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/1792b326993e60eb8dce59795dc63c22.webp\",\"name\":\"Electric Overhead Traveling Crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/83aa950a12e9d697ed2cd905e4bed3d7.webp\",\"name\":\"1cce149d8c4d7826996e0ddeccfb8578.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '5~800ton', '12-22m', '10.5~31.5m', '3 phase 50Hz 380V', 'A5 A6', 'Electric overhead traveling crane is mainly suitable for heavy industry manufacturing, energy, metallurgy, logistics, and large-scale infrastructure projects.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Electric Overhead Traveling Crane are the &quot;aerial transporters&quot; of the industrial field, with extremely wide applications covering almost all industries requiring heavy, frequent, or precise material handling. Electric bridge cranes can be used throughout the entire process of heavy industry and metal processing, such as: Iron and steel metallurgy: from blast furnace charging, ladle handling (requiring casting-grade cranes), slab handling to the stacking and loading of finished steel products (such as steel coils and profiles). In the automotive manufacturing industry: electric bridge cranes can lift large assemblies such as engines, axles, and battery packs in the final assembly workshop.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Company Introduction --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Company Introduction&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Group is a leading enterprise in China\'s crane industry. Its electric overhead traveling crane are widely used in heavy industrial manufacturing, energy, metallurgy, logistics, and large-scale infrastructure projects, enabling efficient and precise lifting and positioning of large workpieces, equipment, or raw materials.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Advantages --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Advantages of Weihua Electric Bridge Cranes (EOT Cranes)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High Cost-Effectiveness:&lt;/strong&gt; Compared to many top European and American brands, Weihua typically offers more competitive prices while providing equivalent technology and quality.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Technical Applicability:&lt;/strong&gt; Extensive R&amp;amp;D and manufacturing capabilities for electric bridge cranes allow for adaptation to various working environments, standards, and user habits.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rapid Service Response:&lt;/strong&gt; A global service network ensures convenient and efficient communication and after-sales support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Customization Capabilities:&lt;/strong&gt; Flexible response to non-standard customer needs, from special sizes and lifting tools to complete automation solutions, all can be customized.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/58da1a3619a66cc5afd4a8828cb1ddb4.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Water Conservancy And Hydropower&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;The dam-top gantry crane is installed on the top of a hydropower station dam. It is mainly used for gate lifting and material handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/53f8e47cb680e45180638afe05fd7034.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Wind Power Industry&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Weihua cranes are widely used in offshore wind power projects, especially for wind turbine installation and large component handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/7c19456728d86c85236af98f565ce874.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Shipyard Cranes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Shipyard gantry cranes are designed for shipbuilding operations, including section lifting, turning, assembly, and launching.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/4a0f53f988ee6f3023455792bf0a34c6.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Steel Mill Cranes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Weihua metallurgical cranes are used in steel mills covering lifting needs from smelting to finished product handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 20px 10px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
