&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 450px; min-width: 300px; background: #f3f3f3; padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;default/20260424/afcfb65440a841b405fc0f9ce44b8ae1.png&quot; alt=&quot;Excellent Product Quality&quot; style=&quot;width: 64px; height: 64px; object-fit: contain; margin-bottom: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 14px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Excellent Product Quality&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane employs automated production lines and precision machining equipment. Key components are sourced from well-known domestic and international brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 450px; min-width: 300px; background: #f3f3f3; padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;default/20260424/6f13f30218a6f6354b3e729b620a1090.png&quot; alt=&quot;High Safety&quot; style=&quot;width: 64px; height: 64px; object-fit: contain; margin-bottom: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 14px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;High Safety&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;&quot;&gt;Weihua Lifting strictly adheres to international standards such as GB and FEM. Key structures adopt high safety factors to ensure precise operation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Title --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 28px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Customized Electric Overhead Traveling Crane Solutions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane provides fully customized Electric Overhead Traveling Crane solutions designed for industrial workshop and factory indoor operations, offering high lifting capacity, precise handling, and reliable performance for heavy industrial material management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Key parameters such as &lt;strong&gt;lifting capacity, span, lifting height, and rail gauge&lt;/strong&gt; can be flexibly adjusted to suit different factory layouts and heavy-load handling requirements, ensuring efficient and safe operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Configurations --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Optional Configurations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Electric or hybrid drive trolley options&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Automated control and remote operation system&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anti-sway and positioning system for precise industrial goods handling&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Energy-saving drive systems and regenerative braking&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Customized design to match specific factory rail layouts&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Summary --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-left: 5px solid #22c55e; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #374151;&quot;&gt;Our engineering team ensures &lt;strong&gt;high efficiency, safety, and long-term reliability&lt;/strong&gt;, providing advanced solutions for modern industrial workshops and heavy-duty material handling operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', NULL, '[{\"param_content_name\":\"Parameter\",\"param_content_val\":\"&lt;table style=&quot;width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 20px;&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;thead&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb;&quot; class=&quot;firstRow&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:left;&quot; colspan=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Parameter&lt;\\/th&gt;\\n&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:center;&quot;&gt;Unit&lt;\\/th&gt;\\n&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:center;&quot;&gt;5t&lt;\\/th&gt;\\n&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:center;&quot;&gt;10t&lt;\\/th&gt;\\n&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:center;&quot;&gt;16\\/3.2t&lt;\\/th&gt;\\n&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:center;&quot;&gt;20\\/5t&lt;\\/th&gt;\\n&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:center;&quot;&gt;32\\/5t&lt;\\/th&gt;\\n&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:center;&quot;&gt;50\\/10t&lt;\\/th&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;&lt;\\/thead&gt;\\n&lt;tbody&gt;\\n&lt;tr&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:left;&quot; colspan=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Lifting Capacity&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:center;&quot;&gt;T&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:center;&quot;&gt;5&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:center;&quot;&gt;10&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:center;&quot;&gt;16\\/3.2&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:center;&quot;&gt;20\\/5&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:center;&quot;&gt;32