('129', '22', 'Foundry Casting Bridge Crane YZ Type', 'Foundry-Casting-Bridge-Crane-YZ-Type', NULL, 'portal/20260509/a96cd593047ba96297fbc91805261442.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/223caa66100b33f735d6141634ac494d.webp\",\"name\":\"Foundry Casting Bridge Crane YZ Type (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/31e788dd82ee850a8b05031a5cfd8c67.webp\",\"name\":\"Foundry Casting Bridge Crane YZ Type (3).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/223caa66100b33f735d6141634ac494d.webp\",\"name\":\"Foundry Casting Bridge Crane YZ Type.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/a96cd593047ba96297fbc91805261442.webp\",\"name\":\"Foundry Casting Bridge Crane.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '50-320ton', '24-32m', '21-28m', '3 phase 50Hz 380V', 'A7', 'Foundry casting bridge crane YZ type is a high-performance lifting equipment designed for the metallurgical and casting industries. ', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Foundry casting bridge crane YZ type is a high-performance lifting equipment designed for the metallurgical and casting industries. Its structure mainly includes the main beam, end beam, lifting trolley, trolley running mechanism and electrical control system.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Structure &amp; Components --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Structure and Components&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563; line-height: 1.9;&quot;&gt;Main beam and end beam constitute the main frame of the foundry casting crane. They usually adopt a box-shaped structure with high strength and rigidity, and can withstand heavy loads and impact loads. Tracks are laid on the main beam for the lifting trolley to run. The end beams are connected to both ends of the main beam to support the entire bridge crane and enable it to move along the factory track.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
            The lifting trolley is the core component, including the lifting mechanism, running mechanism and hoisting device. The lifting mechanism realizes the lifting and lowering of heavy objects, and the running mechanism enables the trolley to move along the main beam track. The hoisting device is designed according to specific needs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
            The trolley running mechanism is installed on the end beam and consists of a motor, a reducer and wheels to drive the crane to move longitudinally along the factory track. The electrical control system is responsible for coordinating the operation of various mechanisms, usually including the main control cabinet, operating table and safety protection devices.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
            Its overall structural design fully considers the harsh conditions of the metallurgical casting environment such as high temperature and dust. Foundry casting crane adopts heat-resistant and dust-proof materials, and is equipped with multiple safety protection measures to ensure the reliability and durability of the equipment under complex working conditions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Key Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High load-bearing capacity and structural strength:&lt;/strong&gt; The four-beam structure design is adopted, and the main beam and end beam are made of high-strength steel. The box-shaped structure provides excellent rigidity and stability, and can withstand heavy loads and impact loads. This design makes it particularly suitable for lifting heavy materials such as ladles of molten steel and ladles of molten iron, ensuring safe operation under high-load conditions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High temperature resistant and dustproof design:&lt;/strong&gt; In view of the high temperature and high dust characteristics of metallurgical and casting environments, the key components of the crane are made of heat-resistant materials and protective measures. For example, the wire rope and electrical equipment of the lifting mechanism have been specially treated to work stably for a long time in a high temperature environment. At the same time, the dustproof design effectively extends the service life of the equipment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Precise control and efficient operation:&lt;/strong&gt; With advanced electrical control systems and variable frequency speed regulation technology, precise control of lifting, operation and trolley movement is achieved. Whether it is lifting high-temperature molten metal or heavy castings, it can achieve smooth operation, reduce shaking and impact, and improve work efficiency and safety.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/58da1a3619a66cc5afd4a8828cb1ddb4.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Water Conservancy And Hydropower&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;The dam-top gantry crane is installed on the top of a hydropower station dam. It is mainly used for gate lifting and material handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/53f8e47cb680e45180638afe05fd7034.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Wind Power Industry&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Weihua cranes are widely used in offshore wind power projects, especially for wind turbine installation and large component handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/7c19456728d86c85236af98f565ce874.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Shipyard Cranes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Shipyard gantry cranes are designed for shipbuilding operations, including section lifting, turning, assembly, and launching.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/4a0f53f988ee6f3023455792bf0a34c6.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
