&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane provides fully customized Foundry Casting Bridge Crane YZ Type solutions designed for metallurgical plants, foundry workshops and high-temperature industrial operations, offering high lifting capacity, precise handling, and reliable performance for molten metal and casting workpiece management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Key parameters such as &lt;strong&gt;lifting capacity, span, lifting height, and rail gauge&lt;/strong&gt; can be flexibly adjusted to suit different workshop layouts and high-temperature heavy load handling requirements, ensuring efficient and safe operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
