('130', '28', 'Hoist Overhead Crane Double Beam LH Type', 'Hoist-Overhead-Crane-Double-Beam-LH-Type', NULL, 'portal/20260509/de52cca98cb803d501950ec82c0cb292.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/de52cca98cb803d501950ec82c0cb292.webp\",\"name\":\"Hoist Overhead Crane Double Beam (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/de52cca98cb803d501950ec82c0cb292.webp\",\"name\":\"Hoist Overhead Crane Double Beam LH Type (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/51fc5cc90df3b171ccbe4af1a6a80a7c.webp\",\"name\":\"Hoist Overhead Crane Double Beam LH Type.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/e9043dbbb7dc2e809aa08ad435c43eff.webp\",\"name\":\"Hoist Overhead Crane Double Beam.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '5~32t', '6~18m', '10.5~31.5m', '3 phase 50Hz 380V', 'A3 A4', 'Hoist overhead crane double beam LH type is widely applicable across manufacturing, logistics and construction sectors.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Double beam hoist overhead crane is a lifting equipment for efficient material handling. Its structural design could provide strong load-bearing capacity and flexible operation performance to meet the needs of various industrial environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Structure &amp; Components --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Structure and Components&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563; line-height: 1.9;&quot;&gt;The core of this hoist overhead crane is a bridge consisting of two main beams and end beams. A box-shaped structure bridge frame not only enhances the overall rigidity but also ensures stability during operation. Tracks are installed on the main beam for the lateral movement of the electric hoist. These tracks ensure the smooth operation of the electric hoist on the bridge, so that it can accurately move to required position for lifting and handling of goods.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
            As a lifting mechanism, the electric hoist is an important part of the LH type bridge crane. It can move freely along the track, so as to realize the handling of goods at different positions. The electric hoist itself has a lifting function, and completes the lifting and lowering of goods through drums and wire ropes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
            This double-beam hoist bridge crane has become an indispensable material handling tool in many industries. Whether it is a factory workshop or a logistics storage center, it plays an important role in improving production efficiency and reducing labor intensity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Applications --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
