xt-align:center;&quot; colspan=&quot;5&quot;&gt;3 Phase A.C.50HZ 380V&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tbody&gt;\\n&lt;\\/table&gt;\"}]', '10000', '0', '1778310696', '1778311719', NULL, '', '', ''),
('131', '28', 'Insulation Bridge Crane QY Type', 'Insulation-Bridge-Crane-QY-Type', NULL, 'portal/20260509/4807f30fb9269419afe2cbcd8cd63f8e.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/4807f30fb9269419afe2cbcd8cd63f8e.webp\",\"name\":\"Insulation Bridge Crane QY Type (3).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/562c163278f9768a8138279b3e7ae15a.webp\",\"name\":\"Insulation Bridge Crane QY Type (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/4734557133cf412d575ae6d217840d7f.webp\",\"name\":\"Insulation Bridge Crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/562c163278f9768a8138279b3e7ae15a.webp\",\"name\":\"Insulation Bridge Crane QY Type.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '5~50ton', '10-18m', '7.5~35m', '3 phase 50Hz 380V', 'A5~A8', 'QY type insulation bridge crane is mainly used in power plants, electrolytic aluminum plants, chemical and metallurgical industries for safe lifting and handling under high-voltage insulation working conditions.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;QY type insulation bridge crane is a kind of lifting equipment for specific industrial environment. It is mainly to deal with working environments that require electrical insulation. For example in the production process of electrolytic aluminum and calcium carbide, insulation bridge crane plays a key role. Its main purpose is to prevent the current from being conducted through the crane structure, thereby protecting the safety of equipment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Structure &amp; Components --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Structure and Components&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563; line-height: 1.9;&quot;&gt;It consists of strong bridge frame, crane traveling mechanism, hoisting mechanism, electrical equipment and insulation settings. For electrical insulation purposes, there are special insulating materials in the bridge section. Or insulating layers are provided between metal parts to ensure that electric current does not propagate through the bridge crane structure. The lifting mechanism also needs to be insulated to ensure safety when lifting electrically charged materials.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
            Weihua uses highly efficient insulating materials and technologies, such as ceramics, glass fiber reinforced plastics, etc. as insulating components. Or we add insulating gaskets between metal contact surfaces to ensure electrical insulation performance between parts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Applications --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Applications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Non-ferrous metal smelting:&lt;/strong&gt; Suitable for the smelting process of non-ferrous metals such as aluminum, magnesium, lead, and zinc.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Electronics industry:&lt;/strong&gt; Semiconductor manufacturing workshop, electronic components production workshop and other related working sites.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Power industry:&lt;/strong&gt; To safely move and install large transformers and other electrical equipment in places such as power plants and substations, where high voltage environments often exist.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Chemical industry:&lt;/strong&gt; Applicable to electrolysis workshops and chemical material storage area.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other industrial fields:&lt;/strong&gt; Any occasions where there are electrical safety hazards, such as certain mechanical processing, material handling on assembly lines, etc.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
