('134', '22', 'Metallurgy Overhead Crane QDY Type', 'Metallurgy-Overhead-Crane-QDY-Type', NULL, 'portal/20260509/c95781681b902d1686a15106e8d0bb6c.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/c95781681b902d1686a15106e8d0bb6c.webp\",\"name\":\"Metallurgy Overhead Crane QDY Type (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/6c16e71641d24a99e176dd3951fc3221.webp\",\"name\":\"Metallurgy Overhead Crane QDY Type (3).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/86d9f1d5ae05f4869480ac8f998be622.webp\",\"name\":\"Metallurgy Overhead Crane QDY Type.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/86d9f1d5ae05f4869480ac8f998be622.webp\",\"name\":\"Metallurgy Overhead Crane.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '5-74ton', '10.5-31.5m', '6-30m', '3 phase 50Hz 380V', 'A6', 'Metallurgy overhead crane is mainly in steelmaking workshops to lift and transport liquid steel ladlesnearrefining furnaces or continuous casting machines.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Metallurgy overhead crane specializes in heavy load practical applications in metallurgical industries. It is particularly for handling molten metal, hot steel, and other high-temperature materials.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Structure &amp; Components --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Structure and Components&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563; line-height: 1.9;&quot;&gt;Overall structure can be divided into double girders with double tracks, four girders with four tracks, four beams with six tracks and other types. The former two are generally for large tonnage cranes, and the third one is for foundry cranes large tonnage. Hoisting mechanism is electric trolley with multiple brakes for reliable lifting capability and safety. With heat radiation reflectors, metallurgy bridge crane have great heat resistance and performance in hot circumstances. In addition, we offer the following optional features: rotary spreader, fixable gantry hook, cargo weighing and display.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Intelligent Solutions --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Intelligent Solutions&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua has gradually expanded the solutions to various scenarios in the steel industry. We integrate the feeding and storage system with various processing lines via AI Crane system. This enables data interchange, and planning operations, production workshops and factories can better control work rhythms, significantly improving operational efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Applications --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Applications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;As the main equipment of steelmaking and continuous casting process, metallurgy overhead crane is mainly in steelmaking workshops to lift and transport liquid steel ladles near refining furnaces or continuous casting machines. It is also applicable to foundries for handling melted metal and other high-temperature materials.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Safety and stability:&lt;/strong&gt; Equipped with overload protection, anti-collision device, limit switch, etc., to ensure the safety of operation. At the same time, the bridge structure and sturdy manufacturing process keep it stable during operation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility and precise control:&lt;/strong&gt; With multi-axis control and variable frequency speed regulation functions, making the operation more flexible and precise, and adapting to different operating requirements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adapt to harsh environment:&lt;/strong&gt; Due to its ability to work in harsh environments with high temperature, high dust and harmful gases, QDY metallurgical crane has the characteristics of heat insulation, dust prevention and corrosion resistance, and is suitable for long-term stable operation under the harsh conditions of the metallurgical industry.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
