&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua cement handling crane is for each process of cement production, solving the problems of material inlets blocking, material buildup, bad recognition accuracy, etc. This overhead crane system is a fully automated unmanned intelligent crane which greatly improves production efficiency and helps the intelligent upgrade of the cement industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:12px 0 0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;The automatic cement grab crane provided can carry out automatic lifting and loading of special ingredients for cement production. Several automatic cement grab cranes can work together to do loading, unloading, leveling, and stocking operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Key Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
