&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;High-level language programming to achieve smarter scheduling.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Modular design, efficient development, and fast delivery.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Open interfaces, access to ERP, MES and other scheduling systems, and hardware equipment such as lasers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Safe and reliable, multi-level authority management, Information encryption verification, data security backup.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Cross-platform working.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
