&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Title --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 28px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Customized Steel Mill Overhead Crane Solutions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane provides fully customized Steel Mill Overhead Crane solutions designed for steel plants, steel production workshops and stockyard operations, offering high lifting capacity, stable operation and reliable performance for handling steel production equipment, raw materials and finished steel products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Key parameters such as &lt;strong&gt;lifting capacity, span, lifting height, and rail gauge&lt;/strong&gt; can be flexibly adjusted to suit different factory layouts and steel industry heavy-load handling requirements, ensuring efficient and safe daily production operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Configurations --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Optional Configurations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Electric or hybrid drive trolley options&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Automated control and remote operation system&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anti-sway and positioning system for precise steel material handling&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Energy-saving drive systems and regenerative braking&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Customized design to match specific steel plant rail layouts&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
