&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 450px; min-width: 300px; background: #f3f3f3; padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;default/20260424/467d4a2a355a54ca0f34d80317b858ba.png&quot; alt=&quot;Full Service&quot; style=&quot;width: 64px; height: 64px; object-fit: contain; margin-bottom: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 14px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Full Service&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;&quot;&gt;Weihua provides a one-stop service, encompassing consultation and planning, solution design, installation, and localized technical support worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 450px; min-width: 300px; background: #f3f3f3; padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;default/20260424/afcfb65440a841b405fc0f9ce44b8ae1.png&quot; alt=&quot;Excellent Product Quality&quot; style=&quot;width: 64px; height: 64px; object-fit: contain; margin-bottom: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 14px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Excellent Product Quality&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane employs automated production lines and precision machining equipment. Key components are sourced from well-known domestic and international brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 450px; min-width: 300px; background: #f3f3f3; padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;default/20260424/6f13f30218a6f6354b3e729b620a1090.png&quot; alt=&quot;High Safety&quot; style=&quot;width: 64px; height: 64px; object-fit: contain; margin-bottom: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 14px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;High Safety&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;&quot;&gt;Weihua Lifting strictly adheres to international standards such as GB and FEM. Key structures adopt high safety factors to ensure precise operation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Title --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 28px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Customized Workshop Overhead Crane Solutions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane provides fully customized Workshop Overhead Crane solutions designed for industrial factories, processing workshops and indoor stockyard operations, offering high lifting capacity, stable operation and reliable performance for handling workshop equipment, raw materials and finished industrial products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Key parameters such as &lt;strong&gt;lifting capacity, span, lifting height, and rail gauge&lt;/strong&gt; can be flexibly adjusted to suit different factory layouts and general industrial handling requirements, ensuring efficient and safe daily production operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Configurations --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Optional Configurations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Electric or hybrid drive trolley options&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Automated control and remote operation system&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anti-sway and positioning system for precise workshop material handling&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Energy-saving drive systems and regenerative braking&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Customized design to match specific workshop rail layouts&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Summary --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-left: 5px solid #22c55e; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #374151;&quot;&gt;Our engineering team ensures &lt;strong&gt;high efficiency, safety, and long-term reliability&lt;/strong&gt;, providing advanced solutions for modern factory production and industrial material handling operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '{\"input\":{\"lifting_capacity\":\"Capacity\",\"lifting_height\":\"Lifting Height\",\"span\":\"Span\",\"operating_voltage\":\"Voltage\\/Hertz\",\"job_level\":\"Working Class\"},\"content\":{\"overview\":\"Product Overview\",\"scenario\":\"Application Scenario\",\"certificate\":\"Certificate\",\"features\":\"Features\",\"customized\":\"Customized\"}}', '[{\"param_content_name\":\"Parameter\",\"param_content_val\":\"&lt;table style=&quot;width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 20px;&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;thead&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb;&quot; class=&quot;firstRow&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:center;&quot;&gt;Parameters&lt;\\/th&gt;\\n&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:center;&quot;&gt;Explanation and Common Ranges&lt;\\/th&gt;\\n&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:center;&quot;&gt;Key Selection Criteria&lt;\\/th&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;&lt;\\/thead&gt;\\n&lt;tbody&gt;\\n&lt;tr&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;Rated lifting capacity&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Refers to the maximum weight that the crane is safely allowed to lift, usually in tons (t).&lt;br&gt;\\r\\n                Light: 0.5t – 20t&lt;br&gt;\\r\\n                Medium: 5t – 50t&lt;br&gt;\\r\\n                Heavy: 75t – 800t&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;The crane must be heavier than the heaviest single item in your workshop. For grab bucket cranes, this weight includes the weight of the grab bucket itself.&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#f9fafb;&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;Span&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Refers to the horizontal distance between the center lines of the tracks on both sides of the workshop, determining the crane\'s working coverage area, in meters (m).&lt;br&gt;\\r\\n                Small span: e.g., 3m – 22.5m&lt;br&gt;\\r\\n                Medium span: e.g., 10.5m – 31.5m&lt;br&gt;\\r\\n                Large span: e.g., 31.5m and above&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;This is determined by the width of the workshop building. It must be determined before the factory design or before bidding for the workshop crane equipment.&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;Lifting height&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Refers to the distance from the hook to the ground or the platform where the track is located when it is raised to its highest position, in meters (m).&lt;br&gt;\\r\\n                Standard: e.g., 6m – 30m&lt;br&gt;\\r\\n                Special: e.g., 85m (for hydropower stations)&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;It is also determined by the highest lifting position and the workpiece stacking height, ensuring that it can reach the highest point while safely passing over obstacles below.&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#f9fafb;&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;Working class&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:left;&quot;&gt;A comprehensive indicator reflecting the crane\'s workload and load capacity, divided into A1 to A8 has eight levels.&lt;br&gt;\\r\\n                A3-A5 (Intermediate): Used in warehouses or general workshops.&lt;br&gt;\\r\\n                A6-A8 (Heavy\\/Extra Heavy): Used in metallurgy, casting, and other frequent, high-intensity operations&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:10px; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;This is one of the most important technical indicators for selecting a workshop crane, directly affecting the equipment\'s lifespan and safety. Choosing an inferior model will result in premature crane failure.&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tbody&gt;\\n&lt;\\/table&gt;\"}]', '9912', '0', '1778320033', '1778320439', NULL, '', '', ''),
('138', '28', '5 Ton 8 Ton 10 Ton Overhead Traveling Crane Price', '5-Ton-8-Ton-10-Ton-Overhead-Traveling-Crane-Price', NULL, 'portal/20260511/5c6e81a1b0d0875b3f490794619b50e1.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/2a9e9b907712707050919d70c73dbbdc.webp\",\"name\":\"5 Ton 8 Ton 10 Ton Overhead Traveling Crane Price (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/3667b1dafecc29b4bce2ab2cffa99510.webp\",\"name\":\"5 Ton 8 Ton 10 Ton Overhead Traveling Crane Price.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/9223c4f54a9d03e779582a451d6dcb9e.webp\",\"name\":\"Overhead Traveling Crane Price (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/5c6e81a1b0d0875b3f490794619b50e1.webp\",\"name\":\"Overhead Traveling Crane Price.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '5 ton 8 ton 10 ton', '6m ~ 24m', '10.5m ~ 31.5m', '3 phase 50Hz 380V', 'A3-A5 ', '5 ton 8 ton 10 ton Overhead Traveling Crane are widely used in workshops such as machinery manufacturing, metallurgical casting, logistics warehousing and equipment.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Overhead cranes, also known as &quot;EOT cranes&quot;, are lifting equipment that spans across workshops, warehouses, or material yards for material handling. 5-ton, 8-ton, and 10-ton overhead cranes are the most common models in industrial plants. Based on the main beam structure, they can be divided into two categories: single-girder overhead cranes and double-girder overhead cranes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Single-Girder Overhead Crane --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Single-Girder Overhead Crane&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;5 ton 8 ton 10 ton single-girder overhead cranes are the most commonly used cranes for light-duty lifting operations, with lifting capacities ranging from 1 to 20 tons. These cranes are widely used in factories, warehouses, workshops, storage yards, and other workplaces.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Double-Girder Overhead Crane --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Double-Girder Overhead Crane&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Double-girder overhead cranes are suitable for workshops with high-level operations, frequent use, and large spans. Designed according to international leading standards such as DIN, FEM, and ISO, WEIHUA 5-ton, 8-ton, and 10-ton double-girder overhead cranes conforming to European standards offer superior performance and numerous advantages. They are particularly suitable for material handling, precision positioning, and the assembly of large, precision components.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- How to Choose --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;How to Choose the Right Overhead Crane for Your Needs?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define the intended use of the overhead crane:&lt;/strong&gt; What will it lift? (For piecework, choose a hook-type overhead crane; for bulk materials, choose a grab-bucket type crane; for steel, choose an electromagnetic type.) Where will it be used? (General workshops, explosion-proof areas, high-temperature metallurgical areas.)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Assess the usage intensity of 5-ton, 8-ton, and 10-ton overhead traveling cranes:&lt;/strong&gt; Frequent use, heavy workload → Choose a general-purpose double-girder hook-type overhead crane (A4/A5 working class). Infrequent use, light workload → Consider an electric single-girder hook-type crane (A3 working class).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consider the conditions for installing the overhead crane in the factory:&lt;/strong&gt; With load-bearing brackets → Choose a supported type. Without brackets or with limited space → Consider a suspended type. Low headroom → Choose a low headroom crane (European-style double-girder overhead crane).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Determine the crane procurement budget:&lt;/strong&gt; Electric single-girder bridge cranes have the lowest cost, followed by general-purpose double-girder bridge cranes, while explosion-proof, metallurgical, and insulating special-purpose cranes have the highest cost.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;For the 5 ton, 8 ton, and 10-ton range, general-purpose hook double-girder bridge cranes are the mainstay for meeting the needs of most industries. For special materials (bulk materials, steel) or special environments (explosion-proof, high-temperature), then select the appropriate special-purpose type. It is recommended to inform Weihua Group – a professional crane manufacturer – of your specific needs; they will provide the most suitable crane technical solution.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
