('139', '28', '5 Ton Overhead Crane With Hook', '5-Ton-Overhead-Crane-With-Hook', NULL, 'portal/20260511/6fe535f67b726cfaa797df440b0bddd2.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/3569dfaa85eaf7ef1a5fe62107a8da61.webp\",\"name\":\"5 Ton Overhead Crane With Hook (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/6fe535f67b726cfaa797df440b0bddd2.webp\",\"name\":\"5 Ton Overhead Crane With Hook (3).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/92f89c44f191fe83c57b9467e6680292.webp\",\"name\":\"5 Ton Overhead Crane With Hook.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '5t', '6~12m', '7.5~22.5', '3 phase 50Hz 380V', 'A5 A6', '5 Ton Overhead Crane With Hook is mainly used in various indoor workshops. According to the utilization level and load status, it is divided into two working levels: A5 and A6.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Introduction --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Introduction&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua 5 Ton Overhead Crane With Hook is designed and manufactured according to advanced FEM/DIN standard. Weihua 5 Ton Bridge Crane With Hook has compact structure with small wheel pressure, which efficiently uses limited space in workshops to reduce structure investment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:12px 0 0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua 5 Ton Overhead Crane With Hook is mainly used in various indoor workshops. According to the utilization level and load status, it is divided into two working levels: A5 and A6.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:12px 0 0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The entrance direction of the driver\'s cab platform is divided into three types: side entrance, end entrance and top entrance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The driver\'s cab can be installed on the left or right end.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The trolley can be electrically conductive with a safety busbar or angle steel, either on the opposite side of the driver\'s cab or on the same side of the driver\'s cab.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;All the actions and operations of the crane are completed in the driver\'s cab.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Electric System --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Electric System&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Power supply through conductor rails.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Phase protection; automatically disconnect main power when phase stagger occurs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The crane and hoist are mutually independent and could travel at the same time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sliding conductor rails meets the requirement of power supplying and adapts shaking.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Etch-proof control handle with protection degree IP54.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Heavy-duty aviation plug.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Electrical components are equipped in position that convenient to maintain, and with good protection to avoid inadvertent contact.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Electric cable is suspended in cable trolley which slides flexibly and smoothly on a C-type steel.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Safety Protection --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Safety Protection&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Locked fall-proof reducer&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Outdoor hoist with rain-cover&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Alarm indicator lights&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Infrared anti-collision&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/58da1a3619a66cc5afd4a8828cb1ddb4.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Water Conservancy And Hydropower&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;The dam-top gantry crane is installed on the top of a hydropower station dam. It is mainly used for gate lifting and material handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/53f8e47cb680e45180638afe05fd7034.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Wind Power Industry&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Weihua cranes are widely used in offshore wind power projects, especially for wind turbine installation and large component handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
