&lt;!-- Title --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 28px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Customized 10 ton Overhead Crane for Sale Solutions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane provides fully customized 10 ton Overhead Crane for Sale solutions designed for factory workshops and industrial yard operations, offering stable lifting capacity, precise handling, and reliable performance for conventional industrial cargo and material management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Key parameters such as &lt;strong&gt;lifting capacity, span, lifting height, and rail gauge&lt;/strong&gt; can be flexibly adjusted to suit different workshop layouts and general industrial handling requirements, ensuring efficient and safe daily operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Configurations --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Optional Configurations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Electric or hybrid drive trolley options&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Automated control and remote operation system&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anti-sway and positioning system for precise industrial material handling&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Energy-saving drive systems and regenerative braking&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Customized design to match specific factory yard rail layouts&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Summary --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-left: 5px solid #22c55e; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #374151;&quot;&gt;Our engineering team ensures &lt;strong&gt;high efficiency, safety, and long-term reliability&lt;/strong&gt;, providing advanced solutions for modern industrial workshops and general material handling operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '{\"input\":{\"lifting_capacity\":\"Capacity\",\"lifting_height\":\"Lifting Height\",\"span\":\"Span\",\"operating_voltage\":\"Voltage\\/Hertz\",\"job_level\":\"Working Class\"},\"content\":{\"overview\":\"Product Overview\",\"scenario\":\"Application Scenario\",\"certificate\":\"Certificate\",\"features\":\"Features\",\"customized\":\"Customized\"}}', '[{\"param_content_name\":\"Parameter\",\"param_content_val\":\"\\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;default\\/20260511\\/2721d44feab9fc173f6aec411fbb758e.webp&quot; title=&quot;结构图.webp&quot; alt=&quot;结构图.webp&quot;&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.6;&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 24px; color: #111;&quot;&gt;10-ton single-girder bridge crane vs. 10-ton double-girder bridge crane&lt;\\/h2&gt;\\n&lt;div style=&quot;overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;table style=&quot;width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;thead&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb;&quot; class=&quot;firstRow&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;th style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; text-align: left; font-weight: bold; color: #111;&quot;&gt;Features&lt;\\/th&gt;\\n&lt;th style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; text-align: left; font-weight: bold; color: #111;&quot;&gt;10-ton Single-Girder Bridge Crane (LD Type)&lt;\\/th&gt;\\n&lt;th style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; text-align: left; font-weight: bold; color: #111;&quot;&gt;10-ton Double-Girder Bridge Crane (QD Type)&lt;\\/th&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;&lt;\\/thead&gt;\\n&lt;tbody&gt;\\n&lt;tr&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;Structural characteristics&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;A single main girder (usually an I-beam or box girder), with the trolley running on the lower flange of the girder. Simple and lightweight structure.&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;Two parallel main beams (standard box-type structure), with the lifting trolley running on a dedicated track between the two beams. The structure is robust and stable.&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;Stability and rigidity&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;Relatively weak. The main girder deflects (bending) significantly after lifting, resulting in slightly poorer running stability.&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;Extremely strong. The two main beams share the load, resulting in high rigidity, minimal deflection, and extremely smooth operation.&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;Working class&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;Generally suitable for A3–A5 (light to medium) work cycles. Not suitable for frequent, heavy-load continuous operations.&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;Wide range, from A5 to A7 and even higher (medium to extra-heavyweight). Fully meets the needs of frequent 10-ton lifting operations in workshops.&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;Span adaptability&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;Suitable for small to medium spans. For large spans, the main girder needs to be very high to meet rigidity requirements, reducing economic efficiency.&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;Particularly suitable for large spans (e.g., over 19.5 meters). The double-beam structure easily ensures strength and rigidity under large spans.&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;Lifting height&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;Because the trolley is below the girder, the effective lifting space is larger (can lift higher for the same factory building height).&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;Because the trolley occupies more height between the two beams, the effective lifting height is slightly lower than that of a single-beam crane under the same conditions.&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;Cost&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;Lower initial purchase cost, lightweight, less stress on the factory building structure, and relatively simple installation.&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;Higher procurement cost and greater weight, requiring higher standards for the factory’s load-bearing structure and track.&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;Maintenance and lifespan&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;Simple structure, relatively few maintenance points, but under frequent heavy-load conditions, the main girder and rails may wear out faster.&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;Robust structure with high design redundancy; under standard operating conditions, the overall lifespan is typically longer and more durable.&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tbody&gt;\\n&lt;\\/table&gt;&lt;\\/div&gt;\\n&lt;\\/div&gt;\\n\"}]', '10000', '0', '1778464454', '1778464843', NULL, '', '', ''),
('142', '28', '15 Ton Overhead Crane With Hook', '15-Ton-Overhead-Crane-With-Hook', NULL, 'portal/20260511/5467355a2eaf91d7540aaaa56b997bea.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/2e5233a8f9fbb80f9849e877b8500707.webp\",\"name\":\"15 Ton Overhead Crane With Hook (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/c9fcdc99f85a37457f75ae47e3d9fbc1.webp\",\"name\":\"15 Ton Overhead Crane With Hook (3).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/f38e4fa74deaa06934db7c6917a314c2.webp\",\"name\":\"15 Ton Overhead Crane With Hook (4).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/5467355a2eaf91d7540aaaa56b997bea.webp\",\"name\":\"15 Ton Overhead Crane With Hook.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '15t', '12-18m', '10.5-31.5m', '3 phase 50Hz 380V', 'A5', '15 Ton Overhead Crane With Hook is mainly used in various indoor workshops. According to the utilization level and load status, it is divided into two working levels: A5 and A6.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua 15 Ton Overhead Crane With Hook is designed and manufactured according to advanced FEM/DIN standard. It features compact structure with small wheel pressure, which efficiently uses limited space in workshops to reduce structure investment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Introduction --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Introduction&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mainly used in various indoor workshops, divided into A5 and A6 working levels based on utilization level and load status.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Three entrance directions for the driver’s cab platform: side entrance, end entrance and top entrance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The driver’s cab can be installed flexibly on the left end or right end.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Trolley can adopt safety busbar or angle steel for electric conduction, installed on the same side or opposite side of the cab.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;All crane actions and operations are safely and conveniently completed in the driver’s cab.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Electric System --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Electric System&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Power supply through reliable conductor rails.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Phase protection function; automatically disconnect main power when phase stagger occurs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Crane traveling and hoisting mechanisms are mutually independent and can operate at the same time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sliding conductor rails ensure stable power supply and strong adaptability to shaking.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Etch-proof control handle with protection class IP54.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Heavy-duty aviation plug for stable and safe connection.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Electrical components are arranged for easy maintenance and effective protection against inadvertent contact.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Electric cable is suspended in flexible cable trolley sliding smoothly on C-type steel.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Safety Protection --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Safety Protection&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Locked fall-proof reducer for safe and stable operation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Outdoor type hoist equipped with professional rain cover.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Alarm indicator lights for clear working status warning.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Infrared anti-collision system for intelligent safety protection.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
