&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane provides fully customized 15 Ton Overhead Crane With Hook solutions designed for factory workshops and industrial yard operations, offering stable lifting capacity, precise handling, and reliable performance for conventional industrial cargo and material management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Key parameters such as &lt;strong&gt;lifting capacity, span, lifting height, and rail gauge&lt;/strong&gt; can be flexibly adjusted to suit different workshop layouts and general industrial handling requirements, ensuring efficient and safe daily operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
