('143', '28', '32 ton Overhead Crane (EOT Crane) Manufacturer', '32-ton-Overhead-Crane-(EOT-Crane)-Manufacturer', NULL, 'portal/20260509/ebbaaacf43b6e836afdd2f038a2a483d.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/539a932d8b9814259043846299bf0b72.webp\",\"name\":\"32 ton Overhead Crane (EOT Crane) Manufacturer (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/ebbaaacf43b6e836afdd2f038a2a483d.webp\",\"name\":\"32 ton Overhead Crane (EOT Crane) Manufacturer (3).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/88b6b908151494d979d895398ee796fb.webp\",\"name\":\"32 ton Overhead Crane (EOT Crane) Manufacturer (4).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/1792b326993e60eb8dce59795dc63c22.webp\",\"name\":\"32 ton Overhead Crane (EOT Crane) Manufacturer.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', ' 32 tons', '4-16m', '10.5~31.5m', '3 phase 50Hz 380V', 'A5 A6', '32 ton Overhead Crane (EOT Crane) for heavy industrial manufacturing, energy, metallurgy, logistics, and large-scale infrastructure projects.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;A 32-ton Overhead Crane (EOT Crane) is a type of lifting equipment that spans across workshops, warehouses, or material yards for material handling. With a rated lifting capacity of 32 tons, it is a very common medium-to-large tonnage bridge crane in industrial production and is widely used in heavy industrial workshops.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Company &amp; Application --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Company &amp;amp; Applications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot;&gt;Weihua Group is a leading enterprise in China\'s crane industry. Its 32-ton overhead cranes are widely used in heavy industrial manufacturing, energy, metallurgy, logistics, and large-scale infrastructure projects, enabling efficient and precise lifting and positioning of large workpieces, equipment, or raw materials.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot;&gt;Weihua Group can provide the following 32-ton overhead cranes: 32 ton QD-type Double Girder Overhead Crane with Winch Trolley, 32 ton FEM Double Girder Overhead Crane, 32-ton Ladle Handling Cranes for Foundry, 32-ton Electromagnetic Overhead Cranes with Lifting Magnet, 32-ton Insulated Overhead Cranes, 32-ton Explosion Proof Double Girder Overhead Crane, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Customization &amp; Drawings --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;32-ton Overhead Crane Customization &amp;amp; Drawings&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Group is a leading manufacturer of 32-ton bridge cranes in China, exporting to over 170 countries. We provide professional crane manufacturing and services tailored to customer needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Customized parameters: crane span, lifting height, duty cycle (A3-A8), speed, and operating method.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Environmental conditions: indoor/outdoor, temperature, humidity, and corrosive environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Process layout: factory structure, track beam load capacity, and building clearance dimensions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Optimized box girder design with fully off-center structure, scientific stress, high rigidity and anti-deformation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;High-strength Q355B (Q345) or higher steel used for main structural parts with reinforced key areas.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Full frequency conversion speed control for hoisting, trolley and crane travel, realizing millimeter-level precise positioning.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Advanced drive system with top-brand motors, reducers and brakes for high efficiency and smooth operation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Multiple limit protections: travel limit, height limit, overload limit and mechanical safety devices.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Digital overload limiter displays real-time load, automatically cuts off power and alarms in case of overload.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Complete emergency safety system: dual brakes, buffers, rail sweepers, emergency stop, audible and visual alarms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Long service life design with maintenance-free bearings, high-quality ropes and pulleys to reduce maintenance cost.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
