('144', '28', '50t Overhead Traveling Crane', '50t-Overhead-Traveling-Crane', NULL, 'portal/20260511/3a8210488375f28ca4e871f562f10d38.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/3a8210488375f28ca4e871f562f10d38.webp\",\"name\":\"50t Overhead Traveling Crane (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/ebbaaacf43b6e836afdd2f038a2a483d.webp\",\"name\":\"50t Overhead Traveling Crane (3).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/1792b326993e60eb8dce59795dc63c22.webp\",\"name\":\"50t Overhead Traveling Crane (4).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/1a98c2f9dcec8fac22e157fbbd69d271.webp\",\"name\":\"50t Overhead Traveling Crane.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '50 ton', '12~20m', '10.5~31.5m', '3 phase 50Hz 380V', 'A5 A6', '50-ton overhead cranes are widely used in heavy industrial manufacturing, energy, metallurgy, logistics, and large-scale infrastructure projects, enabling efficient and precise lifting and positioning of large workpieces, equipment, or raw materials.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;50-ton overhead crane is an efficient and reliable material handling solution for a wide range of industrial applications. From steel coil handling to manufacturing and assembly support, it offers stable performance, flexible configurations, and precise control—making it an ideal choice for improving productivity and operational safety.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Company &amp; Applications --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Company &amp;amp; Applications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot;&gt;Weihua Group is a leading enterprise in China\'s crane industry. Its 50-ton overhead cranes are widely used in heavy industrial manufacturing, energy, metallurgy, logistics, and large-scale infrastructure projects, enabling efficient and precise lifting and positioning of large workpieces, equipment, or raw materials.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot;&gt;Weihua Group can provide the following 50-ton overhead cranes: 50-ton QD-type Double Girder Overhead Crane with Winch Trolley, 50-ton FEM Double Girder Overhead Crane, 50-ton Ladle Handling Cranes for Foundry, 50-ton Electromagnetic Overhead Cranes with Lifting Magnet, 50-ton Insulated Overhead Cranes, 50-ton Explosion Proof Double Girder Overhead Crane, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Optimized box girder design with fully off-center structure, ensuring scientific stress distribution, high rigidity and long-term deformation resistance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;High-strength Q355B (formerly Q345) or higher grade steel used for main structural parts, with reinforced key areas.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Full frequency conversion speed control system for hoisting, trolley and crane travelling, realizing stepless speed regulation and millimeter-level precise positioning.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Advanced drive system with world-famous or top domestic brand motors, reducers and brakes, featuring high transmission efficiency and smooth start-stop.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Multiple electrical and mechanical limit protections including travel limit, height limit and overload limit for all mechanisms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Digital overload limiter as core safety device, displaying real-time load and automatically cutting off power with alarm in case of overload.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Complete emergency safety measures: dual braking system, end buffers, track sweeping plates, emergency stop switch, audible and visual alarms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Long service life design with maintenance-free bearings, high-quality wire ropes and pulley blocks, greatly reducing daily maintenance cost.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/58da1a3619a66cc5afd4a8828cb1ddb4.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Water Conservancy And Hydropower&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;The dam-top gantry crane is installed on the top of a hydropower station dam. It is mainly used for gate lifting and material handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/53f8e47cb680e45180638afe05fd7034.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Wind Power Industry&lt;/h3&gt;
