&lt;!-- Title --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 28px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Customized 50t Overhead Traveling Crane Solutions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane provides fully customized 50t Overhead Traveling Crane solutions designed for large factory workshops and industrial yard operations, offering stable heavy lifting capacity, precise handling, and reliable performance for conventional industrial cargo and heavy material management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Key parameters such as &lt;strong&gt;lifting capacity, span, lifting height, and rail gauge&lt;/strong&gt; can be flexibly adjusted to suit different workshop layouts and heavy-duty industrial handling requirements, ensuring efficient and safe daily operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Configurations --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Optional Configurations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Electric or hybrid drive trolley options&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Automated control and remote operation system&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anti-sway and positioning system for precise industrial material handling&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Energy-saving drive systems and regenerative braking&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Customized design to match specific factory yard rail layouts&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Summary --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-left: 5px solid #22c55e; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #374151;&quot;&gt;Our engineering team ensures &lt;strong&gt;high efficiency, safety, and long-term reliability&lt;/strong&gt;, providing advanced heavy-duty overhead traveling crane solutions for modern industrial workshops and general material handling operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '{\"input\":{\"lifting_capacity\":\"Capacity\",\"lifting_height\":\"Lifting Height\",\"span\":\"Span\",\"operating_voltage\":\"Voltage\\/Hertz\",\"job_level\":\"Working Class\"},\"content\":{\"overview\":\"Product Overview\",\"scenario\":\"Application Scenario\",\"certificate\":\"Certificate\",\"features\":\"Features\",\"customized\":\"Customized\"}}', '[{\"param_content_name\":\"Parameter\",\"param_content_val\":\"&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.6;&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 22px; color: #111;&quot;&gt;50-ton Overhead Crane Key Parameters&lt;\\/h3&gt;\\n&lt;div style=&quot;overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;table style=&quot;width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;thead&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb;&quot; class=&quot;firstRow&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;th style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; text-align: left; font-weight: bold; color: #111;&quot;&gt;Parameter Name&lt;\\/th&gt;\\n&lt;th style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; text-align: left; font-weight: bold; color: #111;&quot;&gt;Typical values\\/range:&lt;\\/th&gt;\\n&lt;th style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; text-align: left; font-weight: bold; color: #111;&quot;&gt;Explanation:&lt;\\/th&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;&lt;\\/thead&gt;\\n&lt;tbody&gt;\\n&lt;tr&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;Rated Lifting Capacity&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;50 tons (main hook)&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;Main lifting capacity. Usually equipped with an auxiliary hook (e.g., 5 tons, 10 tons).&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;Span&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;10.5 meters ~ 31.5 meters&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;Distance between the centers of the wheels at both ends of the crane\'s main beam. Needs to be determined based on the factory span. Most commonly 22.5 meters.&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;Lifting Height&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;Main hook: 12 meters \\/ 16 meters \\/ 18 meters, etc.&lt;br&gt;Side hook: 14 meters \\/ 18 meters \\/ 20 meters, etc.&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;Vertical distance between the highest and lowest working positions of the lifting device. Customized based on factory clearance and requirements.&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;Working Class&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;A5 (medium) or A6 (heavy)&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;Reflects usage frequency and load condition. A5 is suitable for general workshops, A6 for metallurgical and frequently operated workshops.&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tbody&gt;\\n&lt;\\/table&gt;&lt;\\/div&gt;\\n&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top: 20px; padding: 16px; background: #f9fafb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.7;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;\\/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;50-ton overhead crane is a technologically mature and reliable heavy industrial equipment. Choosing an excellent 50-ton crane is not only related to production efficiency but also forms the cornerstone of production safety. We recommend that you provide detailed information such as &quot;factory span, lifting height, frequency of use, type of materials to be lifted, and operating environment&quot; so that we can provide you with the most accurate technical solutions and 50t overhead traveling crane quotations.&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;\\/div&gt;\\n&lt;\\/div&gt;\"}]', '10000', '0', '1778466944', '1778467600', NULL, '', '', ''),
('145', '28', '100 ton Overhead Crane', '100-ton-Overhead-Crane', NULL, 'portal/20260511/cdefd81d71a1b2445ce4920f3c05d472.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/cdefd81d71a1b2445ce4920f3c05d472.webp\",\"name\":\"100 ton Overhead Crane (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/223caa66100b33f735d6141634ac494d.webp\",\"name\":\"100 ton Overhead Crane (3).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/61e6e4af70e539de5808fab3685fc1c1.webp\",\"name\":\"100 ton Overhead Crane (4).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260509\\/21d4ae0109b0652a028e705122cebe5c.webp\",\"name\":\"100 ton Overhead Crane.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '100t', '12-20m', '10.5~31.5m', '3 phase 50Hz 380V', 'A5 A6', '100-ton overhead cranes are core equipment in modern industrial heavy logistics systems,they are used in a variety of heavy industrial fields.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;100-ton overhead cranes are core equipment in modern industrial heavy logistics systems. With their excellent lifting capacity, stable operating performance and wide adaptability, they are used in a variety of heavy industrial fields, such as ladle cranes in the iron and steel metallurgy industry, steel coil handling cranes in rolling mills, equipment assembly cranes in the machinery manufacturing industry, and heavy container handling cranes used in large logistics warehouses/port indoor storage yards.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Design &amp; Structure --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Design &amp;amp; Structure&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot;&gt;100-ton overhead cranes employ a three-in-one drive unit (integrated motor, brake, and reducer) or independent drive, with a symmetrical layout and good synchronization. All wheels are drive wheels, ensuring no slippage during starting and braking under heavy loads. A 20-ton or 32-ton auxiliary hook is standard, meeting the needs for rapid lifting of materials of varying weights, achieving multi-purpose functionality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Company &amp; Manufacturing --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Company &amp;amp; Manufacturing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Group is one of the leading enterprises in China\'s crane industry. 100-ton overhead crane manufactured by Weihua Group integrate years of technological accumulation, rigorous manufacturing processes, and intelligent innovation concepts, making them a reliable choice for heavy-duty and busy operating conditions. Weihua Group can tailor its solutions to meet customers\' specific operating environments, ensuring strength and safety while employing advanced calculations and designs to achieve lightweighting of the main beams and other structural components of the bridge crane. This effectively reduces the load on the plant structure and decreases operating energy consumption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Core Advantages --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Core Advantages of Weihua 100-ton Bridge Crane&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;margin:16px 0 10px; font-size:18px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;I. Technological Leadership and Design Innovation Advantages&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Lightweight Technology:&lt;/strong&gt; Through advanced computer simulation and structural optimization, the core structure, including the main beam, is scientifically &quot;slimmed down&quot; while ensuring absolute safety in strength, stiffness (static deflection exceeding national standards) and stability. Benefits include reduced factory building load requirements and lower overall energy consumption.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital and Intelligent Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Equipped with &quot;Weihua Intelligent Control&quot; System for remote monitoring, fault warning, self-diagnosis and data analysis. Optional functions: precise anti-sway control (AFC), electronic collision avoidance, automatic positioning and path planning.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;margin:16px 0 10px; font-size:18px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;II. Superior Product Reliability and Safety&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&quot;Military-Grade&quot; Quality Control System:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-process strict standards exceeding national standards, robotic automated welding, 100% non-destructive testing on critical welds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Globally Selected Key Components:&lt;/strong&gt; Core parts use international top brands (Siemens, ABB, Flender, SEW, Schneider) ensuring long lifespan and high reliability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;margin:16px 0 10px; font-size:18px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;III. Strong Customization and Scenario-Based Solution Capabilities&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deeply Adaptable to Special Working Conditions:&lt;/strong&gt; Metallurgical casting cranes, explosion-proof cranes, low-headroom bridge cranes for various harsh environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible configuration options:&lt;/strong&gt; Customizable speeds, working classes (A5-A6), control methods (cab, remote, ground), and special lifting tools (C-hooks, plate clamps, electromagnetic chucks).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;margin:16px 0 10px; font-size:18px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;IV. Ultimate full life cycle service advantages&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional pre-sales support:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineering team provides optimal solutions to avoid improper selection.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Efficient sales execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Professional installation team, assists with special equipment inspection and certification.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rapid After-Sales Response:&lt;/strong&gt; IoT-based predictive maintenance, comprehensive spare parts supply system.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
