('146', '22', '320t Overhead Crane for Foundry', '320t-Overhead-Crane-for-Foundry', NULL, 'portal/20260514/2bb651157b281837aa5d421f9c018166.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/d60a0a2e495f8bc80e60ed9f748b19f8.webp\",\"name\":\"320t-overhead-crane1.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/e3d1a0cf164b35fc09566633df4b98fa.webp\",\"name\":\"320t-overhead-crane2.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/e5ddb49efd61feb5641a224dcc5ad5a8.webp\",\"name\":\"320t-overhead-crane3.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/762edf4cf166cc8da3e3044ba8f648fc.webp\",\"name\":\"320t-overhead-crane4.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '320t', '', '', '', '', '320t overhead crane for foundry is specially applied in foundry plants, steel mills and metallurgical workshops for high-temperature molten metal and heavy casting lifting operations.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;This 320t overhead crane for foundry is the biggest metallurgical foundry crane ever made in Henan Province, China. During manufacture and installation, we have obtained valuable experiences to lay the foundation for manufacturing crane with more technology and complex structure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Main Structure &amp; Design --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Main Structure &amp;amp; Design&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot;&gt;The main structure of this 320t foundry crane is designed with 4 girders and 6 rails. The highlights of this crane are integral processing technology and secondary assembly technology. For the first time assembly, the welding components sizes are fixed and adopt flat position welding to ensure the quality of welding seams; and the secondary assembly is to release welding stress before the integral processing of the bridge to ensure the stability and accuracy of product process precision. The two-times assembly technologies could maximally ensure the precision of gauge, diagonal and span, as well as users\' site installation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Key Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Features of Weihua Foundry Ladle Crane&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;It adopts Siemens PLC and Siemens inverter for control and drive. At the same time, Profinet is used for communication between PLC and inverter. It is equipped with communication detection function, which can detect the working status of each station in real time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;A monitoring system is installed to monitor the working status of the crane in real time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The hoisting mechanism of the ladle crane adopts redundant system design to ensure the safety and reliability of lifting liquid metal.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;It is with wireless transmission and electronic scales, real-time transmission of the weight of liquid metal.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each crane is designed with an electric room, and an electric fan or AC unit is installed in the electric room to ensure the safe and reliable operation of the electrical equipment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The 250t ladle crane hoisting mechanism adopts the planetary reducer structure. If one motor fails, it can still complete the lifting work in a short time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mother-child trolley to realize the unmanned automatic hanging ladle and save the cost.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The overall design is with lightweight and compact structure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Low height, light self-weight, small hook limit, large working range.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;High quality parts, durable, safe and reliable.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Less maintenance and repair costs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Small total crane power and low energy consumption.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Frequency control, smooth lifting and less impact.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/58da1a3619a66cc5afd4a8828cb1ddb4.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Water Conservancy And Hydropower&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;The dam-top gantry crane is installed on the top of a hydropower station dam. It is mainly used for gate lifting and material handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/53f8e47cb680e45180638afe05fd7034.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Wind Power Industry&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Weihua cranes are widely used in offshore wind power projects, especially for wind turbine installation and large component handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/7c19456728d86c85236af98f565ce874.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Shipyard Cranes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Shipyard gantry cranes are designed for shipbuilding operations, including section lifting, turning, assembly, and launching.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/4a0f53f988ee6f3023455792bf0a34c6.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Steel Mill Cranes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Weihua metallurgical cranes are used in steel mills covering lifting needs from smelting to finished product handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 20px 10px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 450px; min-width: 300px; background: #f3f3f3; padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;default/20260424/cd61e7f2b73f4a62799b48c3bc88092f.png&quot; alt=&quot;Brand Reputation&quot; style=&quot;width: 64px; height: 64px; object-fit: contain; margin-bottom: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 14px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Brand Reputation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;&quot;&gt;Weihua Cranes ranks among the top sellers in China\'s crane industry, boasting high brand awareness and market share. Its products are widely used in numerous national key projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 450px; min-width: 300px; background: #f3f3f3; padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;
