&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane provides fully customized 320t Overhead Crane for Foundry solutions designed for foundry plants, steel mills and heavy metallurgical workshop operations, offering superior heavy lifting capacity, stable operation and reliable performance for high-temperature molten metal and heavy casting material management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Key parameters such as &lt;strong&gt;lifting capacity, span, lifting height, and rail gauge&lt;/strong&gt; can be flexibly adjusted to suit different workshop layouts and severe heavy-load handling requirements, ensuring efficient and safe daily industrial operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
