('149', '28', 'Cross-Track Overhead Crane', 'Cross-Track-Overhead-Crane', NULL, 'portal/20260511/0d32b521c57b297dc3f1dffca998cbae.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/8ea833428f301c27da54630a68afe4bd.webp\",\"name\":\"Cross-Track Overhead Crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/0d32b521c57b297dc3f1dffca998cbae.webp\",\"name\":\"cross-track-overhead-crane.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[{\"parameter_name\":\"Lifting speed\",\"parameter_val\":\"16m\\/min\"},{\"parameter_name\":\"Running speed\",\"parameter_val\":\"30m\\/min\"}]', '2t, 5t, 10t', '', '', '', 'M6', 'Cross-track overhead cranes are widely used in machinery workshops, steel mills, metallurgical plants and logistics yards for flexible cross-area lifting and transporting of heavy workpieces and materials.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;The main features of a cross-track overhead crane is that the electric hoists can run to different cranes and bays freely by going across the crane track on supporting beam. The 2 or more overhead cranes all made with outstretched hoist track beam under the girder. Thus the overhead cranes are able to keep at the same level without gap to provide a straight horizontal line for hoist traveling smoothly between different overhead cranes of different bays.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Application &amp; Technical Parameters --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Application &amp;amp; Main Technical Parameters&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot;&gt;These images show cross-track overhead cranes working at a Galvanizing plant. They are single girder overhead cranes with special hot-dip galvanizing electric hoists as lifting mechanism. Main technical parameters as below:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Application: Hot dip galvanizing industry&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lift capacity: 2t, 5t, 10t&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Working duty: M6&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lifting speed: 16m/min&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Running speed: 30m/min&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Protection level: IP55&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Product Range &amp; Customization --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Product Range &amp;amp; Customization Service&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563; line-height:1.9;&quot;&gt;We also provide cross-track suspension cranes, multi-pivot suspension crane, free-standing suspension cranes, light duty flexible suspension cranes, etc. for special industries. Besides, all our electric hoist, overhead crane, gantry crane can be customized according to your requirement and industry need. Weihua provides professional lifting solutions for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
