&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anti-sway System:&lt;/strong&gt; Automatic storage, The handling process is smooth and efficient&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Cloud Platform Jointly Developed with Shougang:&lt;/strong&gt; Visual warehouse management scheduling system, Warehousing data management system, Intelligent production line scheduling system, Equipment condition monitoring system, Can be connected to all intelligent warehouse management systems&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
