&lt;!-- Title --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 28px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Customized Stone Handling Overhead Crane Solutions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane provides fully customized Stone Handling Overhead Crane solutions designed for stone processing plants and quarry yard operations, offering high lifting capacity, precise handling, and reliable performance for stone slab and raw stone management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Key parameters such as &lt;strong&gt;lifting capacity, span, lifting height, and rail gauge&lt;/strong&gt; can be flexibly adjusted to suit different site layouts and stone handling requirements, ensuring efficient and safe operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
