('156', '28', 'Double Girder Overhead Crane for Paper Making', 'Double-Girder-Overhead-Crane-for-Paper-Making', NULL, 'portal/20260511/d7e1e8a9952333ae9c764273be617a80.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/d7e1e8a9952333ae9c764273be617a80.webp\",\"name\":\"overhead-crane-paper-making_(1).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/11282be89e8c237dfebfdd7503918351.webp\",\"name\":\"overhead-crane-paper-making_(2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/9865dda62291b7a448ddbcedc203e8a9.webp\",\"name\":\"overhead-crane-paper-making_(3).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/e9af42612a45a37aaae89610f5d91088.webp\",\"name\":\"overhead-crane-paper-making_(4).webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '5-500t', '3-60m', '6-40m', '', 'A3-A8', 'Double Girder Overhead Crane for Paper Making is widely used in paper mills and pulp workshops for lifting paper rolls, production equipment and raw materials in paper making production lines.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Crane for paper making has become an important part in paper making industry. Based on our rich experience on paper making industry, we are able to provide turn-key lifting and transport solution for your paper making plant. Weihua provides material handling crane system for pulp and paper making industry, such as overhead cranes for process, cranes for maintenance, paper scroll storage system and cranes for workshops.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Overhead Crane System for Paper Making Plant --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Overhead Crane System for Paper Making Plant&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot;&gt;Overhead crane for paper making has become an important part in paper making industry. Based on our rich experience on paper making industry, we are able to provide turn-key lifting and transport solution for your paper making plant. The service area of paper making overhead crane includes: duly depositing and transporting woods, pulp product line, paper and cardboard making, scrap basket and tissue making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:12px 0 0; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot;&gt;Lifting trolley of this double girder overhead crane for paper making works as the most important part of the crane with 1, 2 or 3 hooks. It is constituted by motor, reducer, brake, trolley frame, winding drum, hooks, pulley, rain cover and other components. The electrical part includes electric cabinet, control handle and power supply system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Features of Double Girder Overhead Crane for Paper Making&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;High work duty and efficiency;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Paper making crane adapts to various places: high temperature and explosion-proof etc.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Long service life: 30 to 50 years;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Simple installation and maintenance;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Application --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Application&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563; line-height:1.9;&quot;&gt;Weihua cranes are widely used in machinery, metallurgy, power generation, railways, ports, petroleum, chemical, and other industries, serving key national projects and large enterprises.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
