('157', '28', 'Double Girder Overhead Crane with Grab', 'Double-Girder-Overhead-Crane-with-Grab', NULL, 'portal/20260511/72b1fa572034c4164481d7bfe5218214.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/3f32f15f9d94d13ce2b10a5958499cef.webp\",\"name\":\"double-girder-overhead-crane-grab_(1).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/ca82acdf9c31577989840ed2294b9317.webp\",\"name\":\"double-girder-overhead-crane-grab_(2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/275cbbf2a23a6c8d9a082eb9680b4d50.webp\",\"name\":\"double-girder-overhead-crane-grab_(3).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/72b1fa572034c4164481d7bfe5218214.webp\",\"name\":\"double-girder-overhead-crane-grab_(4).webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '16t', '28m', '16.5-31.5m', '', 'A6', 'Double Girder Overhead Crane with Grab is widely used in power plants, garbage disposal plants, chemical plants and bulk material yards for grabbing, lifting and conveying bulk granular and loose materials.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Double girder overhead crane with grab consists of girders, crane traveling mechanism, trolley, electric system and grab. Double girder overhead crane with grab is widely used in power stations, warehouses, workshops and ports to grab or lift bulk materials. The lifting capacity includes the weight of grab and the grab opening direction is parallel or vertical to the main girders.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Mechanisms --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Mechanisms of Double Girder Overhead Crane With Grab&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Double girders, box-type shaped by wielding, and the camber degree meets China standard;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adopt high quality carbon steel Q235B and Q345B;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Efficient brake, long service life;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Electric System --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Electric System&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Safety slide contact line or angle slide conductor rails;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Trolley power supply through flat cable;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Traveling smoothly and beautiful exterior;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Protection Devices --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Protection Devices&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Rain covers for lifting mechanism, motor box and drive system outdoors;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anti-collision device, sound and light alarm device;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Control System --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Control System&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Handle control;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Cab control can be customized according users\' needs with intermediate working level;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The cab can be open or close style installed left or right;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Entrance of cab: side entrance, end entrance and top entrance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Application --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Application&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563; line-height:1.9;&quot;&gt;Weihua cranes are widely used in machinery, metallurgy, power generation, railways, ports, petroleum, chemical, and other industries, serving key national projects and large enterprises.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
