('159', '28', 'FEM/DIN Single Girder Overhead Crane', 'FEM/DIN-Single-Girder-Overhead-Crane', NULL, 'portal/20260511/65c2006327419af379fe1afbd25b2eb2.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/65c2006327419af379fe1afbd25b2eb2.webp\",\"name\":\"euro-single-girder-crane1.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/0322e4956f18bdb975e305d68bbe3959.webp\",\"name\":\"FEM-DIN-Single-Girder-Overhead-Crane_(2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/9415793738353a83f4476d5eec795a44.webp\",\"name\":\"FEM-DIN-Single-Girder-Overhead-Crane_(3).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/bb9e7a69e8257fe27c87b599384a079b.webp\",\"name\":\"FEM-DIN-Single-Girder-Overhead-Crane_(4).webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '1t-10t', '6~12m', '7.5m-22.5m or other', '', 'A5', 'FEM/DIN single girder overhead crane is widely used in machinery manufacturing, metallurgy, ports, rail stations and warehouses.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;This single girder overhead crane is designed and manufactured according to advanced FEM/DIN standard. FEM/DIN single girder overhead crane has compact structure with small wheel pressure, which efficiently uses limited space in workshops to reduce structure investment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:12px 0 0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;FEM/DIN single girder overhead crane is widely used in machinery manufacturing, metallurgy, ports, rail stations and warehouses to supply more efficient logistic solutions, especially suitable for the places need precise positioning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Mechanisms --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Mechanisms of FEM/DIN Single Girder Overhead Crane&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Computer optimized design of box-typed main girder, the full length of web plate is cut and formed through numerical control and its deflection is accurate.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Low clearance structure of trolley and reasonable size of hook allowing the crane wide application scope.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Arc wheels or flat wheels, anti-friction bearings, honey-typed buffers and anti-derailment devices.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Three-in-one motor drive, steeples speed control, hardened reducer, safety disc brake.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Good performance, runs smoothly with the steeples speed control&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shot blasting grade reaches Sa2.5 after welding and releasing internal stresses to insure the best performance of main girder.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Painting epoxy zinc-rich primer, and the thickness of oil film is 140 μm.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
