&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 28px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Customized FEM/DIN Single Girder Overhead Crane Solutions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane provides fully customized FEM/DIN Single Girder Overhead Crane solutions designed for standard light and medium-duty industrial workshop and warehouse operations, offering high lifting capacity, precise handling, and reliable performance for conventional workpiece and industrial material management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Key parameters such as &lt;strong&gt;lifting capacity, span, lifting height, and rail gauge&lt;/strong&gt; can be flexibly adjusted to suit different factory layouts and light &amp;amp; medium-duty lifting requirements, ensuring efficient and safe operations that comply with FEM and DIN industrial standards.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
