olspan=&quot;6&quot;&gt;A5&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb;&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;td&gt;Power&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td colspan=&quot;6&quot;&gt;380V, 50Hz or Other&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr&gt;\\n&lt;td&gt;Temperature of Working Environment&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td colspan=&quot;6&quot;&gt;-20℃ ~ +40℃&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tbody&gt;\\n&lt;\\/table&gt;&lt;\\/div&gt;\\n&lt;\\/div&gt;\"}]', '10000', '0', '1778486176', '1778486544', NULL, '', '', ''),
('160', '28', 'Graphite Electrode Crane', 'Graphite-Electrode-Crane', NULL, 'portal/20260511/8fa9801415863b1c56b06df6319fc8e3.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/4454b302506bf1e1501e647344dd656a.webp\",\"name\":\"Graphite-electrode-bridge-crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/8fa9801415863b1c56b06df6319fc8e3.webp\",\"name\":\"Graphite-electrode-EOT-CRANE.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/a2734c14e608907c03e566fddc7b8926.webp\",\"name\":\"Graphite-electrode-overhead-crane.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[{\"parameter_name\":\"Product\",\"parameter_val\":\"Graphite Electrode Crane\"},{\"parameter_name\":\"Application\",\"parameter_val\":\"Graphite Electrode Crane is specially applied in carbon factories and metallurgical enterprises for lifting, transporting and stacking graphite electrodes and carbon raw materials.\"}]', '', '', '', '', '', 'Graphite Electrode Crane is specially applied in carbon factories and metallurgical enterprises for lifting, transporting and stacking graphite electrodes and carbon raw materials.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Graphite electrode crane is a multifunctional overhead crane which can realize the functions of automatic storage of graphite electrodes, graphite grouping, film winding, strings, automatic switching of single and double rows. The lifting part of the crane can realize the overall loading and unloading of single or double rows of multi-specification graphite electrodes. And lifting the furnace cover. It turns the complexity into simplicity. This product improves the product quality of graphite electrodes and truly realizes the efficient production of graphite electrodes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Reasonable structure design; The graphite electrode string device adopts the main and auxiliary hydraulic propulsion device, mobile packing device, automatic drop device, damping roller device, etc., which are flexible and exquisite.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This product is a Weihua\'s original intelligent multi-functional graphite electrode crane, which can meet various specifications of electrode loading and unloading. At the same time, the spreader is equipped with furnace cover hooks that are suitable for furnace cover lifting and transportation to meet various needs of customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The complex spreader of this product is an innovative design, which not only satisfies the loading and unloading of single and double rows of graphite electrodes, but also satisfies the hoisting of the furnace cover. The design structure is cleverly used, and the safety device is set reasonably, which not only satisfies the large tonnage handling, but also satisfies the refined operation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Weihua Technology Center has created an advanced graphite electrode handling crane for this field. This equipment will change the existing graphite electrode preparation method and is a brand-new creativity for the market.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Application --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Application&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua cranes are widely used in machinery, metallurgy, power generation, railways, ports, petroleum, chemical, and other industries, serving key national projects and large enterprises.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/58da1a3619a66cc5afd4a8828cb1ddb4.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
