ing: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;2.8~28&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;Trolley&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;5.2~52&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;5.2~52&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;5~50&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb;&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Max Wheel Load (KN)&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;-&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;-&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;210&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;232&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;280&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Power (KW)&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;-&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;-&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;259&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;253&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;302&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb;&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Recommand Track&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;-&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;-&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;QU80&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;QU80&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;QU100&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;tr&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Power Supply&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;-&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot;&gt;-&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;&quot; colspan=&quot;3&quot;&gt;3-Phase A.C. 50Hz 380V&lt;\\/td&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tr&gt;\\n&lt;\\/tbody&gt;\\n&lt;\\/table&gt;&lt;\\/div&gt;\\n&lt;\\/div&gt;\"}]', '10000', '0', '1778488748', '1778489112', NULL, '', '', ''),
('162', '28', 'Intelligent Quenching Crane', 'Intelligent-Quenching-Crane', NULL, 'portal/20260511/89f7e753b1cb64e2bd40672ef9f6ab72.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/babb11a7d8437b16a5d40dcec16c0b9e.webp\",\"name\":\"intelligent-queching-crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260511\\/89f7e753b1cb64e2bd40672ef9f6ab72.webp\",\"name\":\"intelligent-queching-overhead-crane.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[{\"parameter_name\":\"1\",\"parameter_val\":\"Weihua patented wire rope adjustment device\"},{\"parameter_name\":\"2\",\"parameter_val\":\"Weihua independent patent anti-sway technology\"},{\"parameter_name\":\"3\",\"parameter_val\":\"C-type hook special spreader\"},{\"parameter_name\":\"4\",\"parameter_val\":\"Intelligent Control System\"}]', '', '', '', '', '', 'Intelligent Quenching Crane is exclusively applied in metallurgy, steel mills and heat treatment workshops for intelligent hoisting, quenching and high-temperature process handling of metal workpieces.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Intelligent Quenching Crane is mainly used for hoisting high-temperature profiles or bars and for carrying out the quenching process. After the high-temperature bars are released from the oven, they are transported by a flat car to the designated location. The heat-treatment crane runs in place and lifts the high-temperature bars for heat treatment in quenching pool, finally the bars were lifted and placed to the designated position, and wait for the instruction before proceeding to the next working cycle. The heat bar temperature is 1050℃ and the environment is very hot and humid. The biggest highlight of the entire process is Unmanned operation and Automatic operation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Advantages --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Advantages&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weihua patented wire rope adjustment device:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The lifting mechanism adopts a single-drive double-drum structure to ensure the synchronization of the lifting of the double lifting points and the wire rope adjustment device can be used to quickly level the spreader.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weihua independent patent anti-sway technology:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The whole machine is equipped with rigid guide column and horizontal guide wheel device with anti-sway and precise positioning function.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;C-type hook special spreader:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Equipped with special spreader for quenching C-shaped hooks. Multiple C-shaped hooks are equipped with detachable pin assembly. The connection position is set on the side. Maintenance is convenient and the lifting space is effectively improved.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Intelligent Control System:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The control system is equipped with wireless remote control and ground pendant control. It uses famous-brand wireless communication equipment to realize the information interaction between the remote-control station and the driving. It has remote control and fully automatic control modes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-precision positioning:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The positioning system uses an absolute encoder and position detection switch to automatically correct to avoid accumulated errors and achieve high-precision positioning.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Safe and efficient:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The control system receives the commands sent by the host system to realize full-automatic operation. It has functions such as stable handling, light lifting, rapid quenching, and anti-collision.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Application --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Application&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua cranes are widely used in machinery, metallurgy, power generation, railways, ports, petroleum, chemical, and other industries, serving key national projects and large enterprises.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/58da1a3619a66cc5afd4a8828cb1ddb4.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Water Conservancy And Hydropower&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;The dam-top gantry crane is installed on the top of a hydropower station dam. It is mainly used for gate lifting and material handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/53f8e47cb680e45180638afe05fd7034.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Wind Power Industry&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Weihua cranes are widely used in offshore wind power projects, especially for wind turbine installation and large component handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/7c19456728d86c85236af98f565ce874.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Shipyard Cranes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Shipyard gantry cranes are designed for shipbuilding operations, including section lifting, turning, assembly, and launching.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px; position: relative; min-height: 350px; overflow: hidden; background: url(\'/upload/default/20260424/4a0f53f988ee6f3023455792bf0a34c6.webp\') center/cover no-repeat; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;position: absolute; left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 25px; color: #fff;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Steel Mill Cranes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Weihua metallurgical cranes are used in steel mills covering lifting needs from smelting to finished product handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 20px 10px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 450px; min-width: 300px; background: #f3f3f3; padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;default/20260424/cd61e7f2b73f4a62799b48c3bc88092f.png&quot; alt=&quot;Brand Reputation&quot; style=&quot;width: 64px; height: 64px; object-fit: contain; margin-bottom: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 14px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Brand Reputation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;&quot;&gt;Weihua Cranes ranks among the top sellers in China\'s crane industry, boasting high brand awareness and market share. Its products are widely used in numerous national key projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 450px; min-width: 300px; background: #f3f3f3; padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;default/20260424/467d4a2a355a54ca0f34d80317b858ba.png&quot; alt=&quot;Full Service&quot; style=&quot;width: 64px; height: 64px; object-fit: contain; margin-bottom: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 14px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Full Service&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;&quot;&gt;Weihua provides a one-stop service, encompassing consultation and planning, solution design, installation, and localized technical support worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 450px; min-width: 300px; background: #f3f3f3; padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;default/20260424/afcfb65440a841b405fc0f9ce44b8ae1.png&quot; alt=&quot;Excellent Product Quality&quot; style=&quot;width: 64px; height: 64px; object-fit: contain; margin-bottom: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 14px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Excellent Product Quality&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane employs automated production lines and precision machining equipment. Key components are sourced from well-known domestic and international brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
