('166', '28', 'LDZ Single Girder Overhead Crane with Grab', 'LDZ-Single-Girder-Overhead-Crane-with-Grab', NULL, 'portal/20260522/4d5c6853ceba5f90f0836369835ec676.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260522\\/4d5c6853ceba5f90f0836369835ec676.webp\",\"name\":\"ldz-grab-crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/1c0b6fcb2e8b764fc1f428ded542afa4.webp\",\"name\":\"ldz-grab-crane1 (1).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/4cd0da2d0b91babec8d67ce279f4ba06.webp\",\"name\":\"grab-crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/449639b997a432e05d60a79923d68d00.webp\",\"name\":\"ldz-grab-crane1.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[{\"parameter_name\":\"Working temperature\",\"parameter_val\":\"-20℃ ~ 40℃\"},{\"parameter_name\":\"Volume of grabs\",\"parameter_val\":\" 0.75m³, 1m³, 1.5m³and 2.5m³.\"}]', '10t', '18m', '7.5m ~ 22.5m', '', 'A4', 'LDZ Single Girder Overhead Crane with Grab is widely used in power plants, bulk material yards and industrial workshops for grabbing and transporting coal, sand and other loose bulk materials.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;This single girder overhead crane with grab is usually used to grab and lift common materials with work duty not more than A4.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Technical Parameters --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Technical Parameters&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lifting capacity: 10t&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Span: 7.5m ~ 22.5m&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Working temperature: -20℃ ~ 40℃&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Relative humidity ≦ 85%&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Working materiel density: 0.6 ~ 2.9 t/m³&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Volume of grabs: 0.75m³, 1m³, 1.5m³and 2.5m³&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Key Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Key Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Two electric hoists are equipped on this crane, one works as lifting mechanism, another one works as open-and-close mechanism. This single girder overhead crane with grab has advantages of compact structure, beautiful exterior, convenient for operating, economical and practical. And it\'s a perfect small equipment to grab materials.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Applications --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Applications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua cranes are widely used in machinery, metallurgy, power generation, railways, ports, petroleum, chemical, and other industries, serving key national projects and large enterprises.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
