('175', '28', 'Chain Bucket Unloader Crane', 'Chain-Bucket-Unloader-Crane', NULL, 'portal/20260512/43e131ac01368f07deb126ab65cb8ae2.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/43e131ac01368f07deb126ab65cb8ae2.webp\",\"name\":\"chain-bucket-coal-handling-crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/43e131ac01368f07deb126ab65cb8ae2.webp\",\"name\":\"chain-bucket-coal-handling-crane.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[{\"parameter_name\":\"Product Name\",\"parameter_val\":\"Chain Bucket Unloader Crane\"}]', '500t/h', '', '', '', '', 'Chain Bucket Unloader Crane is mainly used at ports, thermal power plants and bulk cargo terminals for continuous unloading and handling of coal, ore and other bulk materials.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Chain Bucket Unloader Crane is an overhead crane with a special chain bucket unloader device for the unloading of particle bulk materials from trucks. The materials can be coal, gypsum, shale, iron ore, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:12px 0 0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bulk Material Size:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Coal and gypsum: ≤300mm, ≤100mm accounted for more than 85%, moisture content ≤13&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:12px 0 0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;2. Shale: ≤150mm, ≤80 accounts for more than 85%&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:12px 0 0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;3. Iron ore: ≤80mm, ≤50mm accounted for more than 85%&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Key Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Features of Chain Bucket Unloader Crane&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The unloading capacity can reach 500t/h, and it can unload about 5 sections of 60 tons of wagons per hour.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The upper and lower double girder structure is adopted, and the tipping bucket mechanism is mobile, which can work on multiple transportation lines.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The chain bucket mechanism is a T-shaped bucket, which can unload the material in forward and reverse directions, improving the unloading efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Traveling reducer has the characteristics of small size, large output torque and long service life.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The blanking device of the belt conveyor adopts a sealed telescopic slip tube to reduce dust during the belt blanking process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;It is equipped with overload limiter, lifting height limiter, trolley buffer, running stroke limiter and safety shield, etc., with excellent safety performance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Product Scope &amp; Customization --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Product Scope &amp;amp; Customization&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua bulk material handling equipment can be material conveying equipment and port loading/unloading equipment, which serves in the field of mining, coal, water conservancy and hydropower, transportation, ports, petrochemicals, cement, metallurgy, thermal power, municipal engineering, construction sand, etc. Various product forms such as gantry type and bridge type can be customized according to customer requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Applications --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Applications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua cranes are widely used in machinery, metallurgy, power generation, railways, ports, petroleum, chemical, and other industries, serving key national projects and large enterprises.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
