('176', '28', 'Double Girder Overhead Crane with Electric Hoist', 'Double-Girder-Overhead-Crane-with-Electric-Hoist', NULL, 'portal/20260512/abab46ee995d09050ed9119af47cc446.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/abab46ee995d09050ed9119af47cc446.webp\",\"name\":\"double-girder-overhead-crane-hoist.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/7fb641139e6004d953a219782bda7d32.webp\",\"name\":\"Hoist-Double-Girder-Overhead_Crane_(1).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/e004a11d9c42e5533af3a402ee41ac22.webp\",\"name\":\"Hoist-Double-Girder-Overhead_Crane_(2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/8d7dcdbb3120f4580bb006fee2abb4ac.webp\",\"name\":\"Hoist-Double-Girder-Overhead_Crane_(3).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/22e69140df604393a0dd657d0869bbe5.webp\",\"name\":\"Hoist-Double-Girder-Overhead_Crane_(4).webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '5t-50t', '6m-24m', '10.5m-31.5m or othe', '', 'A4 A5', 'Double Girder Overhead Crane with Electric Hoist is widely used in machinery factories, warehouses and industrial workshops for routine heavy goods lifting and material transportation.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;This double girder overhead crane with electric hoist is for lifting 5t~50t stuff. It\'s very convenient to install in new or existing workshops. This overhead crane is easy to operate with various functions. With the advantages of compact structure, light weight and high lifting height, double girder overhead crane with electric hoist is widely used in workshops, metallurgy, warehouses and assembly shops etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:12px 0 0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua double girder overhead crane with electric hoist has beautiful box-typed welded main girders. Computer optimized design for main girders with good performance and light weight. And the span reaches 40 meters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Mechanism --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Mechanism&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Double main girders, box-type shaped by welding;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;High quality carbon steel Q235B and Q345B;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Double girder connected by high strength screws;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welding seams are tested by X-ray and ultrasound;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Forged wheels;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compact structure, small volume and light weight trolley;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lifting mechanism is open type winch trolley;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compact reducer motor drive, step less control, hardened gears and safety disc brake;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Good operation performance, step less speed regulating and running smoothly;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Main girders Shot blasting sa2.5 after welding to release internal stresses;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Painting high quality epoxy zinc-rich primer, and the thickness of oil film is 140μm;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Safety Protection Devices --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Safety Protection Devices&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Overload limiter, limit switch (lifting and traveling), interlocking protection devices, buffer, track sweep plate, shield, bus bar protection board, anti-collision device, main disconnecting switch, emergency stop system and motor overload protection.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Applications --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Applications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua cranes are widely used in machinery, metallurgy, power generation, railways, ports, petroleum, chemical, and other industries, serving key national projects and large enterprises.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
