&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 450px; min-width: 300px; background: #f3f3f3; padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;default/20260424/afcfb65440a841b405fc0f9ce44b8ae1.png&quot; alt=&quot;Excellent Product Quality&quot; style=&quot;width: 64px; height: 64px; object-fit: contain; margin-bottom: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 14px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Excellent Product Quality&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane employs automated production lines and precision machining equipment. Key components are sourced from well-known domestic and international brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 450px; min-width: 300px; background: #f3f3f3; padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;default/20260424/6f13f30218a6f6354b3e729b620a1090.png&quot; alt=&quot;High Safety&quot; style=&quot;width: 64px; height: 64px; object-fit: contain; margin-bottom: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 14px; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;High Safety&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;&quot;&gt;Weihua Lifting strictly adheres to international standards such as GB and FEM. Key structures adopt high safety factors to ensure precise operation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Title --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 28px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Customized Insulation Overhead Crane Solutions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua Crane provides fully customized Insulation Overhead Crane solutions designed for electrolytic aluminum, electrolytic copper and non-ferrous metallurgical operations, offering high lifting capacity, precise handling, and reliable performance for electrolytic cell equipment and raw material management under high-voltage working conditions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Key parameters such as &lt;strong&gt;lifting capacity, span, lifting height, and rail gauge&lt;/strong&gt; can be flexibly adjusted to suit different plant layouts and special anti-electric lifting requirements, ensuring efficient and safe operations in high-voltage and corrosive industrial environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Configurations --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Optional Configurations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Electric or hybrid drive trolley options&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Automated control and remote operation system&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anti-sway and positioning system for precise metallurgical material handling&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Energy-saving drive systems and regenerative braking&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Customized design to match specific metallurgical workshop rail layouts&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Summary --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-left: 5px solid #22c55e; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #374151;&quot;&gt;Our engineering team ensures &lt;strong&gt;high efficiency, safety, and long-term reliability&lt;/strong&gt;, providing advanced insulation hoisting solutions for modern non-ferrous electrolysis and metallurgical production workshops.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '{\"input\":{\"lifting_capacity\":\"Capacity\",\"lifting_height\":\"Lifting Height\",\"span\":\"Span\",\"operating_voltage\":\"Voltage\\/Hertz\",\"job_level\":\"Working Class\"},\"content\":{\"overview\":\"Product Overview\",\"scenario\":\"Application Scenario\",\"certificate\":\"Certificate\",\"features\":\"Features\",\"customized\":\"Customized\"}}', '[{\"param_content_name\":\"Parameter\",\"param_content_val\":\"&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.6;&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 22px; color: #111; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Technical Specifications&lt;\\/h3&gt;\\n&lt;div style=&quot;overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;table style=&quot;width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;thead&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb;&quot; class=&quot;firstRow&quot;&gt;\\n&lt;th style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-weight: bold; color: #111;&quot;&gt;Lifting Capacity (t)&lt;\\/th&gt;\\n&lt;th style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-weight: bold; color: #111;&quot;&gt;Span (m)&lt;\\/th&gt;\\n&lt;th style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-weight: bold; color: #111;&quot;&gt;Lifting Height (m)&lt;\\/th&gt;\\n&lt;th style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-weight: bold; color: #111;&quot;&gt;Work Duty&lt;\\/th&gt;\\n&lt;th style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-weight: bold; color: #111;&quot;&gt;Main Lifting Speed (m\\/min)&lt;\\/th&gt;\\n&lt;th style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-weight: bold; color: #111;&quot;&gt;Vice Lifting Speed (m\\/min)&lt;\\/th&gt;\\n&lt;th style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-weight: bold; color: #111;&quot;&gt;Crane Traveling Speed (m\\/min)&lt;\\/th&gt;\\n&l