('179', '28', 'Multifunction Crane for Electrolytic Aluminum', 'Multifunction-Crane-for-Electrolytic-Aluminum', NULL, 'portal/20260512/cf2416638e4674e91b4dede75603de7b.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/0518910d5f6e6ff564c6aa8ccfcbdb06.webp\",\"name\":\"Electrolytic-aluminum-cranes_(2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/cf2416638e4674e91b4dede75603de7b.webp\",\"name\":\"electrolytic-aluminum-Overhead-crane1.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/46a298bf974130a27e7d483ac5c2f70c.webp\",\"name\":\"Electrolytic-Aluminum-overhead-crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/b7662f221ab0770bc2ef19bb4ac11e00.webp\",\"name\":\"Electrolytic-aluminum-cranes_(1).webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '20t,40t', '18m', ' 31.5m', '3 phase 50Hz 380V', ' A6-A7', 'Multifunction Crane for Electrolytic Aluminum is specially used in electrolytic aluminum plants for tank overhaul, material transportation and multi-process hoisting operations.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Electrolytic multifunctional cranes are auxiliary equipment for large-scale pre-baked anodic aluminum electrolytic production. Multifunction Crane for Electrolytic Aluminum can meet the environmental requirements and process requirements of high temperature molten salt, high current, strong magnetic field, dusty working site, and complete the process of prebaked anode aluminum operating.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:12px 0 0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Multifunctional Crane for Electrolytic Aluminum is composed of feeding mechanism, slagging mechanism, the anode replace mechanism, shelling mechanism and aluminium discharging mechanism.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Main Functions --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Main Functions of Electrolytic Aluminum Overhead Crane&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shell: Open the electrolyte crust;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Replace the anode: pull out the residual pole, put on a new anode;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Slag: pull out the residual pole, remove blocks in the molten aluminum;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Feeding: add alumina powder and covering material to the groove;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lifting: lifting bus frame.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Click to know more Weihua overhead crane projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Applications --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Applications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua cranes are widely used in machinery, metallurgy, power generation, railways, ports, petroleum, chemical, and other industries, serving key national projects and large enterprises.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
