('180', '28', 'Nuclear Power Plant Crane', 'Nuclear-Power-Plant-Crane', NULL, 'portal/20260512/ea74b8a29b2590b13ab04cad46607fea.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/758d5e4fd2046ecc4a44724353696963.webp\",\"name\":\"nuclear-power-crane(1).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/4ceada12eb02d50d221d79e261f2a3ce.webp\",\"name\":\"nuclear-power-crane1.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/ea74b8a29b2590b13ab04cad46607fea.webp\",\"name\":\"nuclear-power-station-crane1.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '130 t', '10m up rail;30m below rail', '20~24m', '3 phase 50Hz 380V', ' A4', 'Nuclear Power Crane is specially engineered for nuclear power stations, used for reactor equipment installation, maintenance and safe hoisting in nuclear engineering environments.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua provides special cranes for special industry use. The overhead crane for nuclear power is mainly used in nuclear power plant for nuclear power plant construction and nuclear power daily working. It can be used to lift the Steam Generator and Reactor pressure vessel during the nuclear power plant construction. It also employed to handle Pressure vessel top cover, pressing unit, basket, and spent fuel containers during daily working of nuclear power plant.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Key Features --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Key Features of Nuclear Power Crane&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Nuclear power crane can be remote control. It is designed with single fault protection and multiple redundancy protection.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Every drive mechanism has enough Starting torque to ensure safety running in case of one-side bearing Max. wheel load.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Enough Strength calculation of components and enough protection measures for crane structures.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Accurate (±5mm) positioning for trolleys and hoist beam.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;There is 3d positioning display system for ring rail crane to display the exact position of the hook.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Nuclear Power Crane Types --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Nuclear Power Crane Types&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Spent fuel container crane;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Conventional island main crane;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Remote control and NC crane;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Nuclear auxiliary crane;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ring Rail Crane.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Applications of Cranes for Nuclear Power Plant --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Applications of Cranes for Nuclear Power Plant&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lifting of heave machine and parts such as Steam Generator, Pressure vessel top cover, spent fuel containers, Generator rotor, etc.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Handling of Components such as new fuel components, spent fuel components, Control rod components, etc.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Maintenance of the relevant plant parts;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lifting of large structural parts for the construction of nuclear power plant.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:12px 0 0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;The cranes for nuclear power use can 2 kinds: machine parts handling crane and nuclear material handling crane. If your business is special enough and cranes involved, contact us for solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Applications --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Applications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Weihua cranes are widely used in machinery, metallurgy, power generation, railways, ports, petroleum, chemical, and other industries, serving key national projects and large enterprises.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 15px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; justify-content: center;&quot;&gt;
