('183', '28', 'Cleanroom Overhead Crane', 'Cleanroom-Overhead-Crane', NULL, 'portal/20260512/e37afb7551372af8aeae54d7ba3629dc.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/e37afb7551372af8aeae54d7ba3629dc.webp\",\"name\":\"Cleanroom Overhead Crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/d18b95522ec1e303583419ff0ffac690.webp\",\"name\":\"cleanroom_crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/45aabe2f434111081b6bb03a338eb029.webp\",\"name\":\"Cleanroom Crane (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/a35fc9882f61668114748c5f79e895d4.webp\",\"name\":\"Cleanroom Cranes.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/c6d59d8af133d34bf90d123613e72e68.webp\",\"name\":\"Cleanroom Cranes (2).webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260512\\/d467b6a158abfcd069c27aaa96d72257.webp\",\"name\":\"Cleanroom Overhead Cranes.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', '0.5~10t', '6~12m', '7.5~22.5m', '', 'A3、A4、A5', 'Cleanroom overhead cranes are specially designed for dust-free environments, widely used in electronics, pharmaceutical, semiconductor and medical device workshops for precise and pollution-free material handling.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563;&quot;&gt;Cleanroom overhead crane is a specially customized lifting equipment designed strictly for dust-free, sterile and high-purity workshop environments. It adopts fully enclosed structure, non-polluting materials and dust-proof processing technology, perfectly matching ISO 7 / ISO 8 cleanroom standards. Widely applied in occasions requiring zero particle emission, no oil leakage and stable silent operation, the crane realizes safe, precise and efficient material handling inside high-standard clean workshops.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Main Advantages --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:22px; margin-bottom:24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#111827;&quot;&gt;Main Advantages&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:20px; font-size:16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dust-free &amp;amp; Pollution-free Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Fully enclosed drive and electrical system, smooth non-shedding surface coating and sealed running mechanism avoid dust falling and oil contamination, meeting strict cleanroom environmental requirements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stable &amp;amp; Low-noise Operation:&lt;/strong&gt; Equipped with frequency conversion speed regulation system, it features stable start and stop, low impact and low running noise, protecting indoor precision equipment and keeping the workshop environment undisturbed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compact &amp;amp; Space-saving Structure:&lt;/strong&gt; Optimized lightweight girder design with small wheel pressure and compact overall layout, making full use of indoor height and space without affecting cleanroom overall layout and airflow.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High Safety &amp;amp; Reliability:&lt;/strong&gt; Configured with overload protection, limit anti-collision and emergency stop devices; all electrical and mechanical parts adopt high-standard non-polluting accessories to ensure long-term stable and clean operation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customized for Multiple Industries:&lt;/strong&gt; Available in multiple tonnages, spans and lifting heights, it can be tailor-made for semiconductor, pharmaceutical, medical equipment, new energy and laboratory cleanroom working conditions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;', '
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: Arial, Arial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Cleanroom overhead cranes are specially designed for dust-free environments, widely used in electronics, pharmaceutical, semiconductor and medical device workshops for precise and pollution-free material handling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
