('184', '22', 'Clamps Overhead Crane', 'Clamps-Overhead-Crane', NULL, 'portal/20260518/aa06ca8dec1503caa0378f0ac7591675.webp', '[{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260518\\/505c685c054468d81863f8991af871e6.webp\",\"name\":\"clamps-overhead-crane.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260518\\/aa06ca8dec1503caa0378f0ac7591675.webp\",\"name\":\"clamps-overhead-cranes.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260518\\/9bc7a26c2c5cb1bca4b3e14913d1ec6d.webp\",\"name\":\"overhead-crane-with-clamp.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260518\\/4f85b4bb4425196cb03f3f44b4f09a97.webp\",\"name\":\"slab-clamp-overhead-crane-1.webp\"},{\"url\":\"portal\\/20260518\\/3edb3e6d57db4ed2f74600064e67df54.webp\",\"name\":\"slab-clamp-overhead-crane-768x537.webp\"}]', '[{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/95d573c6faa18f16e9292dc67890b0d0.png\",\"name\":\"CCC\"},{\"url\":\"admin\\/20241204\\/b466eef6ed5d62d46e59c6ac814433cc.png\",\"name\":\"CE\"}]', '[]', ' 20t,35t,50t,65t,100t', '30m', ' 40m', '3 phase 50Hz 380V', 'A6-A7', 'The clamp overhead crane is suitable for steel mills, metal processing, and heavy material handling, and can stably clamp and transport various metal workpieces.', '[]', '&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 30px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;
&lt;!-- Overview --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;&quot;&gt;The Clamps Overhead Crane is a professional heavy-duty lifting equipment built for clamping and moving various heavy bulk materials and metal workpieces in industrial sites. It serves as essential handling machinery in material circulation workshops, delivering stable, firm and efficient cargo transfer throughout daily production processes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Description --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Also known as &lt;strong&gt;gripping overhead crane&lt;/strong&gt;, this equipment is professionally configured with durable clamping devices to complete &lt;strong&gt;grabbing, lifting and horizontal moving&lt;/strong&gt; of different solid materials. It greatly simplifies material handling procedures and improves overall workshop operating efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Built for frequent loading work and long-duration running, this crane mainly adopts &lt;strong&gt;A6 to A7 working class&lt;/strong&gt;, perfectly matching regular heavy handling demands. Optimized overall structure and wear-resistant clamping parts ensure steady operation and long service life in ordinary industrial environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Fitted with complete &lt;strong&gt;safety protection devices&lt;/strong&gt; including overload limiter, travel limit device and stable driving system, the clamps overhead crane effectively avoids operational faults. Smooth running control enables accurate material placement, lowering labor cost and boosting working efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Key Specifications --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Lifting Capacity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;5 ton – 100 ton&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Working Duty&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;A6 / A7 Medium Heavy Duty&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Working Environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ordinary factory workshop &amp;amp; warehouse&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Control Method&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Cabin / Ground Handle / Remote Control&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- Application --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #f9fafb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
